<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DEU" style="id">- Selee Old Testament</book>
  <para style="h">1 Mose Kukũ Nɔnle</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mose Kukũ Nɔnle</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mose Kukũ Nɔnle</para>
  <para style="toc3">Deu</para>
  <para style="mt1">MOSE KUKŨ NƆNLE</para>
  <para style="mt2">EE</para>
  <para style="mt1">DEUTERONOMIUM</para>
  <para style="imt">Odiki Otuo</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bk">Mose Kukũ Nɔnle ee Deuteronomium</char> ko mmle lesiisa sɛlaa se di Mose lakakatɛ aata ni Israel batii di Moab kasɔ suoto, di lɛba le baatɛ ni ɔnyɛɛ di ɔkyɛ kaanale wɔ baakyɛ ni di ɔfaafuu, nfɛ bababuo man-yɔ ni Kanaan kasɔ nwu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Sɛlaa finle sewo bɛɛkpana ni di kukũ ko mmle kamɛ ninle nse mmle nɛ: (1) Mose lakple aanyu sɛsaabla kplɛ nwu di alɛɛ afosi-ana ya nitɔbafe ni kamɛ. Aatikiti Israel batii lekoto alɛ banyuma mmle di Yaa lakpaa ma aafenko ni di ɔfaafuu kamɛ, alɛ baakyɔɔ Yaa atoko man-yɔ dibu mantɔɔ ni. (2) Mose lase dibuo di Yaa Afiofa Lefosi nwu kamɛ, aatika difuɔ di Kufiofa Kasale suoto, aatɔkɔ batii nwu alɛ bayɔ suoto lɛma bata SAATE nwu lete. Ni aakple aase afiofa ateate ya nimaklee ni Israel batii nkpa kasɔ didiki di kasɔ ka aabuɛ aatɛ alɛ abata ma ni suoto nɛ. (3) Mose nnyumasa batii nwu di Yaa kanya ninii lɛsɔdiki ku mma, antɔkɔ ma kafɔɔ alɛ base sɛsaabla lɛma nwu ku sisuku nisĩ lɛfɔle lɛbla. (4) Mose lase Yosua fɛ tunletɛ di disi nɔɔ di Yaa batii suoto. Mose lasa onu aanya suoto lɛyɔɔ di Yaa lɛbɔmbɔ suoto. Aata ni Israel batii ana nwu lɛtɔtrɔ aaloo nii, ni di Mose lalaakpi di Moab kasɔ di Yordan Okle kufĩ katunkɔ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kukũ ko mmle disi ɔlaa kplɛ ninle alɛ, Yaa lafũ batii nɔɔ ba aadiki ni nkpa, aata ma kafɔɔ lɛtɔtrɔ, mba ambɔmbɔbɔ nii; dikpeni batii nɔɔ lenyuma nle mmle, bɛɛbɔmbɔ nwɔ, bɛɛkyɔɔ nwɔ atoko, di mmle baawɛ ni nkpa ku sɛkɛɛ ku lɛtɔtrɔ le ninte diesifi nii.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kukũ nwu nkankɔ finle nkle sɛlaa se di Yesu lalɛɛ ni akplɛ-kplɛ di afiofa amuu kamɛ alɛ: “Bɔmbɔ SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ ku otu lɛfɔ omuu ku ɔkla lɛfɔ omuu ku osie lɛfɔ omuu.” (6: 4-6)</para>
  <para style="iot">Kukũ Nwu Kamɛ Sɛlaa</para>
  <para style="io1">Mose lɛkakatɛ kasale 1.1-4.49</para>
  <para style="io1">Mose lɛkakatɛ nyɔɔfa 5.1-26.19</para>
  <para style="io2">a. Afiofa Lefosi nwu 5.1-10.22</para>
  <para style="io2">b. Afiofa, sisuku ku afunaa 11.1-26.19</para>
  <para style="io1">Afiofa di Kanaan kasɔ obuo 27.1-28.68</para>
  <para style="io1">Kanya ninii lese lɛbla 29.1-30.20</para>
  <para style="io1">Mose sɛlaa yɛntɛle 31.1-33.29</para>
  <para style="io1">Mose kukpi 34.1-12</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DEU 1" />
  <para style="s1">Odie Di Horeb Osifi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 1:1" />Nnya sɛlaa se di Mose lakakatɛ aata ni Israel batii bamuu di ɔfaafuu di Yordan kufĩ katunkɔ- nfa ninkpe di Araba- diɛkyɔɔ ni Suf anu, kusi ni di Paran ku Tofel, Laban, Haserot ku Disahab obo. <verse eid="DEU 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 1:2" />(Lefosi dii ninwii man-yɔ mankyɛ diedie ni di Horeb diesifi ni Kades Barnea, nse feefe di Seir Kobokote osuku nɛ.)<verse eid="DEU 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 1:3" />Di dii kasale di lefosi kɔwɛntɛ kasale kamɛ, di alɛɛ afosi-ana kamɛ yi, Mose labuɛ aatɔkɔ Israel batii sɛlaa se simuu di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ nwɔ ni diekye ni suoto lɛma. <verse eid="DEU 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 1:4" />Nle mmle lawa di obe wɔ aalenkee ni Amori batii ɔka Sihon wɔ niatoole ni sɛka di Hesbon, di Edrei lalenkee ni Basan ɔka Og wɔ niatoole ni sɛka di Astarot sɛmaa.<verse eid="DEU 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 1:5" />Mose lakye kasɔ aatoodiki kufiofa ko mmle kasɔ aatɔɔta batii nwu di Yordan kufĩ katunkɔ di Moab kasɔ, aatoobuɛ alɛ:<verse eid="DEU 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 1:6" />SAATE Yaa loo nwu latɔkɔ wo di Horeb alɛ, “Bitoosiɛ biɛklɛ di kobokote ko mmle. <verse eid="DEU 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 1:7" />Bidie di kasiɛkɔ nwu bisifi Amori batii kale lekpenkpe; biesifi batii ba bamuu ninsi ni di Araba, di abokote osi di akpenkpe nkpaa di kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ, di Nkpaalɔ kasɔ ku lekpo kotoko diesifi ni Kanaan batii kasɔ ku Lebanon, diɛlaadu ni Eufrate okle kplɛ nwu. <verse eid="DEU 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 1:8" />Nyu lo, ntɔɔyɔ kasɔ ka mmle lɛta ye. Bitɔɔkyɛ biɛlaayɔ kasɔ ka di SAATE nwu laka ntam alɛ abata ni bate lee- Abraham, Isak ku Yakob- ku banaantii lɛma ba di sɛmaa lɛma.”<verse eid="DEU 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mose Ladiki Batunletɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 1:9" />Di obe nwu kamɛ latɔkɔ ye nlɛ, “Bitoosii atoo nutũle ole ɔtɛɛ alɛ katuka ye lete nii. <verse eid="DEU 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 1:10" />SAATE Yaa lee ntɔɔta ye biɛkpɛ, alɛ miɛ bitɔɔpɔ fɛ awɛntrɛbi di kolo. <verse eid="DEU 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 1:11" />SAATE nwu, bawa lee Yaa ata ye bikpɛ fɛ akyuu kakpe bikyakaa, aata ye lɛtɔtrɔ fɛ mmle aabuɛ aatɛ ni! <verse eid="DEU 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 1:12" />Kafɔɔ lɛ kamafuo sɛlaa lee ku atoo lee ku dibuɛkpee lee amuu otuka letenii? <verse eid="DEU 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 1:13" />Nioso bidiki basuɔtɔ banumbentɛ bawo, mannu ni sɛlaa kasɔ, mambu ma ni kafɔɔ di ana lee biala kamɛ, nin-yɔ ma mbla batunletɛ di suoto lee.”<verse eid="DEU 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 1:14" />Ni biabuɛ bilɛ, “Kɔkpaa ko feediki ni nlɛ.”<verse eid="DEU 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 1:15" />Nioso lafũ basuɔtɔ batunletɛ di ana lee ya niabe ni anu, mambu ma nii, ni lata ma nlɛ bawɛ osie di suoto lee- fɛ kanyabayilatɛ di batii nkpe, alafa, afosi-anɔɔ ku afosi kanya, fɛ ana nwu banɔɔfotii. <verse eid="DEU 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 1:16" />Ni latɔkɔ bakantɛ lee di obe nwu kamɛ nlɛ: Binu kɔlɛɛfuii ko ninsi ni di babilee ntɛɛ, biɛka lɛka di onukwale kanya, kuntɛ ɔlaa nwu nsi di Israel batii bamu ntɛɛ ee onwii lɛma ku ɔfɔɔ ntɛɛ. <verse eid="DEU 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 1:17" />Bitannyu otii kuonwii di anu biakanko; binu akyuu nwu anyɔ, banɔɔfo ee babisɔ kyɛkyɛ. Bitanyɛkɛ otii kuonwii, diekye Yaa lele ninle lɛkanko. Biyɔ ɔlaa lele ninkpe osie kulenke ye biwakoe, ni ami kamanu nwu nta ye. <verse eid="DEU 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 1:18" />Di obe nwu kamɛ latɔkɔ ye lɛsaa biala dikpeni biɛbla nii.<verse eid="DEU 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baakpee Batii Baakyɛ Kades Barnea Alɛ Baalaala Kasɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 1:19" />Nioso, fɛ mmle di SAATE Yaa loo latɔkɔ wo nii, buadie di Horeb Kobokote buakyɔɔ anu Amori batii kale lekpenkpe buafe di difu ɔfaafuu foo nwu omuu bitɔɔnya nii, nioso bualaadu Kades Barnea. <verse eid="DEU 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 1:20" />Ninfɛ latɔkɔ ye nlɛ, “Bitoodu Amori batii kale lekpenkpe le di SAATE Yaa loo kɔyɔ anta wo nii. <verse eid="DEU 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 1:21" />Nyu, SAATE Yaa lee ntɔɔyɔ kasɔ nwu ɛɛta ye. Bikata biɛlaayɔ ka, fɛ mmle di SAATE, bawa lee Yaa latɔkɔ ye ni. Bitanyɛkɛ; bitanta nnɛɛ lafee ye.”<verse eid="DEU 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 1:22" />Ninfɛ di bamuu lee biawa biabatɔkɔ mi bilɛ, “Bita bukpee basuɔtɔ bawo baale katũ baalaala kasɔ nwu bata wo, baakple babatɔkɔ wo osuku wɔ bubafe ni ku sekpoo se bubadu ni.”<verse eid="DEU 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 1:23" />Ɔlaa nwu lalɛ mi onu; nioso ladiki lefosi banyɔ lee, osuɔtɔ onwii, onwii lakye kɔna biala kamɛ. <verse eid="DEU 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 1:24" />Ni baasifi baalaakata baabuo lekpenkpe kale nwu, baalaadu Eskol Ɔtaata nwu, baafenfe baanyu kasɔ nwu. <verse eid="DEU 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 1:25" />Baayɔ kasɔ nwu awosobi awo baawako wo, ni baabatɔkɔ wo alɛ, “Kasɔ biene kale di, SAATE Yaa loo kɔyɔ anta wo.”<verse eid="DEU 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔtaka Oyila Di SAATE Nwu Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 1:26" />Kafɔɔ bitatootuna bilɛ biɔlaayɔ kasɔ nwu; biataka biayila di SAATE Yaa lee ɔlaa nwu suoto. <verse eid="DEU 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 1:27" />Bianwununuu di akpaayo lee kamɛ bilɛ, “SAATE nwu lekyidi wo; nioso ɛɛkpaa wo eedieko di Egipte kasɔ alɛ ɔɔbayɔ wo ankpee di Amori batii nnɛɛ manwɔɔsa wo nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 1:28" />Ɔfɛ nfɛ bubakyɛ? Babiloo ba nialala ni kasɔ nwu ntɔɔta otu loo lɛkpa. Beebuɛ alɛ, ‘Batii nwu nkpe osie, bɛɛkaana kafɔɔ balenke wo; sekpoo kplɛ lɛma lemuɔ ku seyoyiɛ takale siedu ni kolo. Bia buanya Anak batii ninfa.’”<verse eid="DEU 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 1:29" />Ninfɛ latɔkɔ ye nlɛ, “Bitanta difu lapɛ ye; ni bitanyɛkɛ ma. <verse eid="DEU 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 1:30" />SAATE Yaa lee wɔ ninleko ye ni katũ kamakpɛ anta ye, fɛ mmle aabla aata ye ni di Egipte, bianya ni ku anu lee amu, <verse eid="DEU 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 1:31" />di ɔfaafuu kamɛ. Nfa bianya mmle di SAATE Yaa lee lakunu ye ni, fɛ mmle di kote nkunu ni obi nɔɔ, di osuku wɔ omuu biakyɛ ni, diabase ni di obe wɔ biabadu ni lɛba le mmle.”<verse eid="DEU 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 1:32" />Bia di nle mmle lete oso, bitafũ SAATE Yaa lee bianu, <verse eid="DEU 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 1:33" />nnwɔ nialeko ye ni katũ di osuku lee ɔkyɛ, di ɔtɔ ku kakyɛ, kakũ kafɔɔ di lelokonkyɛ kamɛ, aatoomiɛ ni aba ya bibasiɛ ni, antuo ye ni kafɔɔ osuku wɔ biafe nii.<verse eid="DEU 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 1:34" />Di SAATE nwu lanu ni ɔlaa wɔ biabuɛ nii, ɔblɔ lafiɛ nwɔ ni aaka ntam osie kanya alɛ: <verse eid="DEU 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 1:35" />“Otii kuonwii di lɛkyɛ kpile le mmle kamɛ dilɔbanya kasɔ biene ka laka ntam nlɛ kamata ni bawa lee, <verse eid="DEU 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 1:36" />diediki Yefune obisuɔtɔbi Kaleb lete. Nnwɔɔ abanya ka, kamayɔ kafɔɔ kasɔ nwu abase ni kɔkpaa ntɔɔ manko banaantii nɔɔ, diekye aatikanko SAATE nwu ku otu nɔɔ omuu.”<verse eid="DEU 1:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 1:37" />Ta aye oso SAATE nwu lanya ɔblɔ kafɔɔ akpeeko mi aabuɛ alɛ, “Afɔ kafɔɔ flɔbabuo kasɔ nwu. <verse eid="DEU 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 1:38" />Kafɔɔ kyakaakotɛ lɛfɔ Nun obisuɔtɔbi, Yosua kamabuo kasɔ nwu. Kpee nwɔ osie, diekye nnwɔɔ nimaleko Israel batii katũ manaale kasɔ nwu asaa nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 1:39" />Babisɔ lee nwu kafɔɔ biobuɛ bilɛ babamufũ mansifiko ni sɛlanle kamɛ, babi lee nwu ninaditofo ni dibiene ku dikpile- mma nimabuo kasɔ nwu nɛ. Kamayɔ ka nta ma, mma kafɔɔ babayɔ ka, kambla kale ma. <verse eid="DEU 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 1:40" />Kafɔɔ aye yi, bimunikĩi biɛkyɔɔ ɔfaafuu anu diofe ni Lekpo Sɛɛle lɛkyɛ.”<verse eid="DEU 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 1:41" />Ninfɛ biabuɛ bilɛ, “Buɔbla okpile di SAATE nwu suoto. Bubakata munkyɛ munaakpɛ kakpɛ di kasɔ nwu suoto, fɛ mmle di SAATE Yaa loo lediki wo ni kanya.” Nioso otii biala layɔ akpɛsaa nɔɔ aakpakũ, baanyu alɛ diɛyɔɔ babakata mankyɛ ni lekpenkpe kale nwu.<verse eid="DEU 1:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 1:42" />Kafɔɔ SAATE nwu latɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Tɔkɔ ma falɛ, ‘Bitankata biakyɛ osi nwu bialaakpɛ, diekye namayilaye kamaa. Balo lee kamalenkee ye.’”<verse eid="DEU 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 1:43" />Nioso latɔkɔ ye, kafɔɔ bitanu. Biataka biayila di SAATE nwu kanya didiki suoto, ni di lɛkanta lee kanya biakata biasifi lekpenkpe kale nwu nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 1:44" />Ni di Amori batii ba niasiɛ ni di akpenkpe nwu ladie babadieko ye nɛ; baatikanko ye fɛle banwakɛ ɔlambu baalenkee ye diayɔ ni di Seir baalaadu Horma. <verse eid="DEU 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 1:45" />Ni biakple biawa biabawi di SAATE nwu anu nɛ, kafɔɔ aakpaa atoko aafuusa, atakyɔɔ kaku diwi lee nwu atoko.<verse eid="DEU 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 1:46" />Nioso biasiɛ di Kades ayi kpinwu- biasiɛ ninfa obe nwu omuu.<verse eid="DEU 1:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DEU 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔkyɛ Okyikyii Di Ɔfaafuu Kamɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 2:1" />Ninfɛ buakple nkpaamaa buakyɔɔ anu ɔfaafuu buafe di Lekpo Sɛɛle osuku, fɛ mmle di SAATE nwu lakyɔɔ mi ni kɔnɛɛ nɛ. Diekye buakyɛ buakyi Seir kale lekpenkpe nwu diaklɛ.<verse eid="DEU 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 2:2" />Ni di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ mi alɛ, <verse eid="DEU 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 2:3" />“Bitɔɔkyɛ biekyi lekpenkpe kale ka mmle diɛklɛ; nunua bimunikĩi di katoo-kasɔ. <verse eid="DEU 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 2:4" />Tɔkɔ batii nwu sɛlaa se mmle falɛ: ‘Nfɛ bibafe di babilee-suɔtɔbi Esau banantii kasɔ suoto, mba ninsi ni di Seir. Babayɛkɛ ye, kafɔɔ bilolaa binyu nwaa. <verse eid="DEU 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 2:5" />Bitankpee ma ɔblɔ kakpɛ lawa, diekye namata ye kasɔ lɛma nwu kukanwii, bia kaapɔ biase ni kɔkpaa lee. Lɛyɔ Seir lekpenkpe kale nwu lɛta Esau fɛ kale nwɔ kamu. <verse eid="DEU 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 2:6" />Bita ma koto di koto-fututu kamɛ di alesaa ya biele ni ku ntu be bienyi ni.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 2:7" />SAATE Yaa lee ntɔɔta ye lɛtɔtrɔ di nnɛɛ lee ɔkpɛ omuu kamɛ. Aanyu ye di osuku lee ɔkyɛ di ɔfaafuu foo wɔ mmle kamɛ. Di alɛɛ afosi-ana ya mmle SAATE Yaa lee ntoosiɛko ye, lɛsalɛsaa kafɔɔ ditafĩ ye.<verse eid="DEU 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 2:8" />Nioso buakyɛ bualaawaalɛ babiloo-suɔtɔbi Esau banantii ba ninsi ni di Seir buafe. Buadiɛ Araba osuku wɔ niakye ni Elat ku Esion Geber osi nwu, buafe di Moab ɔfaafuu osuku buasifi.<verse eid="DEU 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 2:9" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Bitankpee Moab batii kubuɛ ee biakpee ma ɔblɔ kakpɛ lawa, diekye namata ye kasɔ lɛma nwu lɛba kukanwii. Ntɔɔyɔ Ar lɛta Lot banantii fɛ kalekɔ lɛma.”<verse eid="DEU 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 2:10" />(Obe nwu Emi batii niasiɛ ninfa- batii nwu lawɛ osie, baapɔ baakaana fɛ Anak batii. <verse eid="DEU 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 2:11" />Fɛle Anak batii yi, baanya ma fɛ Refait batii okle, kafɔɔ Moab batii nlɛɛ ma alɛ Emi batii. <verse eid="DEU 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 2:12" />Saa yi, Hori batii niasiɛ di Seir, kafɔɔ Esau banantii latososa ma. Baawɔɔsa Hori batii di anu lɛma, ni baasiɛ di kasiɛkɔ lɛma, fɛ mmle di Israel batii labla ni di kasɔ ka di SAATE nwu lata ma ni fɛ kalekɔ lɛma nɛ.)<verse eid="DEU 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 2:13" />Ni di SAATE nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Kanunua bitaka biɛlaawaalɛ Sered Ɔtaata nwu.” Nioso bualaawaalɛ ɔtaata nwu.<verse eid="DEU 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 2:14" />Afosi-atiɛ alɛɛ anɛ lafe diayɔ ni di obe wɔ buadie ni di Kades Barnea dialaase ni di obe wɔ buawaalɛ ni Sered Ɔtaata nwu. Di obe nwu kamɛ, basuɔtɔ ba bamuu nikakpɛ ni kakpɛ ntookpi beedie di kasiɛkɔ nwu kamɛ, fɛ mmle di SAATE nwu laka ni ntam aata ma nii. <verse eid="DEU 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 2:15" />SAATE nwu kɔnɛɛ lataka di suoto lɛma dialaase di obe wɔ aalo ni bamuu lɛma aaloo ni di kasiɛkɔ nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="DEU 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 2:16" />Di obe wɔ di basuɔtɔ bakpɛtɛ yɛntɛle ba mmle di batii nwu kamɛ ntookpi nii yi, <verse eid="DEU 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 2:17" />SAATE nwu latɔkɔ mi alɛ, <verse eid="DEU 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 2:18" />“Miɛ fabafe di Moab kasɔ di Ar. <verse eid="DEU 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 2:19" />Nse biɛbadu Amon batii nfũ yi, bitankpee ma kubuɛ ee biakpee ma ɔblɔ kakpɛ lawa, diekye namata ye kasɔ lɛba kukanwii ninle ni Amon batii kale. Ntɔɔyɔ ka lɛta Lot banantii fɛ kalekɔ lɛma.”<verse eid="DEU 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 2:20" />(Nka kafɔɔ baanya ka fɛ Rafait batii kasɔ, baasiɛ ni ninfa saa; kafɔɔ Amon batii nlɛɛ ma Samsum batii. <verse eid="DEU 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 2:21" />Baale batii ba niawɛ ni osie, baapɔ ni, baakaana ni fɛ Anak batii. Kafɔɔ SAATE nwu lawɔɔsa ma di Amon batii anu, baatososa ma, ni baasiɛ di kasiɛkɔ lɛma nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 2:22" />Nkpo kafɔɔ di SAATE nwu labla aata Esau banantii ba niasiɛ ni di Seir, di obe wɔ aawɔɔsa ni Hori batii di anu lɛma nɛ. Baatososa ma, ni basi di kasiɛkɔ lɛma diɛbase bia miɛ nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 2:23" />Kafɔɔ Awi batii ba niasiɛ ni di sekpooenyii nwu baalaadu ni Gasa yi, Kaftor batii ba niakye ni Kaftor lawɔɔsa ma, ni baasiɛ di kasiɛkɔ lɛma nɛ.)<verse eid="DEU 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 2:24" />“Bitaka nunua biɛlaataalɛ Arnon Okplo kyofole. Binyu, ntɔɔyɔ Amori otii nwu, Hesbon ɔka Sihon ku kale nɔɔ lekpee ye ninnɛɛ. Bikpɛ ko nwɔ kakpɛ biekye kasɔ bitoofũ kasɔ nwu. <verse eid="DEU 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 2:25" />Miɛ dii le mmle makye kasɔ nta suoto lee difu ku lɛyɛkɛ mpɛ nnle mmuu di kolo kalɔ. Babanu suoto lee ɔlaa mantũtũkũ ku lɛyɛkɛ ta aye oso.”<verse eid="DEU 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Batii Lalenkee Hesbon Ɔka Sihon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 2:26" />Lakpee batɔkyɛntɛ baakye Kedemot ɔfaafuu baakyɛ Hesbon ɔka Sihon nfũ, latɔɔ ni atoko ɔkyɛ ole sɛlaa nlɛ, <verse eid="DEU 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 2:27" />“Ta wo bubuo bufe di kale lɛfɔ. Bubafe di osuku kplɛ suoto lete; bulɔbakɛ bufe oletanɛɛkyɛ ee ɔmɛntukyɛ. <verse eid="DEU 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 2:28" />Sunsũ alesaa ya bubale ni ku ntu be bubanyi ni fata wo di koto fututu kɔya kanya. Ta wo bubuo bufe ku nkpaa lete- <verse eid="DEU 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 2:29" />fɛ mmle di Esau banantii ba ninsi ni di Seir, ku Moab batii ba ninsi ni di Ar, labla baata wo ni- dialaase ni di obe wɔ buataalɛ ni Yordan buabuo ni kasɔ ka di SAATE Yaa loo kɔyɔ anta wo ni.” <verse eid="DEU 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 2:30" />Kafɔɔ Hesbon ɔka Sihon lasĩ, atata wo buabuo buafe. Diekye SAATE Yaa lee lata ninwuna nɔɔ lawɛ otokopĩ, otu nɔɔ kafɔɔ lawɛ osie alɛ ɔɔyɔ nwɔ ankpee di nnɛɛ lee, fɛ mmle atɔɔbla ni kanunua.<verse eid="DEU 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 2:31" />Ni di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Nyu, ntookye kasɔ kɔyɔ Sihon ku kale nɔɔ nkpee fɔ ninnɛɛ. Kanunua kye kasɔ faalenkee nwɔ faafũ kasɔ nɔɔ nwu.”<verse eid="DEU 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 2:32" />Obe wɔ di Sihon ku bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ bamuu ladie baawa babadieko wo ni kakpɛ di Yahas yi, <verse eid="DEU 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 2:33" />SAATE Yaa loo layɔ nwɔ aakpee wo ninnɛɛ, bualo nwɔ ku babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ ku bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ bamuu buatɛ. <verse eid="DEU 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 2:34" />Di obe nwu kamɛ, buafũ sekpoo nɔɔ simuu, buawɔɔsa sĩ klekle- basuɔtɔ, basanko ku babisɔ. Butabu kuonwii lasiɛ nkpa. <verse eid="DEU 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 2:35" />Kafɔɔ babɔkɛɛ sele ku kakpɛ kamɛ asaa lɛma ya buayɔ ni di sekpoo nwu nnya buayɔ buasifiko buata suoto loo. <verse eid="DEU 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 2:36" />Diayɔ ni di Aroer di Arnon Okplo kyofole kotoko, diakple diayɔ ni kafɔɔ di okpoo nwu di kɔwɛ nwu kamɛ, bia dialaadu ni Gilead, okpoo kuonwii ditawɛ kuawɛ ni osie kualenkee wo nii. SAATE Yaa loo layɔ simuu aata wo. <verse eid="DEU 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 2:37" />Kafɔɔ di SAATE Yaa loo ɔlaa kanya didiki yi, bitakpanko Amon batii kasɔ kukanwii, ee kasɔ ka ninte ni di Yabok okle ɔlɔɔkɔ ee nka di akpenkpe sekpoo ɔlɔɔkɔ.<verse eid="DEU 2:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DEU 3" />
  <para style="s1">Israel Batii Lalenkee Ɔka Og</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 3:1" />Semaa, buamunikĩi buakata buafe di osuku buakyɔɔ anu Basan, ni di Basan ɔka Og ku bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ bamuu ladie babakyakako wo ku kakpɛ di Edrei nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 3:2" />Ni di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Tanyɛkɛ nwɔ, diekye ntɔɔyɔ nwɔ ku bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ bamuu ku kasɔ nɔɔ lekpee ninnɛɛ lɛfɔ. Bla nwɔ fɛ mmle faabla ni Amori batii ɔka Sihon wɔ niale ni sɛka di Hesbon.”<verse eid="DEU 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 3:3" />Nioso SAATE Yaa loo layɔ Basan ɔka Og ku bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ bamuu kafɔɔ aakpee ninnɛɛ loo. Bualo bamuu lɛma, kuonwii ditabu aasiɛ nkpa. <verse eid="DEU 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 3:4" />Di obe nwu kamɛ buafũ sekpoo kplɛ nɔɔ nwu simuu. Sekpoo kplɛ afosi-akuɔ nwu kuonwii ditabu alɛ butafũ ni di ɔkyɛ lɛma- Argob kasɔ kamuu, Basan ɔka Og sɛka kalekɔ. <verse eid="DEU 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 3:5" />Baatofo seyoyiɛ takale ku n-yoko ku abɔɔsaa baakyisa sekpoo kplɛ se mmle simuu, sekpoenyii siene kpinwu lawɛ batatofo seyoyiɛ baakyisa nii. <verse eid="DEU 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 3:6" />Buawɔɔsa simuu klekle, fɛ mmle buabla ni Hesbon ɔka Sihon, baawɔɔsa okpoo kplɛ biala- basuɔtɔ, basanko ku babisɔ. <verse eid="DEU 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 3:7" />Kafɔɔ babɔkɛɛ sele bamuu ku kakpɛ kamɛ asaa di sekpoo kplɛ lɛma yi, nnya buayɔ nya buata suoto loo.<verse eid="DEU 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 3:8" />Nioso di obe nwu kamɛ buafũ kasɔ ka di Yordan kufĩ katunkɔ di Amori batii baka ba mmle nnɛɛ, diayɔ ni di Arnon Okplo kyofole dialaadu Hermon Kobokote. <verse eid="DEU 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 3:9" />(Sidon batii nlɛɛ Hermon Kobokote alɛ Sirion; Amori batii nlɛɛ kũ Senir.) <verse eid="DEU 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 3:10" />Buafũ sekpoo se simuu di abokote nsintɛɛ, ku Gilead omuu ku Basan omuu dialaadu Salka ku Edrei, Og sɛka kalekɔ okpoo di Basan. <verse eid="DEU 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 3:11" />(Basan ɔka Og lete niabu di Refait batii nwu yɛntɛle kamɛ. Abɔɔsaa baayɔ baabla mpa nɔɔ, lɛkaana lalenkee lefosi nkpaa ntiɛ, lɛblɛfɛ kafɔɔ labla nkpaa nkuɔ. Diekple diyɛ di Amon batii okpoo wɔ bɔɔlɛɛ ni Raba.)<verse eid="DEU 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anà Ya Niasiɛ Ni Di Yordan Kufĩ Katunkɔ Lɛkyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 3:12" />Di kasɔ ka buafũ ni di obe nwu kamɛ yi, layɔ kasɔ ka di Aroer katoo-kasɔ di Arnon Okplo kyofole ɔlɔɔkɔ lata Ruben batii ku Gad batii, di Gilead lekpenkpe kale nwu kakyɛ ku sɛkpoo nɔɔ nkyakaa nii. <verse eid="DEU 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 3:13" />Layɔ Gilead kasɔ bule ku Basan omuu niale ni Og sɛka kalekɔ nwu kafɔɔ lata Manase kɔna nwu kakyɛ. (Argob kasɔ nwu kamuu di Basan baatɔɔlɛɛ alɛ Refait batii kasɔ nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 3:14" />Manase ɔnantii onwii bɔɔlɛɛ ni Yair, layɔ Argob kasɔ nwu kamuu dialaase di Gesur batii ku Maakat batii kɔmɛ; ni baayɔ leyooto nɔɔ baatika lɛba nwu nɛ. Nioso diɛbase bia miɛ Hawot Yair nfɛ bɔɔlɛɛ Basan.) <verse eid="DEU 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 3:15" />Ni layɔ Gilead kasɔ lata Makir nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 3:16" />Kafɔɔ layɔ kasɔ ka niadie ni di Gilead kaasifi ni Arnon Okplo kyofole nwu lata Ruben batii ku Gad batii (Okplo kyofole nwu ntɛɛ ninle kɔmɛ nɛ) kuadie kualaadu Yabok Okle ninle ni Amon batii kɔmɛ. <verse eid="DEU 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 3:17" />Kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ kɔmɛ niale Yordan di Araba, kuayɔ di Kineret kualaadu Araba Lekpo (Mmba Lekpo nɛ), Pisga kobokote lɛyɔnsa kalɔ.<verse eid="DEU 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 3:18" />Ninfɛ latɔkɔ ye di obe nwu kamɛ nlɛ: “SAATE Yaa lee ntɔɔta ye kasɔ ka mmle alɛ biyɔ bibla kale ye. Kafɔɔ basuɔtɔ basientɛ lee bamuu bayɔ akpɛsaa baataalɛ Yordan Okle baale babilee-suɔtɔbi Israel batii katũ. <verse eid="DEU 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 3:19" />Kafɔɔ basɔfɔ lee, babi lee ku babɔkɛɛ sele lee (n-ye nlɛ bikpe babɔkɛɛ sele kpinwu) mma bawɛ di sekpoo se ntɔɔta ye ni kamɛ, <verse eid="DEU 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 3:20" />dilaase di obe wɔ di SAATE kamata ni babilee-suɔtɔbi ɔnyɛɛ ɔtɛ fɛ mmle ɛɛbla ɛɛta ye ni, alɛ mma kafɔɔ baayɔ kasɔ ka di SAATE Yaa lee kɔyɔ anta ma ni di Yordan Okle sɛmaa. Nni kamaa, obiala lee akple asifi kalekɔ ka ntɔɔta ye ni.”<verse eid="DEU 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Ditata Mose Osuku Aataalɛ Yordan Okle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 3:21" />Di obe nwu nkpo kamɛ latɔkɔ Yosua nlɛ: “Fatɔɔnya ku anu lɛfɔ amu asaa ya amuu di SAATE Yaa loo ntɔɔbla ni baka ba mmle banyɔ. SAATE nwu kamabla nkpo okle di sɛka nlekɔ mmuu di nfũ biofe nii. <verse eid="DEU 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 3:22" />Bitanyɛkɛ ma; SAATE Yaa lee omu kamakpɛ anta ye.”<verse eid="DEU 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 3:23" />Di obe nwu nkpo kamɛ latikiti SAATE lekoto nlɛ: <verse eid="DEU 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 3:24" />“Oo SAATE Kplɛ, fatookye kasɔ footuo kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ nimuɔ kplɛ lɛfɔ ku kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ osie. Diekye ɔmɛ yaa ninkpe di osi ee kasɔ suoto abafuo ni sɛsaabla ku sɛkpɛ kplɛ se fɔɔbla ni ɔbla? <verse eid="DEU 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 3:25" />Tɛɛ nkyɛ ninaanyu kasɔ biene nwu di Yordan sɛmaa- lekpenkpe kale biene nwu nkpo ku Lebanon.”<verse eid="DEU 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 3:26" />Kafɔɔ ta aye oso SAATE nwu lanya ɔblɔ aakpeekoe, ni atanu mi ɔlaa nɛ. Ni di SAATE nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Nninkpo mpɔ, tansinkple faakakatɛkoe di ɔlaa wɔ mmle suoto. <verse eid="DEU 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 3:27" />Kata fakyɛ Pisga Kobokote osi, faanyu kufĩ-kamɛɛkɔ ku katoo-kasɔ ku kala-kasɔ ku kufĩ-katunkɔ. Nyu kasɔ nwu ku anu lɛfɔ amu, diekye flɔbataalɛ Yordan Okle wɔ mmle. <verse eid="DEU 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 3:28" />Kafɔɔ yɔ ɔkpɛ fakpee di Yosua nnɛɛ, faakpee nwɔ osie, faakpee nwɔ kafɔɔ ɔnyɛɛ, diekye nnwɔɔ nimaleko batii ba mmle katũ mantaalɛ, anta ma manaale kasɔ ka fabanya ni nɛ.” <verse eid="DEU 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 3:29" />Nioso buasiɛ di ɔtaata di Bet Peor ɔlɔɔkɔ.<verse eid="DEU 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DEU 4" />
  <para style="s1">Mose Latɔkɔ Israel Batii Alɛ Bakyɔɔ Yaa Atoko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 4:1" />Oo Israel binu, afiofa ku sisuku se nfɛ kamatuo ye ni kanunua. Bitikanko nya di mmle biasiɛ ni nkpa minkyɛ minaayɔ ni kasɔ ka di SAATE, bate lee Yaa kɔyɔ anta ye ni. <verse eid="DEU 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 4:2" />Bitankyakaa ɔlaa kuonwii di kufiofa nwu kɔta ye nii, bitandiki lɛsalɛsaa kafɔɔ kaamɛ, kafɔɔ bile SAATE Yaa lee afiofa ya lɛta ye ni.<verse eid="DEU 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 4:3" />Bianya aye bamu lɛsaa le di SAATE nwu labla ni di Baal Peor. SAATE Yaa lee lawɔɔsa otii biala niatikanko ni Baal Peor di kamɛ lee, <verse eid="DEU 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 4:4" />kafɔɔ aye ba bamuu niamufũ SAATE Yaa lee biaklee ni kpinkpĩ lekple bikpe nkpa bia miɛ.<verse eid="DEU 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 4:5" />Binyu, ntootuo ye afiofa ku sisuku nwu fɛ mmle di SAATE Yaa nii latɔkɔ mi nii, di mmle biatikanko nya ni di kasɔ ka biobuo minaayɔ nii. <verse eid="DEU 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 4:6" />Anu lee atika nya di suoto nwaa, diekye nle mmle nimatuo lɛsaatofo ku lɛsɔnu lee nɛ, nnle mmuu be nimanu ni afiofa ya mmle amuu kamabuɛ alɛ, “Nwaako kale kplɛ ka mmle nle banumbentɛ ku lɛsɔnu batii.” <verse eid="DEU 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 4:7" />Kamɛ nnle bamba niɛtɛ keemuɔ nkpo, alɛ bakpe bayaa lɛma ba niɛtɛɛtɛɛ ma ni fɛ mmle kanya di SAATE Yaa loo lɛtɛɛtɛɛ wo ni, obe lele buɔpɛ ɔlaa buɔtɔɔ ni? <verse eid="DEU 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 4:8" />Kamɛ nnle bamba kafɔɔ niɛtɛ keemuɔ nkpo, alɛ bakpe afiofa ku sisuku tinini se mmle fɛ afiofa dikudi le mmle kɔyɔ ntɛ ye ni di anu miɛ?<verse eid="DEU 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 4:9" />Bilolaa binyu nwaa, bienyu suoto lee nwaa di mmle minaayee ni asaa ya di anu lee ntɔɔnya ni ee adie di otu lee, di obe wɔ biɛnya bisi ni nkpa. Bituo nya, babi lee ku babi lɛma ba nimawa ni di sɛmaa lɛma. <verse eid="DEU 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 4:10" />Nyuma dii le faayila ni di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ anu di Horeb, aatɔkɔ mi ni alɛ, “Siisa batii nwu di anu nii, baanu sɛlaa nii, alɛ baatekete mmle baabu mi ni, mantuo ni babi lɛma kafɔɔ di obe wɔ basi ni nkpa di kasɔ nwu suoto.” <verse eid="DEU 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 4:11" />Biayila biatɛɛtɛɛ kobokote nwu nkpaa di obe wɔ kuatoofiɛ ni ku ɔtɔ kunsifi ni bia osi ku alokonkyɛ wɛɛfɛɛ ku ditunu tunutunu. <verse eid="DEU 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 4:12" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu lakakatɛko ye aakyeko ɔtɔ nwu kamɛ nɛ. Bianu sɛlɔ nwu sɛlaa, kafɔɔ bitanya letembi kuninwii; sɛlɔ lete siale. <verse eid="DEU 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 4:13" />Aadiki kanya ninii nɔɔ nwu aatɔkɔ ye, Afiofa Lefosi ya aatɔkɔ ye alɛ bitikanko nii, aakpana nya kafɔɔ aatika ni di afuɔ nkyɛ nnyɔ suoto. <verse eid="DEU 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 4:14" />Ni di obe nwu kamɛ SAATE nwu latɔkɔ mi alɛ ntuo ye afiofa ku sisuku se dikaatɛ bietikanko ni di kasɔ ka biɔtaalɛ Yordan okle minaasiɛ ni nɛ.<verse eid="DEU 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mose Lasĩ Afiɔ Ɔtɔ Aata Israel Batii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 4:15" />Bitanya letembi kuninwii di dii le di SAATE nwu lakakatɛko ye aakyeko ni ɔtɔ kamɛ di Horeb. Nkpo oso bilolaa suoto lee binyu nwaa, <verse eid="DEU 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 4:16" />alɛ biekyisa disibu lee bibla afiɔ bita suoto lee, di letembi lele kanya, bɛɛbla ni fɛle osuɔtɔ ee ɔsanko, <verse eid="DEU 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 4:17" />ee fɛle bɔkɛɛ lele di kasɔ ka mmle suoto ee kansiɛ lele ninflɛlɛtɛ ni di kɔfɛɛfɔ, <verse eid="DEU 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 4:18" />ee fɛle kabɔkɔbii lele ninkyɛ ni kaasɔ ee kakpaku lele di ntu kamɛ kaalɔ. <verse eid="DEU 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 4:19" />Ni nse bienyu kolo biɛnya kufĩ, kɔwɛntɛ ku awɛntrɛbi- osi asaa nwu amuu- bitanta aakyɔnkyɔ ye alɛ biawakasɔ minta nya, mintɔɔtɔ asaa ya di SAATE Yaa lee lɛyɔ ɛɛta ni nnle mmuu di kolo kalɔ. <verse eid="DEU 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 4:20" />Kafɔɔ aye yi, SAATE nwu ladiki ye aakyeko abɔɔsaa okpetewu kamɛ, aakyeko Egipte kasɔ, alɛ biale atesaa nɔɔ baletɛ batii, fɛ mmle nfɛ bite ni kanunua.<verse eid="DEU 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 4:21" />SAATE lanya ɔblɔ aakpeekoe ta aye oso, ni aaka ntam osie kanya alɛ namataalɛ Yordan Okle nwu mbuo kasɔ ka biene di SAATE Yaa lee kɔyɔ anta ye ni fɛ atesaa lee nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 4:22" />Kamakpi di kasɔ ka mmle suoto; namataalɛ Yordan Okle; kafɔɔ aye nfɛ biɔwa ɔbataalɛ minaayɔ kasɔ biene nwu. <verse eid="DEU 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 4:23" />Bilolaa binyu bilɛ bieyee SAATE Yaa lee kanya ninii le aabla ni ku aye; bitambla afiɔ biata suoto lee di letembi kuninwii kanya di SAATE Yaa lee lekyidi nii. <verse eid="DEU 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 4:24" />Diekye SAATE Yaa lee nle ɔtɔ wɔ ninwɔɔsa ni asaa, Yaa wɔ ninkpɛ ni sɛsɔfɔwo.<verse eid="DEU 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 4:25" />Nse bitoolofo babi ku bawa bieloo, bitoosiɛ di kasɔ nwu suoto biɛklɛ- nse biɛlalaasa suoto lee biɛbla afiɔ di letembi lele kanya, biele sikpile di SAATE Yaa lee anu, biekpee nwɔ ɔblɔ yi, <verse eid="DEU 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 4:26" />kɔlɛɛ osi ku kasɔ fɛ kamaabayilatɛ di suoto lee miɛ dii le mmle alɛ, bibakpi wla di kasɔ ka biɔtaalɛ Yordan minaayɔ nii. Bilɔbasiɛ ninfa biklɛ, kafɔɔ nwaako bibawɔɔ. <verse eid="DEU 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 4:27" />SAATE nwu kamasamiisa ye ankpee di batii nwu kamɛ, basɛɛ lee lete nimabu minsiɛ nkpa di nnle be di SAATE nwu kamakpaa ye ansifiko ni kamɛ. <verse eid="DEU 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 4:28" />Nfa bibasumu bayaa ba di batii lɛyɔ sewoso ku afuɔ bɛɛbla nii, anamafuo ni ɔnya ee anu ee ale ni alesaa ee anu ni ofũfũ. <verse eid="DEU 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 4:29" />Kafɔɔ nfa nkpo, nse biemiɛ SAATE Yaa lee, bibanyɔɔ, nse biewolaa nwɔ ku otu lee omuu ku ɔkla lee omuu. <verse eid="DEU 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 4:30" />Nse diemiina ye di asaa ya mmle amuu lɛwa ye di suoto yi, ni dii kaamaa bibakple minsifi SAATE Yaa lee ɔkyɛ minaanu nwɔ ɔlaa. <verse eid="DEU 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 4:31" />Diekye SAATE Yaa lee nle nyaaminyatɛ Yaa; ɔlɔbadiɛ ye nnɛɛ ee awɔɔsa ye ee ayee kanya ninii le aabla ni ku bawa lee, nle aatika difuɔ aata ma aaka ni ntam.<verse eid="DEU 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Lete Ninle Yaa Nɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 4:32" />Bikaalɛ ayi ya nitɔbafe ni kanunua, ditɔɔklɛ ni fiɛ di obe lee ntɔɔwa ni, diayɔ ni di dii le di Yaa labla ni otii di kasɔ ka mmle suoto; bikaalɛ di osi disi le, diɛlaase ni di disi le. Lɛsaa kplɛ lewo fɛle nle mmle okle ntoodiwa, ee batoodinu lɛsaa lewo fɛle nninkpo okle? <verse eid="DEU 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 4:33" />Batii bamba bawo lanu Yaa sɛlɔ kɔkakatɛ sinkye ɔtɔ kamɛ, fɛ mmle bianu ni, baawɛ nkpa? <verse eid="DEU 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 4:34" />Sɛɛ yaa owo ntoodikpee kɔnyaabe alɛ oodiki kale kawo ankyeko kale bamba kamɛ anta suoto nɔɔ, di ɔsɔ onyu, asaa ya niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ ku atuosaa, ku kakpɛ, ku kɔnɛɛ siene, ku kɔnɛɛ lɛnanfi, ee di osie ku difu sɛsaabla, fɛle asaa ya amuu di SAATE Yaa lee labla ni di Egipte kasɔ suoto di anu lee amu?<verse eid="DEU 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 4:35" />Baatuo ye asaa ya mmle, di mmle biatofo ni bilɛ SAATE nwu lete ninle ni Yaa; di nnwɔɔ kamaa ɔbamba nnaa nii. <verse eid="DEU 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 4:36" />Aata ye bianu nwɔ sɛlɔ siakye ni osi alɛ ɔɔnanfi ye. Aatuo ye ɔtɔ nɔɔ kplɛ kaasɔ suoto, ni bianu sɛlɔ nɔɔ ladie siakye ɔtɔ kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 4:37" />Ta aambɔmbɔ ni bawa lee oso, ni aadiki banantii lɛma ba sɛɛmaa lɛma, aakpaa ye aadieko di Egipte di Nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ ku osie nɔɔ kplɛ, <verse eid="DEU 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 4:38" />alɛ ootososa nnle be nimpɔ bakpe ni osie balenke ye ni di anu lee, alɛ ɔɔkpaa ye anwako kasɔ lɛma, an-yɔ ka anta ye fɛ atesaa lee, fɛ mmle dite ni miɛ.<verse eid="DEU 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 4:39" />Bitofo nle mmle, biefũ bikpee di otu lee miɛ dii le mmle bilɛ, SAATE nwu ninle Yaa kaatoo di osi ku kasɔ kaalɔ. Ɔbamba kuonwii nsinnaa. <verse eid="DEU 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 4:40" />Bimufũ afiofa ku sisuku nɔɔ biklee, n-ya kɔyɔ nta ye ni miɛ, di mmle dibalɛ ninta ye ni ku babi lee ba nikɔwa ni sɛɛmaa lee, alɛ biasiɛ nkpa minklɛ di kasɔ ka suoto di SAATE Yaa lee kɔta ye ni obe lele.<verse eid="DEU 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Katanikokɔ Sekpoo Kplɛ Se Di Yordan Kufĩ Katunkɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 4:41" />Ninfɛ di Mose latɛ ekpoo kplɛ etiɛ di Yordan kufĩ katunkɔ lɛkyɛ, <verse eid="DEU 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 4:42" />nsĩ di nse otii lele lelo otii katoso ansifi ni, nse diele ɔtɛ ɛɛtɛ eelo owo nɔɔ nwu, ninanle osi asi nwɔ ni oso. Otii wɔ nielo ni owo nɔɔ kafuo otoso osifi ekpoo kplɛ be mmle onwii kamɛ anfũ nkpa nɔɔ. <verse eid="DEU 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 4:43" />Sekpoo nwu niale: Beser di ɔfaafuu kobokote nsintɛɛ, niale ni Ruben batii ole; Ramot di Gilead, niale ni Gad batii ole; Golan di Basan, niale ni Manase batii ole.<verse eid="DEU 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Kufiofa Nwu Odiki Otuo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 4:44" />Nnya kufiofa ko di Mose layɔ aatɛ ni di Israel batii anu. <verse eid="DEU 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 4:45" />Nnya ninle kɔkpaa didiki ku afiofa ku sisuku se di Mose layɔ aata ma ni di obe wɔ baadie ni di Egipte kasɔ, <verse eid="DEU 4:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 4:46" />baawɛ ni di ɔtaata wɔ niakaako ni Bet Peor di Yordan kufĩ katunkɔ, di Amori batii ɔka Sihon kasɔ suoto nɛ. Nnwɔ niale ni sɛka di Hesbon, di Mose ku Israel batii lalenkee nwɔ ni di obe wɔ baadie ni di Egipte. <verse eid="DEU 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 4:47" />Baafũ kasɔ nɔɔ ku Basan ɔka Og kasɔ, Amori batii baka nwu banyɔ di Yordan kufĩ katunkɔ. <verse eid="DEU 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 4:48" />Kasɔ ka mmle layɔ di Aroer di Arnon Okplo kyofole kotoko kaalaadu Siyon Kobokote (nkũ ninle Hermon nɛ), <verse eid="DEU 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 4:49" />di Araba omuu di Yordan kufĩ katunkɔ nkyakaa nii, kualaadu Araba Lekpo di Pisga kobokote lɛyɔnsa kalɔ.<verse eid="DEU 4:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DEU 5" />
  <para style="s1">Afiofa Lefosi Nwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 5:1" />Mose lalɛɛ Israel batii bamuu aasiisa ni aatɔkɔ ma alɛ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 5:1">Oo Israel, binu, afiofa ku sisuku se kobuɛ bionu ni miɛ dii le mmle. Bitekete nya bienyu bilɛ bietikanko nya. <verse eid="DEU 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 5:2" />SAATE Yaa loo lanii kanya ku awo di Horeb Kobokote. <verse eid="DEU 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 5:3" />Diele ku bate loo di SAATE nwu lanii kanya ka mmle, kafɔɔ ku awo, ku bamuu loo ba ninkpe ni nkpa ninfũ miɛ. <verse eid="DEU 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 5:4" />SAATE nwu lakakatɛko ye aakyeko ɔtɔ kamɛ di kobokote osi anu ku anu. <verse eid="DEU 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 5:5" />(Di obe nwu nkpo kamɛ layila di SAATE nwu ku aye ntɛɛ latɔkɔ ye SAATE nwu ɔlaa, diekye biatɔɔyɛkɛ ɔtɔ nwu nioso bitakyɛ kobokote nwu osi.) Ni di SAATE nwu labuɛ alɛ:<verse eid="DEU 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi3">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 5:6" />“Ami ninle SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ wɔ niakpaa fɔ aadieko ni di Egipte sɛlanle kasɔ nwu nɛ.<verse eid="DEU 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 5:7" />“Tansumu bayaa bamba faakyakaa di ami.<verse eid="DEU 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 5:8" />“Tambla afiɔ di lɛsaa lele letembi kanya di osi kaatoo ee kasɔ kaalɔ suoto ee di ntu kamɛ kaalɔ faata suoto lɛfɔ. <verse eid="DEU 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 5:9" />Tanwakasɔ faata nya ee faasumu nya; diekye ami, SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ, Yaa wɔ ninkpɛ ni sɛsɔfɔwo nle, ninaanfi ni babi kootoko ta bate lɛma sikpile oso, diɛlaase ni di kɔna tiɛfa ku kɔnaafa di mba niekyidi mi nii, <verse eid="DEU 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 5:10" />kafɔɔ nintuo ni ana kakpe ya nimbɔmbɔ mi ni beemufũ afiofa nii bakle ni lɛbɔmbɔ.<verse eid="DEU 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 5:11" />“Tamblako SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ leyooto ɔkpɛ kasakasa, diekye SAATE nwu kamalo otii lele niɛblako leyooto nɔɔ ɔkpɛ kasakasa lɛpɔɔ.<verse eid="DEU 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 5:12" />“Klee Lɛnyɛɛtɛyi nwu nkpo, faabla ni klekle, fɛ mmle di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ lɛtɔkɔ fɔ nii. <verse eid="DEU 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 5:13" />Ayi akuɔ faabakyɛ ɔkpɛ kamɛ, fambla sɛkpɛ lɛfɔ simuu, <verse eid="DEU 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 5:14" />kafɔɔ dii kuɛsinle nle Lɛnyɛɛtɛyi diɛta SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ. Di dii nwu nkpo tambla ɔkpɛ kuonwii, kuntɛ afɔ omu ee kuntɛ obisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ ee obisankobi lɛfɔ ee osuɔtɔ kpɛmblatɛ ee ɔsanko kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ ee nankyue lɛfɔ ee bɔkɛɛ lɛfɔ wɔ nintuka ni atoo, ee bɔkɛɛ lɛfɔ lele ee ɔfɔɔ wɔ ninsi ni di leyo lɛfɔ, ta mmle di osuɔtɔ kpɛmblatɛ ee ɔsanko kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ kamatɛ ni ɔnyɛɛ, fɛ mmle di afɔ fɔɔtɛ ni ɔnyɛɛ. <verse eid="DEU 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 5:15" />Nyuma falɛ ɔlanle faale di Egipte kasɔ fiɛ di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ lakpaa fɔ aakyeko nfa ku kɔnɛɛ kplɛ nɔɔ ku kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ lɛnanfi. Nioso SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ lɛtɔkɔ fɔ alɛ le Lɛnyɛɛtɛyi nwu nkpo.<verse eid="DEU 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 5:16" />“Bu teefɔ ku yaafɔ, fɛ mmle di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ lɛtɔkɔ fɔ ni, alɛ faasiɛ nkpa fanklɛ, ninlɛ ninta fɔ ni di kasɔ ka di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kɔyɔ anta fɔ nii.<verse eid="DEU 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 5:17" />“Tanlo otii.<verse eid="DEU 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 5:18" />“Tankpee asɔnɔ.<verse eid="DEU 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 5:19" />“Tan-yu.<verse eid="DEU 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 5:20" />“Tanlaa sɛlaa ku afunu faatika di owo-lɛfɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Di Israel batii kamɛ yi, owo-lɛfɔ ninle Israel otii nɛ.</char></note> suoto.<verse eid="DEU 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 5:21" />“Tanta owo-lɛfɔ ɔsɔfɔ lasɛɛ fɔ anu. Tanta owo-lɛfɔ leyo ee kasɔ ee osuɔtɔ kpɛmblatɛ ee ɔsanko kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ ee nankyue ee bɔkɛɛ nɔɔ wɔ nintuka ni atoo, ee lɛsaa lele ninle ni owo-lɛfɔ lele lasɛɛ fɔ anu.”<verse eid="DEU 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 5:22" />Nnya ninle afiofa ya di SAATE nwu layie ni lɛkya ku sɛlɔ siene aatɔkɔ ni kasikɔ lee kamuu ninfa di kobokote nwu osi di ɔtɔ ku lelokonkyɛ nwu ku ditunu tunutunu kamɛ nɛ; atasin-yɔ ni lɛsalɛsaa aakyakaa nii. Ni aakpana nya di afuɔ nkyɛ nnyɔ suoto aayɔ aatɛɛ nɛ.<verse eid="DEU 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Batii Nwu Lɛyɛkɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 5:23" />Obe wɔ bianu sɛlɔ kodie sinkye ni ditunu nwu kamɛ, di kobokote nwu latoofiɛ ni bembe ku ɔtɔ yi, basuɔtɔ batunletɛ bamuu di ana lee ku banɔɔfo lee lawa ɔkyɛ nii. <verse eid="DEU 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 5:24" />Ni biatɔkɔ mi bilɛ, “SAATE Yaa loo ntootuo wo leklekle nɔɔ ku sɛka nɔɔ, ni butoonu sɛlɔ nɔɔ, siekye ni ɔtɔ kamɛ nɛ. Miɛ butɔɔnya bulɛ otii kafuo nkpa osiɛ nse kuntɛ Yaa lɛkakatɛko nwɔ. <verse eid="DEU 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 5:25" />Kafɔɔ kanunua, be oso nfɛ buakpi? Ɔtɔ kplɛ wɔ mmle kamafiɛ wo, munkpi nse buokple buonu SAATE Yaa loo sɛlɔ. <verse eid="DEU 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 5:26" />Diekye ɔmɛntii-nyu nitoodinu Yaa wɔ ninkpe ni nkpa sɛlɔ kɔkakatɛ sinkye ɔtɔ kamɛ, anwɛ nkpa, fɛ mmle di awo buonu ni? <verse eid="DEU 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 5:27" />Kyɛ falaatɛɛtɛɛ faanu ɔlaa wɔ omuu di SAATE Yaa loo kobuɛ ni. Ni faabatɔkɔ wo ɔlaa lele di SAATE Yaa loo lɛtɔkɔ fɔ ni. Bubanu, munkyɔɔ atoko kafɔɔ.”<verse eid="DEU 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 5:28" />SAATE nwu lanu ye ɔlaa di obe wɔ biakakatɛkoe nii, ni di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Ntoonu ɔlaa wɔ di batii ba mmle lɛtɔkɔ fɔ nii. Ɔlaa biala baabuɛ ni lalɛ. <verse eid="DEU 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 5:29" />Oo, alɛ situ lɛma kamata ma manyɛkɛ mi manle afiofa nii amuu obe lele, di mmle dibalɛ ninta ma ni ku babi lɛma dinaa ni kaloo!<verse eid="DEU 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 5:30" />“Tɔɔkyɛ faalaatɔkɔ ma falɛ bakple basifi akpaayo lɛma kamɛ. <verse eid="DEU 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 5:31" />Kafɔɔ afɔ siɛ di ɔkyɛ nii ninfũ ninta fɔ sɛlaa ku sisuku ku afiofa amuu ya fabatuo ma mantikanko ni di kasɔ ka kɔta ma manaayɔ ni.”<verse eid="DEU 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 5:32" />Nioso bilolaa binyu, biɛbla di lɛsaa le di SAATE Yaa lee lɛtɔkɔ ye ni; batamunikĩi biafe oletanɛɛkyɛ ee ɔmɛntukyɛ. <verse eid="DEU 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 5:33" />Bikyɛ di osuku wɔ omuu di SAATE Yaa lee lɛtɔkɔ ye ni, di mmle biasiɛ ni nkpa, ninlɛ ninta ye ni, ayi lee kafɔɔ mpɔ ni di kasɔ ka biofe ni ɔyɔ suoto.<verse eid="DEU 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DEU 6" />
  <para style="s1">Kufiofa Ko Niefĩ Kulenke Nii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 6:1" />N-ya mmle ninle sɛsaabla ku sisuku ku afiofa ya di SAATE, Yaa lee latɔkɔ mi alɛ ntuo ye ni, alɛ biaklee ni di kasɔ ka biɔtaalɛ Yordan minaasiɛ ni, <verse eid="DEU 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 6:2" />di mmle di babi lee ku babi lɛma ba nikɔwa ni sɛɛmaa lɛma kamayɛkɛ ni SAATE Yaa lee di obe wɔ bisi ni nkpa, alɛ biakyɛ di sisuku nɔɔ minklee afiofa nɔɔ nwu amuu lɛta ye nii, mmle biasiɛ ni nkpa minklɛ nii. <verse eid="DEU 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 6:3" />Oo Israel, nu, lolaa fanyu falɛ fɛɛkyɔɔ kotoko, di mmle dibalɛ ninta fɔ ni, alɛ faalofo fanlɛɛsa kpinwu di kasɔ ka di nnyɛɛntu ku bablɔ kobiɛ ninfe nii, fɛ mmle di SAATE, bate lɛfɔ Yaa labuɛ aatɛ fɔ nii.<verse eid="DEU 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 6:4" />Oo Israel, nu: SAATE Yaa loo, SAATE nwu onwii ale. <verse eid="DEU 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 6:5" />Nioso bɔmbɔ SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ ku otu lɛfɔ omuu ku ɔkla lɛfɔ omuu ku osie lɛfɔ omuu. <verse eid="DEU 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 6:6" />Afiofa ya mmle kɔta fɔ ni miɛ asiɛ di otu lɛfɔ kamɛ. <verse eid="DEU 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 6:7" />Tuo nya babi lɛfɔ. Buɛ nya fatɔkɔ ma, nse fakpe leeyo, nse fakyɛ di osuku, nse fate ku obe wɔ fɛɛtaka ni. <verse eid="DEU 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 6:8" />Pɛ nya lɛkpa di nnɛɛtũ lɛfɔ fɛ nsũ lɛtɛsaa, faanii nya di katũ lɛfɔ. <verse eid="DEU 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 6:9" />Kpana nya fatika di ayo lɛfɔ n-yoko sewoso ku akloo lɛfɔ suoto.<verse eid="DEU 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kɔ̀ka Di Otokopĩ Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 6:10" />Nse SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ lɛkpaa fɔ ɛɛwako kasɔ ka aaka ntam aata ni bate lɛfɔ Abraham, Isak ku Yakob alɛ abata fɔ ni yi- kasɔ ka di sekpoo kplɛ se nikɔkyɛ ni sitũ, ninaanle aye niɛtɛ sĩ nii, <verse eid="DEU 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 6:11" />ayo ya di asaa nwaa amuu ateate leyii ni kamɛ, ninaanle afɔ niɛtɛ nya nii, atubiɔ ya ninaanle afɔ niekutu nii, nta awosobi afe ku nnɔnyi awosobi afe ya ninaanle afɔ niɛkpɛ nii- ni nse feele feemiɛ, <verse eid="DEU 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 6:12" />lolala fanyu falɛ faayee SAATE wɔ niakpaa fɔ aadieko ni di Egipte, aadieko ni di sɛlanle kasɔ nwu.<verse eid="DEU 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 6:13" />Yɛkɛ SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ nwu, sumu lete nɔɔ, faaka ntam lɛfɔ di leyooto nɔɔ kamɛ. <verse eid="DEU 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 6:14" />Bitantikanko bayaa bamba, batii ba ninsi beekyi ye ni bayaa nwu; <verse eid="DEU 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 6:15" />diekye SAATE, Yaa lee wɔ ninsi ni di kamɛ lee yi, Yaa wɔ ninkpɛ ni sɛsɔfɔwo ale, ɔblɔ kafɔɔ kamafiɛ nwɔ di suoto lee, anwɔɔsa ye di kasɔ nwu suoto. <verse eid="DEU 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 6:16" />Bitansɔ SAATE Yaa lee bianyu, fɛ mmle biabla ni di Masa. <verse eid="DEU 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 6:17" />Binyu bilɛ bieklee SAATE Yaa lee afiofa nwu, sɛsaabla ku sisuku nɔɔ se ɛɛta ye ni. <verse eid="DEU 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 6:18" />Bla lɛsaa le ninlɛ, diesiɛko ni kafɔɔ di SAATE nwu anu, di mmle dibalɛ ninta fɔ ni, fankyɛ fanaayɔ ni kasɔ biene ka di SAATE nwu laka ntam aata ni bawa lɛfɔ, <verse eid="DEU 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 6:19" />abatososa balo lɛfɔ bamuu di anu lɛfɔ, fɛ mmle di SAATE nwu labuɛ nii.<verse eid="DEU 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 6:20" />Dii kaamaa, nse babi lɛfɔ lɛkaalɛ fɔ alɛ, “Afiofa, sɛsaabla ku sisuku se di SAATE Yaa loo lebuɛ ɛɛtɛ ni kasɔ mɔ?” <verse eid="DEU 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 6:21" />tɔkɔ ma falɛ: “Buale Farao balanle di Egipte kasɔ, kafɔɔ SAATE nwu lakpaa wo aadieko di Egipte ku kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ osie. <verse eid="DEU 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 6:22" />Di anu loo di SAATE nwu lakyesee asaa ya niabla ni ɔkpɛ ku atuosaa kplɛ ku dibuo- di Egipte ku Farao ku leyo nɔɔ batii bamuu suoto. <verse eid="DEU 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 6:23" />Kafɔɔ awo yi, aadiki wo aakyeko nfa aawako aabata wo kasɔ ka aaka ntam aatɛ aata ni bawa loo. <verse eid="DEU 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 6:24" />Ni di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ wo alɛ buklee afiofa ya mmle amuu, buɔyɛkɛ SAATE Yaa loo, mmle di obe lele dibalɛ ninta wo nii, munwɛ ni nkpa, fɛ mmle dite ni miɛ. <verse eid="DEU 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 6:25" />Ni nse buololaa afiofa ya mmle amuu buole di SAATE Yaa loo anu, fɛ mmle ɛɛtɔkɔ wo ni yi, ni nnwu nimale wo ɔsaabla tinini nɛ.”<verse eid="DEU 6:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DEU 7" />
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Omu Batii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 7:1" />Nse SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ lɛkpaa fɔ ɛɛwako kasɔ ka suoto fababuo fanaayɔ ni, fantososa ni nnle kpinwu di anu lɛfɔ- Hiti batii, Girgasi batii, Amori batii, Kanaan batii, Perisi batii, Hiwi batii ku Yebusi batii, nnle nkuɛnsĩ nwu niemuɔ ni, bakpe ni osie kafɔɔ balenke fɔ ni yi- <verse eid="DEU 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 7:2" />ni nse SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ lɛyɔ ma eekpee fɔ ninnɛɛ fatoolenkee ma yi, ni dikpeni fɛɛwɔɔsa ma klekle. Tambla kanya ninii ku mma, tannya ma kafɔɔ nyaami. <verse eid="DEU 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 7:3" />Minko ma bitan-yɔ bawo. Tan-yɔ babisankobi lɛfɔ faata babisuɔtɔbi lɛma ee faakaalɛ babisankobi lɛma faata babisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ baayɔ, <verse eid="DEU 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 7:4" />diekye babakyisa babisuɔtɔbi lee anu, mandiɛ mi otikanko, manaasumu bayaa bamba, ni ɔblɔ kamafiɛ SAATE nwu di suoto lee, anwɔɔsa ye wla. <verse eid="DEU 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 7:5" />Nnya lɛsaa le dikaatɛ biɛbla ma ni: Bibibiɛ oleɔta akyikye lɛma nwu, biɛkpakpaa afiɔtii lɛma nwu, biebudi Asera sewoso bitɛ kaasɔ, biefiɛ kafɔɔ afiɔ lɛma nwu di ɔtɔ kamɛ. <verse eid="DEU 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 7:6" />Diekye bile batii klekle biɛta SAATE Yaa lee. SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ niediki fɔ eekyeko batii nwu bamuu kamɛ di kasɔ suoto alɛ bibale nwɔ batii, lɛsaawɛ finle nɔɔ.<verse eid="DEU 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 7:7" />SAATE nwu ditayɔ lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ aadiki ye ta biapɔ kpinwu bialenke ni batii bule oso, diekye aye niale batii kafii bialenkee di batii bamuu kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 7:8" />Kafɔɔ ta mmle di SAATE nwu labɔmbɔ ye ni, aabla di ntam be aaka aata ni bawa lee, ni aakpaa ye ku kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ osie, aadiki di sɛlanle kasɔ, di Egipte ɔka Farao nnɛɛ nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 7:9" />Nioso tofo falɛ SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ ninle Yaa; nnwɔɔ ninle onukwale Yaa nwu nɛ, ɔɔbla ni di kanya ninii nɔɔ lɛbɔmbɔ nwu anta ni ana nkpe be nimbɔmbɔ nwɔ, bakle ni afiofa nɔɔ. <verse eid="DEU 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 7:10" />Kafɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 7:10">mba niekyidi nwɔ nii, abanaanfi ma kootoko di anu lɛma, manwɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 7:10">ɔlɔbaku nkpaa ku letoko naanfi di mba niekyidi nwɔ ni anu.<verse eid="DEU 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 7:11" />Nioso lolaa fanyu, faakyɛ di sisuku nwu, faaklee sɛsaabla nwu, faale kafɔɔ afiofa ya kɔta fɔ ni miɛ.<verse eid="DEU 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lɛtɔtrɔ Le Ninsi Ni Di Ɔlaa Atoko Ɔkyɔɔ Kamɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 7:12" />Nse biele afiofa ya mmle, bielolaa nya bietikanko, ni SAATE Yaa lee kamaklee kanya ninii lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nwu ku aye, fɛ mmle aaka ntam aata ni bawa lee. <verse eid="DEU 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 7:13" />Ababɔmbɔ fɔ, anta fɔ lɛtɔtrɔ, anta fɔ fankpɛ fampɔɔsa. Abata lɛtɔtrɔ di olofofɔtɔ lɛfɔ babi ku kasɔ lɛfɔ alesaa- atita, nta fɔle ku nnɔnyi lɛfɔ- banankyue ku bafoso lɛfɔ abi suoto di kasɔ ka suoto di SAATE nwu laka ntam aata ni bawa lɛfɔ alɛ abata fɔ nii. <verse eid="DEU 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 7:14" />Abata fɔ lɛtɔtrɔ anlenkee batii biala; basuɔtɔ ee basanko lɛfɔ kuonwii dilɔbale ɔlɛma ee babɔkɛɛ sele lɛfɔ kuonwii dilɔbawɛ alɛ aalofo abi. <verse eid="DEU 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 7:15" />SAATE nwu kamatĩi ofiɛ biala osuku di suoto lɛfɔ. Ɔlɔbata sifiɛ kpile se faatofo ni di Egipte kasɔ sipɛ fɔ, kafɔɔ abayɔ sĩ ankpete di mba niekyidi fɔ ni suoto. <verse eid="DEU 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 7:16" />Dikpeni fɛɛwɔɔsa batii ba bamuu di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ lɛyɔ eekpee fɔ ni ninnɛɛ. Tannya ma nyaami, tansumu bayaa lɛma kafɔɔ, diekye nni nimale dikyĩ ninta fɔ nɛ.<verse eid="DEU 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 7:17" />Biafuo obuɛ di situ lee kamɛ bilɛ, “Nnle be mmle nkpe osie balenke wo. Lɛ bubafuo ma otososa odiki?” <verse eid="DEU 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 7:18" />Kafɔɔ tanyɛkɛ ma; nyuma lɛsaa le di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ labla ni ɔka Farao ku Egipte kasɔ kamuu. <verse eid="DEU 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 7:19" />Faanya ku anu lɛfɔ amu ɔsɔ onyu kplɛ nwu, atuosaa ya niabla ni ɔkpɛ ku anyasaa ya di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kɔnɛɛ osie ku kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ lɛnanfi le aayɔ aakpaa fɔ aadieko nii. SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kamabla di akpanwu anta batii ba nfɛ fɔɔyɛkɛ ni kanunua. <verse eid="DEU 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 7:20" />Mia nwu kafɔɔ, SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kamakyesee bayɛkɛkɛ kaamɛ lɛma, ninaase bia mba niebu bakpe ni nkpa beewofa fɔ ni kamakpi nii. <verse eid="DEU 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 7:21" />Bitanta difu lapɛ ye di suoto lɛma, diekye SAATE Yaa lee wɔ ninsi ye ni kaamɛ nle Yaa wɔ ninkpe ni osie baayɛkɛ nii. <verse eid="DEU 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 7:22" />SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kamatososa nnle nwu andiki di anu lɛfɔ kɛɛkɛkɛɛkɛ. Blɔbata fɔ osuku fadiki bamuu lɛma kanya kanwii, nse diele nkpo ni lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ kamadie di lɛpɔ kanya mammana fɔ mankyi. <verse eid="DEU 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 7:23" />Kafɔɔ SAATE Yaa lee nwu kamayɔ ma ankpee ye ninnɛɛ, abata kudú kplɛ mbuo ma kaamɛ, ninaase di obe wɔ babawɔɔ nii. <verse eid="DEU 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 7:24" />Abayɔ baka lɛma ankpee fɔ ninnɛɛ, fanyɛɛsa ayooto lɛma di kasɔ ka mmle suoto. Kuonwii dilɔbafuo ɔtaka oyila di suoto lɛfɔ; fabawɔɔsa bamuu lɛma. <verse eid="DEU 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 7:25" />Bifiɛ bayaa lɛma atembi nwu di ɔtɔ kamɛ. Bitanta koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle nwu di afiɔ lɛma suoto lasɛɛ ye anu, batan-yɔ nya kafɔɔ biabla ale ye, nse diele nkpo ni okũ wɔ bɛɛkyɔɔ ni mamufũ ye, diekye diyududusaa dile dita SAATE Yaa lee. <verse eid="DEU 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 7:26" />Tan-yɔ diyududusaa kuninwii faawako leyo lɛfɔ, se diele nkpo ni afɔ ku lɛsaa nwu bibawɔɔ. Bisĩ nya, biekyidi nya, diekye beediki nya bɛɛtɛ bɛɛta kawɔɔ.<verse eid="DEU 7:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DEU 8" />
  <para style="s1">Kasɔ Biene Nwu Di Israel Batii Kamafũ Nii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 8:1" />Bilolaa binyu biele kufiofa biala kɔta ye ni miɛ, di mmle biasiɛ ni nkpa, minlofo minkpɛ ni, alɛ biabuo minnayɔ ni kasɔ ka di SAATE nwu laka ntam aata ni bawa lee. <verse eid="DEU 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 8:2" />Nyuma mmle di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ laleko fɔ ni katũ di ɔfaafuu osuku omuu ɔkyɛ kamɛ, alɛɛ afosi-ana ya mmle, alɛ ɔɔwakosa fɔ kasɔ, ansɔ fɔ an-nyu antofo lɛsaa le ninsi ni di otu lɛfɔ kamɛ, nse fabale nwɔ afiofa nwu ee, flɔbale. <verse eid="DEU 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 8:3" />Aawakosa fɔ kasɔ, diata kɔka laklee fɔ, ni aata fɔ mana wɔ di afɔ ee bate lɛfɔ dieye ni faale ni, alɛ ootuo fɔ alɛ diele alesaa lete oso di otii kasiɛ nkpa, kafɔɔ di ɔlaa biala niedie ni di SAATE nwu kanya. <verse eid="DEU 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 8:4" />Di alɛɛ afosi-ana ya mmle kamɛ yi, akleesaa ditabɛbɛɛ di suoto lɛfɔ, nkpaa lɛfɔ kafɔɔ ditafufu. <verse eid="DEU 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 8:5" />Ni tofo di otu lɛfɔ kamɛ falɛ, fɛ mmle di otii nnaanfi ni obi nɔɔ kootoko yi, nkpo di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kafɔɔ nnaanfi fɔ kootoko nɛ.<verse eid="DEU 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 8:6" />Le SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ afiofa nwu, faakyɛ di sisuku nɔɔ suoto, faayɛkɛ nwɔ kafɔɔ. <verse eid="DEU 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 8:7" />Diekye SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kɔkpaa fɔ anwako kasɔ biene suoto- kasɔ nwu ku sekle ku ntu apanta ku ntu ntaakɔ diobiɛ ninfe ni di sɛtaata ku akpenkpe kamɛ; <verse eid="DEU 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 8:8" />kasɔ ka ku akpaa ku kamɔɔ, nta awosobi ku abue awoso, akpaloo, nnɔnyi awoso ku bablɔ; <verse eid="DEU 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 8:9" />kasɔ ka di alesaa kamawɛ nii, di lɛsalɛsaa dilɔbafĩ fɔ nii; kasɔ ka di afuɔnkpaa nɔɔ nle ni abɔɔsaa, fabakutu ni abɔɔsaa sɛɛle di akpenkpe nwu.<verse eid="DEU 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 8:10" />Nse fatoole feemiɛ yi, faatansa SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ ta kasɔ biene ka ɛɛta fɔ ni oso.<verse eid="DEU 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kɔkà Di SAATE Nwu Oyee Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 8:11" />Lolaa fanyu falɛ faayee SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ, alɛ faasĩ afiofa nɔɔ ole, ɔkyɛ di sisuku nɔɔ ku sɛsaabla nɔɔ nwu kɔta fɔ ni di dii le mmle. <verse eid="DEU 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 8:12" />Nse diele nkpo, feele feemiɛ, feetofo ayo biene feesiɛ kaamɛ, <verse eid="DEU 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 8:13" />di banankyue ku babɔkɛɛ sele lɛfɔ lɛlɛɛsa, di koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle lɛfɔ lɛbapɔ, di asaa ya ninkpe fɔ ni amuu lɛbakpɛ ɛɛkyakaa, <verse eid="DEU 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 8:14" />di otu lɛfɔ lɛbatakatɛsa suoto katoo, fɛɛbayee SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ wɔ niakpaa fɔ aadieko ni di Egipte, aakyeko ni sɛlanle kasɔ nwu suoto. <verse eid="DEU 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 8:15" />Nnwɔɔ nialeko fɔ katũ aafenko di difu ɔfaafuu foo kamɛ, otukɔnsɔ kasɔ ka di ntu ditawɛ ni, ku asaanwu kpile ku nkpakana lawɛ nii. Aata fɔ ntu diakye ni difuɔnkpaa siene kamɛ. <verse eid="DEU 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 8:16" />Aata fɔ mana faale di ɔfaafuu nwu, alesaa ya di bate lee ditatofo ni diidii, alɛ ɔɔwakosa fɔ kasɔ, ansɔ fɔ kafɔɔ annyu, di mmle dialɛ ninta fɔ ni di kayɛntɛkɔ. <verse eid="DEU 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 8:17" />Faafuo obuɛ di otu lɛfɔ kamɛ falɛ, “Osie nii ku kɔnyaabe nii niɛtɛɛ lɛsaawɛ le mmle nɛ.” <verse eid="DEU 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 8:18" />Kafɔɔ nyuma SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ, diekye nnwɔɔ ninle nnwɔ ninta fɔ ni osie fan-wɛ ni lɛsaawɛ nwu nɛ. Nioso alɛ ootika difuɔ di kanya ninii nɔɔ le aaka ntam aata ni bawa lɛfɔ, fɛ mmle dite ni miɛ.<verse eid="DEU 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 8:19" />Nse nwaako feeyee SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ, feetikanko bayaa bamba, feesumu ma, feewakosa suoto kasɔ fɛɛta ma, nwaako kɔta ye mintofo miɛ nlɛ, nwaako bibawɔɔ. <verse eid="DEU 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 8:20" />Fɛle mmle di SAATE nwu lawɔɔsa ni nnle nwu di anu lee yi, nkpo babawɔɔsa ye ta biɛɛkyɔɔ ni SAATE Yaa lee atoko oso nɛ.<verse eid="DEU 8:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DEU 9" />
  <para style="s1">Israel Batii Otokopĩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 9:1" />Oo Israel, nu. Nfɛ fɔɔwa Yordan ɔtaalɛ kanunua fansifi fanaayɔ nnle be nimpɔ bakpe ni osie balenke fɔ ni ku sekpoo kplɛ se beetofo siyoyiɛ takale siesifi ni kolo. <verse eid="DEU 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 9:2" />Batii nwu nkpe osie, bɛɛkaana kafɔɔ- Anak batii! Faye ma, fatoonu beebuɛ kafɔɔ alɛ: “Owe nimafuo oyila di Anak batii suoto?” <verse eid="DEU 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 9:3" />Kafɔɔ fũ fakpee miɛ falɛ SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ ninle nnwɔ nimaleko fɔ ni katũ fantaalɛ ni, fɛle ɔtɔ bembe nɛ. Abawɔɔsa ma; anlenkee ma di anu lɛfɔ. Fantososa ma fandiki klekle fɛ mmle di SAATE nwu labuɛ aatɛ aata fɔ nii.<verse eid="DEU 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 9:4" />Nse SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ ntootososa ma di anu lɛfɔ sɛmaa yi, tambuɛ di otu lɛfɔ kamɛ falɛ, “SAATE nwu niɛwakoe nfũ alɛ n-wa nimayɔ kasɔ ka mmle ta ɔsaabla tinini nii oso.” Oowo, nnle be mmle amumu oso di SAATE nwu kɔwa ma ɔbatososa di anu lɛfɔ nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 9:5" />Diele ɔsaabla tinini lɛfɔ ee otu lɛfɔ kamɛ lɛkpa ni oso foofe kasɔ lɛma nwu ɔyɔ; kafɔɔ nnle be mmle amumu lɛma ole oso di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kamatososa ma andiki di anu lɛfɔ, alɛ aata ntam be aaka aata ni bate lɛfɔ, Abraham, Isak ku Yakob kawa ni kaanya. <verse eid="DEU 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 9:6" />Nu kasɔ falɛ, ni diele ɔsaabla tinini lɛfɔ oso di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kɔyɔ kasɔ biene ka mmle anta fɔ alɛ kabla fɔ kale, diekye batokopĩtɛ batii bile.<verse eid="DEU 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Koto Sɛɛle Lɛnankyuebi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 9:7" />Nyuma nle mmle, diidii tan-yee kafɔɔ mmle faakpee ni SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ ɔblɔ di ɔfaafuu kamɛ. Diayɔ ni di dii le biadie ni di Egipte kasɔ dialaase ni di obe wɔ biabuo ni nfũ, biataka biayila di SAATE nwu suoto. <verse eid="DEU 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 9:8" />Di Horeb, biata SAATE nwu ɔblɔ lataka yakayaka, diata ɔblɔ lafiɛ nwɔ alɛ see ɔɔwɔɔsa ye. <verse eid="DEU 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 9:9" />Obe wɔ lakata lakyɛ ni kobokote osi lalaafũ ni akpanasaa afuɔ nwu, kanya ninii afuɔ ya di SAATE nwu labla ni ku aye, lasiɛ di kobokote nwu nkpo ayi afosi-ana ku n-kyɛ afosi-ana; ntale alesaa, ntanyi ntu kafɔɔ. <verse eid="DEU 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 9:10" />SAATE nwu latɛɛ afuɔ nkyɛ nnyɔ di Yaa lɛnɛɛbi lakpana nii. Afiofa ya amuu di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ ye ni di kobokote osi di ɔtɔ kamɛ, di dii le biasi ni dikudi.<verse eid="DEU 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 9:11" />Di ayi afosi-ana ku n-kyɛ afosi-ana nwu kayɛntɛkɔ, SAATE nwu latɛɛ afuɔ nkyɛ nnyɔ, kanya ninii afuɔ nwu. <verse eid="DEU 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 9:12" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Soo ninfũ fasifi wla, diekye batii lɛfɔ ba faakpaa faadieko ni di Egipte ntɔɔlalaa. Batookyi wla di kufiofa ko lɛta ma nii, ni batɔɔbla abɔɔsaa afiɔ bɛɛta suoto lɛma nɛ.”<verse eid="DEU 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 9:13" />Ni di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Ntɔɔnya batii ba mmle, nwaako batokopĩtɛ bale! <verse eid="DEU 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 9:14" />Diɛ mi, ninwɔɔsa ma, nindiki leyooto lɛma di kasɔ ka mmle suoto. Kamayɔ fɔ mbla kale siene, fankpɛ nwaa fanlenkee ma.”<verse eid="DEU 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 9:15" />Nioso lamunikĩi lasoo kobokote nwu lasifi, di obe wɔ kuatoofiɛ ni ku ɔtɔ bembe. Di kanya ninii afuɔ nkyɛ nwu nnyɔ lasiɛ mi ni ninnɛɛ. <verse eid="DEU 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 9:16" />Lanyu nii, lanya nlɛ bitɔɔbla okpile di SAATE Yaa lee suoto; bitɔɔbla abɔɔsaa afiɔ di lɛnankyuebi letembi kanya biɛta suoto lee. Bitookyi wla di kufiofa ko di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ ye nii. <verse eid="DEU 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 9:17" />Nioso layɔ afuɔ nkyɛ nwu nnyɔ ninnɛɛ nii lafuki layu, aabibiɛ kɔkyɛɛkɔkyɛɛ di anu lee.<verse eid="DEU 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 9:18" />Ni lakple lafuusa anu kaasɔ di SAATE nwu anu ayi afosi-ana ku n-kyɛ afosi-ana nɛ; ntale alesaa, ntanyi ntu kafɔɔ, ta sikpile se simuu biabla ni oso, biabla ni nle niale ni okpile di SAATE nwu anu, diata ɔblɔ lafiɛ nwɔ nii. <verse eid="DEU 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 9:19" />Layɛkɛ SAATE nwu ɔblɔ ku lɛyakayaka ninwu, diekye aanya ɔblɔ osie kanya dikaatɛ alɛ see aawɔɔsa ye nii. Kafɔɔ SAATE nwu lakple aakyɔɔ mi atoko. <verse eid="DEU 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 9:20" />Ni di SAATE nwu lanya ɔblɔ osie kanya aakpeeko Aron, alɛ ɔɔwɔɔsɔɔ nii, kafɔɔ di obe nwu kamɛ lapɛ ɔlaa lata Aron kafɔɔ. <verse eid="DEU 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 9:21" />Ni layɔ kafɔɔ okpile lɛsaa lee nwu, lɛnankyuebi le biabla ni lakpee di ɔtɔ lafiɛ nɛ. Ninfɛ lakuɔ ni diabla mpu muɛmuɛ fɛ ɔtɛnfuu, ni lanyɛɛnɛ ɔtɛnfuu nwu lakpete di okle wɔ niabiɛ kuakye ni kobokote nwu kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="DEU 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 9:22" />Biakpee SAATE nwu ɔblɔ kafɔɔ di Tabera, di Masa ku Kibrot Hatawa.<verse eid="DEU 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 9:23" />Ni di obe wɔ di SAATE nwu lakpee ye ni kɔtɔ aakyeko ni Kades Barnea yi, aatɔkɔ ye alɛ, “Bitɔɔkyɛ osi nwu biɛlaayɔ kasɔ ka ntɔɔta ye ni.” Kafɔɔ biataka biayila di SAATE Yaa lee kufiofa nwu suoto. Bitafũ nwɔ bianu ee bianu nwɔ ɔlaa. <verse eid="DEU 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 9:24" />Biɔtaka minyila di SAATE nwu suoto, bia di obe wɔ kamɛ latofo ye nii.<verse eid="DEU 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 9:25" />Lafuusa anu kaasɔ di SAATE nwu anu ayi nwu afosi-ana ku n-kyɛ afosi-ana, diekye SAATE nwu labuɛ alɛ abawɔɔsa ye. <verse eid="DEU 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 9:26" />Ni lapɛ ɔlaa lata SAATE nwu labuɛ nlɛ, “Oo SAATE Kplɛ, tanwɔɔsa batii lɛfɔ, atesaa lɛfɔ amu ya faayɔ osie kplɛ lɛfɔ faadiki ni, faakpaa ma faadieko ni di Egipte ku kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ kplɛ. <verse eid="DEU 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 9:27" />Nyuma bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ, Abraham, Isak ku Yakob. Kpaa sinumpoo fatĩi batii ba mmle atokopĩsaa, amumu lɛma ku sikpile lɛma. <verse eid="DEU 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 9:28" />Nse diele nkpo, kale ka faakpaa wo faakyeko ni batii kamabuɛ alɛ, ‘Ta SAATE nwu diefuo ma ni ɔkpaa osifiko ni kasɔ ka aabuɛ aatɛ aata ma ni oso, ni ta eekyidi ma ni oso, aakpaa ma aadieko aabalo di ɔfaafuu kamɛ nɛ.’ <verse eid="DEU 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 9:29" />Kafɔɔ batii lɛfɔ bale, atesaa lɛfɔ ya faayɔ osie kplɛ lɛfɔ ku kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ lɛnanfi faadieko ni bale.”<verse eid="DEU 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DEU 10" />
  <para style="s1">Mose Lakple Aafũ Afiofa Lefosi Nwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 10:1" />Di obe nwu kamɛ SAATE nwu latɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Kyɛkyɛsɛ afuɔ nkyɛ nnyɔ fɛle akasale nwu nkpo okle fadiki, faakata fawa ɔkyɛ nii di kobokote nwu osi. Wola kowoso lɛlakaa kafɔɔ. <verse eid="DEU 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 10:2" />Kamakpana sɛlaa se niatika ni di nkyɛ kasale be faabibiɛ ni suoto ntika. Ni faayɔ nya fakpee di lɛlakaa nwu kamɛ.”<verse eid="DEU 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 10:3" />Nioso layɔ akesia sewowo lawola lɛlakaa nwu, ni lakyɛkyɛsɛ afuɔ nkyɛ nnyɔ ladiki fɛle nkasale nwu nɛ. Ninfɛ lakata lasifi kobokote nwu osi ku afuɔ nkyɛ nwu nnyɔ di nnɛɛ nii nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 10:4" />Ni di SAATE nwu lakpana sɛlaa se aakpana ni di obe nwu aatika di afuɔ nkyɛ nnyɔ be mmle suoto nɛ. Afiofa Lefosi nwu aatɔkɔ ye ni di kobokote nwu osi, aakyeko ni ɔtɔ kamɛ, di dii le biasi ni dikudi. Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu layɔ nya aatɛɛ nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 10:5" />Ninfɛ lasoo di kobokote nwu labayɔ afuɔ nkyɛ nwu lakpee di lɛlakaa le labla ni kamɛ, fɛ mmle di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ mi ni nɛ, asi ninfa kanunua.<verse eid="DEU 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 10:6" />(Ni di Israel batii ladie di Yaakan batii atubiɔ nwu, baasifi Mosera nɛ. Nfa di Aron lakpi baakookaa nwɔ nɛ, ninfɛ di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Eleaser layila nwɔ kaanya fɛ oletatɛ-nɔɔfo nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 10:7" />Baadie ninfa baasifi Gudgoda, baafe baasifi Yotbat, kasɔ ka ku seklenyii ntu. <verse eid="DEU 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 10:8" />Di obe nwu nkpo kamɛ SAATE nwu ladiki Lewi batii kɔna aase lete alɛ batuka SAATE nwu kanya ninii lɛlakaa nwu, alɛ baayila di SAATE nwu anu mambla kasumu ɔkpɛ man-ta batii lɛtɔtrɔ di leyooto nɔɔ kamɛ, fɛ mmle bookple mambla ni miɛ. <verse eid="DEU 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 10:9" />Nkpo oso di Lewi batii nnaa lɛba ee atesaa di babilɛma kamɛ nɛ; SAATE nwu ninle ma atesaa, fɛ mmle di SAATE Yaa lee latɔkɔ ma nii.)<verse eid="DEU 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 10:10" />Lasiɛ di kobokote nwu osi ayi afosi-ana ku n-kyɛ afosi-ana, fɛ mmle labla ni lɛkasale, ni di SAATE nwu lakple aanu mi ɔlaa di obe nwu kamɛ kafɔɔ nɛ. Ditale nwɔ dibiesaa alɛ ɔɔwɔɔsa ye. <verse eid="DEU 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 10:11" />Ni di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Tɔɔkyɛ faalaaleko batii nwu katũ di osuku lɛma, di mmle baabuo man-yɔ ni kasɔ ka laka ntam lata ni bate lɛma nlɛ kamata ma ni.”<verse eid="DEU 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lɛsaa Le Di Yaa Kɔkaalɛ Ankyeko Ni Ɔkyɛlɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 10:12" />Oo Israel, kanunua lɛsaa le di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kɔkaalɛ ankyeko ni ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ ninle alɛ, yɛkɛ SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ, faakyɛ di sisuku nɔɔ simuu suoto, faabɔmbɔ nwɔ, faasumu SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ ku otu lɛfɔ omuu ku ɔkla lɛfɔ omuu, <verse eid="DEU 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 10:13" />faale SAATE nwu afiofa ku sɛsaabla se kɔta fɔ ni miɛ, diɛta ni dibiene lɛfɔ nimu.<verse eid="DEU 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 10:14" />SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ lèle di osi nwu nle, bia osi wɔ niɛtaka katoo kulenke ni, di kasɔ ku lɛsaa biala nsi ka ni kaamɛ. <verse eid="DEU 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 10:15" />Kafɔɔ SAATE nwu layɔ lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ aata bawa lee ni aabɔmbɔ ma nɛ. Ni aadiki aye, banantii lɛma, bilenke nnle mmuu, fɛ mmle dite ni miɛ nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 10:16" />Nioso bikyɛlɛnsa situ lee, bitansimbla otokopĩ nwu diidii. <verse eid="DEU 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 10:17" />Diekye SAATE Yaa lee nwu ninle Yaa ata bayaa nwu, ku SAATE ata ni basaate nwu, Yaa wɔ niemuɔ nii, alenke nii, baayɛkɛ nwɔ ni kafɔɔ, anaanyu ni otii di anu, annanfũ ni kafɔɔ ditunu kamɛ asaa. <verse eid="DEU 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 10:18" />An-nyu bakuɛbi ku bakpisɔfɔ lɛlɛ, ambɔmbɔ kafɔɔ bafɔɔ, anta ma alesaa ku aklesaa. <verse eid="DEU 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 10:19" />Ayee bibɔmbɔ batii ba ninle ni bafɔɔ, diekye aye bamu bafɔɔ biale di Egipte kasɔ. <verse eid="DEU 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 10:20" />Yɛkɛ SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ, faasumu nwɔ. Mufũ nwɔ faklee kpinkpĩ, faaka ntam lɛfɔ di leyooto nɔɔ kamɛ. <verse eid="DEU 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 10:21" />Nnwɔɔ ninle katansa lɛfɔ nɛ; nnwɔɔ ninle Yaa lɛfɔ wɔ niabla ni akplɛsaa ku ayɛkɛsaa nwu nkpo niabla ni ɔkpɛ ata ye bianya ni ku anu lee amu nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 10:22" />Bawa lɛfɔ ba niasifi ni Egipte bamuu labla batii afosi-akuɛnsĩ, kafɔɔ kanunua SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ ntɔɔta fɔ fɛɛpɔ fɛ awɛntrɛbi di kolo.<verse eid="DEU 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DEU 11" />
  <para style="s1">Bɔmbɔ SAATE Nwu Faanu Nwɔ Ɔlaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 11:1" />Bɔmbɔ SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ faabla dibiesaa nɔɔ, kyɛ di sisuku nɔɔ, faale afiofa nɔɔ, faaklee sɛsaabla nɔɔ kafɔɔ obe lele. <verse eid="DEU 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 11:2" />Binyuma miɛ bilɛ diele babi lee nianya, baatofo kafɔɔ SAATE Yaa lee ditii-nanfi: sɛka kalekɔ nɔɔ, kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ kplɛ ku kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ lɛnanfi; <verse eid="DEU 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 11:3" />atuosaa ya ku asaa ya aabla ni di Egipte kamɛ, di Egipte ɔka Farao ku kale nɔɔ kamuu, akyuu lɛma nwu anyɔ suoto; <verse eid="DEU 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 11:4" />lɛsaa le di SAATE nwu labla ni Egipte batii bakpɛtɛ ku bapɔnkɔ ku bapɔnkɔ bakeke lɛma, di obe wɔ baatikanko ye ni, di mmle aata Lekpo Sɛɛle ntu labiɛ diakpete ma ni, ku mmle di SAATE nwu lawɔɔsa ma diɛbase ni bia miɛ. <verse eid="DEU 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 11:5" />Ditale babi lee nianya lɛsaa le aabla ni di ɔfaafuu nwu kamɛ dialase ni di obe wɔ biabuo ni lɛba le mmle, <verse eid="DEU 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 11:6" />ku lɛsaa le aabla ni Eliab, Ruben otii nwu babisuɔtɔbi Datan ku Abiram, di obe wɔ di kasɔ labɛ ni kanya di Israel batii bamuu ntɛɛ, kaa-mɛ ma ni ku ayo lɛma kamɛ batii, akpaayo lɛma ku asaa biala ya niawɛ ni nkpa, aale ma ni ale. <verse eid="DEU 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 11:7" />Kafɔɔ anu lee amu nianya asaa kplɛ ya mmle amuu di SAATE nwu labla nii.<verse eid="DEU 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lɛtɔtrɔ Di Kasɔ Ka Baabuɛ Baatɛ Ni Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 11:8" />Nioso bile afiofa ya amuu kɔyɔ nta ye ni miɛ, di mmle biawɛ ni osie minkyɛ minnaayɔ ni kasɔ ka biɔɔtaalɛ Yordan minaayɔ ni, <verse eid="DEU 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 11:9" />di mmle biasiɛ nkpa minklɛ ni di kasɔ ka di SAATE nwu laka ntam aata ni bawa lee ku banantii lɛma, kasɔ ka di nnyɛɛntu ku bablɔ kobiɛ ninfe nii. <verse eid="DEU 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 11:10" />Kasɔ nwu fababuo fanaayɔ ni diete fɛle Egipte kasɔ, di nfũ feekye nii, nfũ nse fɛɛpɛ asaa, fankpete nya ni ntu ku okyiini fɛ mmle mambla ni di kɔba asaa suoto. <verse eid="DEU 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 11:11" />Kafɔɔ kasɔ ka biɔtaalɛ Yordan minaayɔ ni yi, abokote ku sɛtaata kasɔ ka ninnyi ni kanto ntu be ninkye ni osi kale. <verse eid="DEU 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 11:12" />Kale kasɔ ka di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ konyu nii; SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ anu ntika ka di suoto obe lele diɛyɔ ni di lɛlɛɛ kasɔ kakyekɔ diɛlaase ni di kayɛntɛkɔ.<verse eid="DEU 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 11:13" />Nioso nse nwaako biele afiofa ya kɔyɔ nta ye ni miɛ- biɛbɔmbɔ SAATE Yaa lee, biesumu nwɔ ku otu lee omuu ku ɔkla lee omuu yi- <verse eid="DEU 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 11:14" />ni kamata kanto nnɔɔ di kasɔ lee suoto di obe nɔɔ kanya, kɔkyɛɛ ku kabiene kanto, di mmle biawɛ ni alesaa ku nta fɔle ku nnɔnyi. <verse eid="DEU 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 11:15" />Kamata sɛfa nnyie di kasɔ nwu sinta babɔkɛɛ sele lɛfɔ, obe lele fabale fammiɛ.<verse eid="DEU 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 11:16" />Bilolaa binyu, nse diele nkpo babakyɔnkyɔ ye minmunikĩi minaasumu bayaa bamba, minwakasɔ minta ma. <verse eid="DEU 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 11:17" />Ni ɔblɔ kamafiɛ SAATE nwu di suoto lee, ni abasɛɛ osi ninta alɛ kanto dilɔbanɔɔ ata kasɔ kalɛ alesaa, ni bibakpi wla mindie di kasɔ biene ka di SAATE nwu kɔyɔ nta ye ni suoto. <verse eid="DEU 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 11:18" />Biyɔ sɛlaa nii se mmle bikpee di situ ku asi lee kamɛ; bipɛ sĩ akpa di nnɛɛtũ lee, bienii sĩ di ntũ lee fɛ nsũ lɛtɛsaa. <verse eid="DEU 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 11:19" />Bituo nya babi lee, bietoobuɛ sĩ nse bikpe leeyo, nse bikyɛ di osuku, nse bite ku obe wɔ biɛtaka ni. <verse eid="DEU 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 11:20" />Bikpana nya di ayo lee n-yoko sewoso suoto ku akloo lee suoto, <verse eid="DEU 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 11:21" />di mmle di ayi lee ku babi lee ayi kamapɔ ni di kasɔ ka di SAATE nwu laka ntam alɛ abata ni bawa lee, mmle biasiɛ ni fɛ mmle okle di osi lɛtaka katoo kalenke ni kasɔ.<verse eid="DEU 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 11:22" />Nse bielolaa afiofa ya mmle amuu kɔyɔ nta ye nlɛ bitikanko ni bieklee nwaa yi- biɛbɔmbɔ SAATE Yaa lee, biɛkyɛ di sisuku nɔɔ simuu suoto, biemufũ nwɔ bieklee kpinkpĩ yi- <verse eid="DEU 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 11:23" />ni SAATE nwu kamatososa nnle be mmle mmuu di anu lee, min-yɔ nnle be nimpɔ, bakpe ni osie balenke ye ni nsɔ. <verse eid="DEU 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 11:24" />Lɛba biala di kɔkpaa lee lɛnafu kamale ye kale: Kasɔ kamadie di ɔfaafuu kanaadu Lebanon, kandie di Eufrate Okle kanaadu kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ lɛkpo. <verse eid="DEU 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 11:25" />Otii kuonwii dilɔbafuo oyila di suoto lee. Fɛ mmle di SAATE Yaa lee labuɛ aatɛ aata ye ni kamayɔ suoto lee difu ku lɛyɛkɛ ankpee di kasɔ kamuu suoto, di kakɔ biala biɛkyɛ.<verse eid="DEU 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 11:26" />Binyu, kɔyɔ lɛtɔtrɔ ku lɛkpaani ntɛ ye di anu miɛ- <verse eid="DEU 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 11:27" />nse biele SAATE Yaa lee afiofa nwu kɔyɔ nta ye ni miɛ, ni bibawɛ lɛtɔtrɔ; <verse eid="DEU 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 11:28" />kafɔɔ nse biesĩ SAATE Yaa lee afiofa ole, biediɛ ɔkyɛ di osuku wɔ lɛtɔkɔ ye ni miɛ suoto, biɛkyɛ bitikanko bayaa bamba ba bitatofo nii, ni lɛkpaani dile dita ye. <verse eid="DEU 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 11:29" />Nse SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ ntɔɔkpaa fɔ ɛɛwako kasɔ ka fababuo fanaayɔ ni yi, faayie lɛtɔtrɔ lɛkya di Gerisim Kobokote osi, faabuɛ lɛkpaani ɔlaa kafɔɔ di Ebal Kobokote osi. <verse eid="DEU 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 11:30" />Fɛ mmle biye nii, abokote ya mmle nkpe di Yordan sɛmaa, di kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ osuku lɛkyɛ, diofe ni kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ, dikaako ni More awoso kplɛ nwu, di Kanaan batii ba ninsi ni di Araba kasɔ suoto di Gilgal ntɛɛ nwu. <verse eid="DEU 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 11:31" />Nfɛ biɔwa Yordan Okle ɔtaalɛ mimbuo minaayɔ kasɔ ka di SAATE Yaa lee kɔta ye nii. Nse bitɔɔlayɔ ka, nfɛ bisi ninfa, <verse eid="DEU 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 11:32" />bilolaa binyu bilɛ biele afiofa ku sɛsaabla se simuu kɔyɔ ntɛ ni di anu lee miɛ.<verse eid="DEU 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DEU 12" />
  <para style="s1">Lɛba Ninwii Diɛta Ni Yaa Kasumukɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 12:1" />Nnya afiofa ku sɛsaabla se dikpeni bielolaa bietikanko ni di kasɔ ka di SAATE nwu, bate lee Yaa kɔta ye alɛ biyɔ ni- di obe wɔ bisi ni di kasɔ nwu suoto. <verse eid="DEU 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 12:2" />Bilalaasa nnle be biofe ni otososa aba ya amuu maansumu ni bayaa lɛma, di abokote takale ku akpenkpe osi ku awoso biala niefukuti ni kalɔ klekle. <verse eid="DEU 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 12:3" />Bibibiɛ oleɔta akyikye lɛma nwu, biɛkpakpaa afiɔtii lɛma nwu, biefiɛ Asera sewoso lɛma nwu ku ɔtɔ; bilalaasa afiɔ bayaa lɛma nwu, biɛyɛɛsa ayooto lɛma di aba nwu.<verse eid="DEU 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 12:4" />Bitansumu SAATE Yaa lee di mmle mansumu ni ole ma kanya. <verse eid="DEU 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 12:5" />Kafɔɔ biwolaa lɛba le di SAATE Yaa lee kamadiki anta ye ni di ana lee nwu amuu kamɛ, alɛ Leyooto nɔɔ kate nimbla ni kasiɛkɔ nɔɔ. Lɛba nwu dikpeni minkyɛ nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 12:6" />Nfa bibawako ofiɛ asaaɔta lee ku seleɔta, akyuu fosile lee ku akyɛsaa finle, ku asaa ya biabuɛ biatɛ bilɛ bibata ni, ku situ-fãa lee kamɛ asaaɔta, ku banankyue ku bafoso lee abi lelofo kasale nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 12:7" />Lɛba nwu, di SAATE Yaa lee anu di aye ku ayo lee kamɛ batii kamale mannya suoto lɛyɔɔ di lɛsaa biala suoto bietika nnɛɛ lee nɛ. Diekye SAATE Yaa lee ntɔɔta ye lɛtɔtrɔ.<verse eid="DEU 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 12:8" />Bitambla fɛ mmle buɔɔbla ni ninfũ miɛ, fɛ mmle di otii biala kɔnya alɛ diesiɛko nii, <verse eid="DEU 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 12:9" />diekye biibuo ɔnyɛɛ katɛkɔ ku atesaa ya di SAATE Yaa lee kɔyɔ anta ye nii. <verse eid="DEU 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 12:10" />Kafɔɔ bibataalɛ Yordan Okle minaasiɛ di kasɔ ka di SAATE Yaa lee kɔyɔ anta ye ni fɛ atesaa, abata ye kafɔɔ minwɛ ɔnyɛɛ ɔtɛ di balo lee bamuu niɛmana ye beekyi ni suoto, di mmle bibasiɛ ni di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ. <verse eid="DEU 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 12:11" />Ni, di lɛba le di SAATE Yaa lee kamadiki anta ni fɛ Leyooto nɔɔ kasiɛkɔ yi- nfa bibayɔ lɛsaa biala lɛtɔkɔ ye ni minwako nɛ: ofiɛ asaaɔta ku seleɔta lee, akyuu fosile lee ku atasaa finle lee ku asaa ya amuu ninlɛ biabuɛ biatɛ bilɛ bibata ni SAATE nwu. <verse eid="DEU 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 12:12" />Binya suoto lɛyɔɔ di SAATE Yaa lee anu ninfa, aye bamu, babisuɔtɔbi lee, babisankobi lee, basuɔtɔ bakpɛmblatɛ ku basanko bakpɛmblatɛ lee ku Lewi batii ba niekye ni sekpoo lee, banaa ni kalekɔ ee atesaa lɛma amu. <verse eid="DEU 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 12:13" />Bilolaa binyu bilɛ biɛɛta ofiɛ asaaɔta lee di kakɔ lele ninlɛ ye nii. <verse eid="DEU 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 12:14" />Bita nya di lɛba le lete di SAATE nwu kamadiki anta ye ni di ana lee nwu kunwii kamɛ, nfa kafɔɔ biɛbla lɛsaa biala lɛtɔkɔ ye ni nɛ.<verse eid="DEU 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 12:15" />Kafɔɔ faafuo babɔkɛɛ lɛfɔ olo di okpoo lɛfɔ lele kamɛ, fanwee sina nwu fɛ mmle foomiɛ ni di lɛpɔ kanya, fɛ mmle dite ni fɛ kakpini ee kafɛ sina okle, di mmle kanya di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ lɛta fɔ ni lɛtɔtrɔ. Otii wɔ nieklekle ni ku nwɔ ninanklekle ni, akyuu lɛma anyɔ kafuo sina nwu ole. <verse eid="DEU 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 12:16" />Kafɔɔ diɛkaatɛ biele ntɔ nwu; binyɛɛnɛ mi biwii kaasɔ fɛle ntu. <verse eid="DEU 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 12:17" />Tanle asaa ya mmle di okpoo lɛfɔ omu kamɛ, atitabi lɛfɔ dikyuu fosile, nta fɔle ku nnɔnyi ee banankyue ku bafoso lɛfɔ lelofo kasale, ee lɛsaa lele feebuɛ fɛɛtɛ falɛ fabata nii, ee otu-fãa lɛfɔ kamɛ asaaɔta ee akyɛsaa finle ɔta. <verse eid="DEU 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 12:18" />Kafɔɔ bile nya di SAATE Yaa lee anu, di lɛba le di SAATE Yaa lee kamadiki ni- aye bamu, babisuɔtɔbi lee ku babisankobi lee, basuɔtɔ bakpɛmblatɛ ku basanko bakpɛmblatɛ lee ku Lewi batii ba niekye ni sekpoo lee. Binya suoto lɛyɔɔ di SAATE Yaa lee anu di lɛsaa biala suoto di nnɛɛ lee letika ni. <verse eid="DEU 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 12:19" />Lolaa fanyu falɛ faale fadiɛ Lewi batii nwu, di obe wɔ fɛɛnya fasi ni di kasɔ lɛfɔ suoto.<verse eid="DEU 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 12:20" />Nse SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ lɛblɛfɛsa kasɔ lɛfɔ fɛ mmle aabuɛ aatɛ aata fɔ nii, di sina nkle fɔ ɔkɔnsɔ, feebuɛ falɛ, “Komiɛ sina sewo owee,” yi, ni faafuo sĩ owee fɛ mmle foomiɛ ni di lɛpɔ kanya. <verse eid="DEU 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 12:21" />Nse lɛba le di SAATE Yaa lee lediki alɛ Leyooto nɔɔ dite ni lesii ye okyo yi, ni biafuo banankyue ku bafoso ba di SAATE nwu lɛta ye ni olo di sekpoo lee simu kamɛ, minwee sina nwu fɛ mmle kanya biomiɛ ni di lɛpɔ kanya, fɛ mmle latɔkɔ ye nii. <verse eid="DEU 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 12:22" />Biwee sĩ fɛ mmle biawee ni kakpini ee kafɛ. Batii ba nieklekle ni ku mba ninanklekle ni, akyuu lɛma anyɔ kafuo sĩ owee. <verse eid="DEU 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 12:23" />Kafɔɔ lolaa fanyu falɛ faale bɔkɛɛ nwu ntɔ, diekye ntɔ nwu ninle nkpa nɛ, nioso tanle nkpa nwu ku sina. <verse eid="DEU 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 12:24" />Tanle ntɔ nwu; nyɛɛnɛ mi fawii kaasɔ fɛle ntu. <verse eid="DEU 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 12:25" />Tanle mi, di mmle dialɛ ninta ni afɔ ku babi lɛfɔ ba sɛɛmaa lɛfɔ, diekye fabatɔɔbla lɛsaa le ninlɛ ni di SAATE nwu anu.<verse eid="DEU 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 12:26" />Kafɔɔ yɔ akleklesaa lɛfɔ nwu ku lɛsaa lele feebuɛ fɛɛtɛ falɛ fabata ni, faakyɛ lɛba le di SAATE nwu kamadiki antɛ ni. <verse eid="DEU 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 12:27" />Yɔ sina ku ntɔ, akyuu nwu anyɔ fata ofiɛ asaaɔta lɛfɔ di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ oleɔta akyikye suoto. Nyɛɛnɛ oleɔta ntɔ nwu fakpete di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ oleɔta akyikye suoto, kafɔɔ faafuo sina nwu owee. <verse eid="DEU 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 12:28" />Lolaa fanyu, faakyɔɔ kotoko di sɛlaa se simuu kɔta fɔ ni, ta mmle dibalɛ ninta ni afɔ ku babi lɛfɔ ba di sɛmaa lɛfɔ, diekye fababla lɛsaa le ninlɛ, diesiɛko ni di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ anu.<verse eid="DEU 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Osĩ Ɔta Di Afiɔ Osumu Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 12:29" />SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kamawɔɔsa nnle be nfɛ foofe ni odieko, fantososa ma ni di anu lɛfɔ. Kafɔɔ nse fatootososa ma feediki, nfɛ fasi di kasɔ lɛma nwu suoto, <verse eid="DEU 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 12:30" />ni nse batɔɔwɔɔsa ma di anu lɛfɔ beeloo yi, lolaa fanyu falɛ dikyĩ diemufũ fɔ, alɛ foowolaa bayaa lɛma nwu kamɛ fambuɛ falɛ, “Lɛ kanya di nnle be mmle nsumu bayaa lɛma nwu? Awoo bubabla nkpo.” <verse eid="DEU 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 12:31" />Diɛkaatɛ feesumu SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ di osuku lɛma kanya, diekye di bayaa lɛma kasumu kamɛ yi, mambla ayududusaa ateate amuu ya di SAATE nwu lekyidi nii. Bia manfiɛ babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi lɛma di ɔtɔ kamɛ manta bayaa lɛma oleɔta.<verse eid="DEU 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 12:32" />Binyu bilɛ biɛbla di sɛlaa se simuu lɛtɔkɔ ye ni; bitankyakaa lɛsaalɛsaa ee biadiki lɛsaalɛsaa kaamɛ.<verse eid="DEU 12:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="DEU 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Osĩ Ɔta Di Bayaa Bamba Kasumu Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 13:1" />Nse ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ ee alaafɔ kasɔ dikitɛ nsi di kamɛ lee, ɛɛbla lɛsaa le niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ ee dituosaa lewo, <verse eid="DEU 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 13:2" />di lɛsaa le niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ ee lɛblasaa nwu eebuɛ ni lɛwa kaanya, kafɔɔ eebuɛ alɛ, “Bita butikanko bayaa bamba” (bayaa ba bitatofo nii) ni bitabusumu ma yi,” <verse eid="DEU 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 13:3" />bitannu ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ ee kɔlaafɔ kasɔ dikitɛ nwu nkpo ɔlaa. SAATE Yaa lee nikɔsɔ ye annyu nse mimbɔmbɔ nwɔ ku otu lee omuu ku ɔkla lee omuu. <verse eid="DEU 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 13:4" />SAATE Yaa lee dikpeni bietakanko, lete nɔɔ kafɔɔ dikpeni biɛyɔ dibu biɛta. Bile afiofa nɔɔ, bienu nwɔ ɔlaa; bisumu nwɔ, bieklee nwɔ kpinkpĩ. <verse eid="DEU 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 13:5" />Dikpeni bielo ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ ee alaafɔ kasɔ dikitɛ nwu nkpo, diekye eebuɛ ɔtaka oyila ɔlaa di SAATE Yaa lee suoto, nnwɔ niakpaa ye aadieko ni di Egipte, aadiki ye ni di sɛlanle kasɔ suoto; eekpee kɔnyaabe alɛ ookyisa ye anu di osuku wɔ suoto di SAATE Yaa lee latɔkɔ ye alɛ bikyɛ nii. Dikpeni biediki otii kpile nwu di kamɛ lee.<verse eid="DEU 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 13:6" />Nse obilee-suɔtɔbi omuomu, ee obisuɔtɔbi ee obisankobi lɛfɔ, ee ɔsɔfɔ lɛfɔ wɔ fambɔmbɔ ni, ee siɛwo lɛfɔ wɔ niɛtɛ akaako fɔ ni lɛkyɔnkyɔ fɔ di lewofa kamɛ alɛ, “Ta bukyɛ buɔlaasumu bayaa bamba” (bayaa ba di afɔ ee bawa lɛfɔ ditatofo nii, <verse eid="DEU 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 13:7" />batii ba ninsi bɛɛmana fɔ beekyi ni bayaa, kuntɛ bɛɛtɛɛtɛɛ ee beekyo, diɛyɔ ni di kasɔ disi le diɛlaase ni di disi le), <verse eid="DEU 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 13:8" />tannu nwɔ ɔlaa ee faakyɔɔ nwɔ atoko. Tan-nyɔɔ nyaami. Tankyɛ nwɔ ee faatĩtĩi nwɔ. <verse eid="DEU 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 13:9" />Nwaako dikpeni feelo nwɔ. Kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ dikpeni kuole kɔkasale nimalo nwɔ nii, fiɛ di batii bamuu nnɛɛ. <verse eid="DEU 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 13:10" />Safɔ nwɔ afuɔ aakpi, diekye eemiɛ alɛ ookyisa fɔ di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ wɔ niakpaa fɔ aadieko ni di Egipte, aadiki ni di sɛlanle kasɔ suoto. <verse eid="DEU 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 13:11" />Ni Israel batii bamuu kamanu manyɛkɛ, ni otii kuonwii di kamɛ lee dilɔbasinkple abla lɛsaa kpile le mmle okle.<verse eid="DEU 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 13:12" />Nse feenu di sekpoo se di SAATE Yaa lefɔ kɔyɔ anta fɔ ni alɛ siɛ ni owo kamɛ alɛ, <verse eid="DEU 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 13:13" />batii kpile bawo ntɔɔtaka kaamɛ lee bɛɛkyɔnkyɔ okpoo lɛma batii, boobuɛ alɛ, “Bita bukyɛ buɔlaasumu bayaa bamba” (bayaa ba bitatofo nii), <verse eid="DEU 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 13:14" />ni dikpeni feewolaa, fɛɛkpɛnkpɛ, feebuo kafɔɔ kaamɛ nwaa feenyu. Ni nse nwaako dietuo alɛ bɛɛbla diyududusaa le mmle kaamɛ lee yi, <verse eid="DEU 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 13:15" />ni dikpeni bielo batii nwu bamuu ninsi ni di okpoo nwu kamɛ. Biwɔɔsa okpoo nwu klekle, batii ku babɔkɛɛ sele lɛma, akyuu nwu anyɔ. <verse eid="DEU 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 13:16" />Bisiisa okpoo nwu asaa amuu di lɛkpaka ntɛɛ, biɛfiɛ okpoo nwu ku asaa ninwu amuu fɛ ofiɛ asaaɔta ya bɛɛta ni SAATE Yaa lee. Diekple kawɔɔ ka ninaa ni kaloo, alɛ blaasinse nwu letofo diidii. <verse eid="DEU 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 13:17" />Dinaa alɛ bɛɛnyako ye kawɔɔsa asaa nwu di nnɛɛ lee, di mmle di SAATE nwu ɔblɔ yakayaka nɔɔ nwu kayɔɔ ni; abanya fɔ nyaami, anle fɔ sibualɛ, anta kɔna lɛfɔ nkpɛ, fɛ mmle aabuɛ aatɛ aata ni bawa lɛfɔ, <verse eid="DEU 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 13:18" />ta mmle feenu ni SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ ɔlaa, feele ni afiofa nɔɔ nwu amuu ya kɔyɔ nta fɔ ni miɛ, fambla ni lɛsaa le ninlɛ ni di anu nɔɔ oso.<verse eid="DEU 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="DEU 14" />
  <para style="s1">Kaku Kamɛ Ɔsaabla Wɔ Beesĩ Nii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 14:1" />SAATE Yaa lee babi bile. Bitankyankya suoto lee ee bikpaasu asi lee ta bakpi oso, <verse eid="DEU 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 14:2" />diekye batii klekle bile bita SAATE Yaa lee. Di batii bamuu di kasɔ anu suoto di SAATE nwu lediki ye alɛ bile nwɔ bale bamu.<verse eid="DEU 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Babɔkɛɛ Ba Nieklekle Ni Ku Mba Ninanklekle Nii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 14:3" />Tanle diyududusaa kuninwii. <verse eid="DEU 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 14:4" />Nnya babɔkɛɛ ba bikpe osuku minle ni: nankyue, foso ku tie, <verse eid="DEU 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 14:5" />kakpini ku kuɔ, kapoodina, dufu, kɔkɔ̀, kafɛ ku ɔtrɔmu. <verse eid="DEU 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 14:6" />Biafuo bɔkɛɛ lele di obo nte ni di lɛkpɔbi nɔɔ, diɛsɛ ni di akyuu anyɔ, ankple anyiensa alesaa anwee ni ole. <verse eid="DEU 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 14:7" />Kafɔɔ mba ninwee ni sɛfa mankple manyiensa man-wee ni ee di obo diete ni di akpɔbi lɛma saa yi, bitanle ma. Mma ninle kapupɔnkɔ, fɔmisii ee saafɔ. Kuntɛ man-wee sɛfa mankple manyiensa man-wee yi, obo diete ma di akpɔbi; nioso baale babɔkɛɛ klekle bata ye. <verse eid="DEU 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 14:8" />Lɛplakuo kafɔɔ diɛbla klekle; kuntɛ obo nte di lɛkpɔbi nɔɔ yi, annwee alesaa aakple aayiensa aawee. Nioso bitanle sina lɛma ee biakpanko bakpi lɛma.<verse eid="DEU 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 14:9" />Di asaa ya amuu ninsi ni di ntu kamɛ yi, biafuo lelele di kobembe n-yɛ, akpe ni apoo kafɔɔ ole. <verse eid="DEU 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 14:10" />Kafɔɔ lɛsaa lele ninaa ni kobembe ku apoo yi, bitanle nya; aabla klekle ata ye.<verse eid="DEU 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 14:11" />Biafuo kansiɛ lele niɛbla ni klekle ole. <verse eid="DEU 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 14:12" />Kafɔɔ mba biɛtanle ni ninle: klikpo, lelente, lelente wɛɛfɛɛ, <verse eid="DEU 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 14:13" />kɔɔlɛ sɛɛle, kɔɔlɛ wɛɛfɛɛ, ku balele ninte ni fɛle klikpo, <verse eid="DEU 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 14:14" />bakwakwalobi lele, <verse eid="DEU 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 14:15" />disukusuku le nin-yɛ ni akya, basɛɛ disukusuku, lekpo kansiɛ, kakyɛ lele, <verse eid="DEU 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 14:16" />disukusuku le biibii, disukusuku le kplɛ, disukusuku le fututu, <verse eid="DEU 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 14:17" />ɔfaafuu disukusuku, kakyɛ ka kplɛ, lekpo kansiɛ kplɛ, <verse eid="DEU 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 14:18" />kakyakpodi, okle kotoko kansiɛ lele, ansĩi ku lɛpãa.<verse eid="DEU 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 14:19" />Kɔbɔbɔbii ko kumuu ninflɛlɛtɛ ni di dikudi kamɛ dieklekle kuta ye; bitanle kũ. <verse eid="DEU 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 14:20" />Kafɔɔ biafuo kabɔkɔbi lele ninkpe ni afoko keeklekle ni ole.<verse eid="DEU 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 14:21" />Bitanle lɛsaa lele biɛnya bilɛ ditookpi ni kofokofoko. Biafuo ni ɔyɔ ɔta ɔfɔɔ wɔ ninsi ni di sekpoo lee nwu lele kamɛ anle ee minsunsũ minta kale bamba otii. Kafɔɔ batii klekle bile bita SAATE Yaa lee.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 14:21">Bitan-wa tie dibi di ɔya nnyɛɛntu kamɛ.<verse eid="DEU 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Afiofa Di Akyuu Fosile Ɔta Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 14:22" />Nyu falɛ feediki dikyuu fosile di kofe lɛfɔ alesaa amuu fɛɛwɛ ni lɛlɛɛ biala fɛɛtɛ lete. <verse eid="DEU 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 14:23" />Faale dikyuu fosile di atitabi, nta fɔle, nnɔnyi, banankyue ku bafoso lɛfɔ lelofo kasale nwu di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ anu, di lɛba le abadiki anta alɛ Leyooto nɔɔ dite ni, di mmle faatekete ni mmle fabayɔ dibu fanta ni SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ obe lele. <verse eid="DEU 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 14:24" />Kafɔɔ nse lɛba nwu lesii okyo, di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ lɛta fɔ lɛtɔtrɔ, alɛ flɔbafuo dikyuu fosile lɛfɔ nwu otuka (ta lɛba le di SAATE kamadiki anta ni Leyooto nɔɔ kalɛɛkɔ lekyo ni oso yi), <verse eid="DEU 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 14:25" />ni kyɛlɛnsa dikyuu fosile lɛfɔ nwu faafũ koto fututu, faayɔ koto fututu nwu fasifiko lɛba le di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kamadiki antɛ ni. <verse eid="DEU 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 14:26" />Yɔ koto fututu nwu faya lɛsaa lele ninlɛ fɔ: nankyue, foso, nta ee nta siene ee lɛsaa lele niekye fɔ ni di otu. Di afɔ ku leyo lɛfɔ kamɛ batii bile nya ninfa, biɛnya suoto lɛyɔɔ di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ anu. <verse eid="DEU 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 14:27" />Tantɛ Lewi batii ba ninsi ni di sekpoo lɛfɔ sɛmɛntu, diekye banaa kalekɔ ee atesaa lɛma amu.<verse eid="DEU 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 14:28" />Di lɛlɛɛ tiɛfa biala kayɛntɛkɔ yi, yɔ alesaa ya fɛɛwɛ ni dikyuu fosile fabatɛ di sekpoo lɛfɔ nwu, <verse eid="DEU 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 14:29" />di mmle di Lewi batii (ba ninaa ni kalekɔ ee atesaa lɛma amu) ku bafɔɔ, bakuɛbi ku bakpisɔfɔ ba ninsi ni di sekpoo lɛfɔ kawa mamale mam-miɛ nii, di mmle di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kata fɔ ni lɛtɔtrɔ di nnɛɛ lɛfɔ ɔkpɛ ɔbla omuu kamɛ.<verse eid="DEU 14:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="DEU 15" />
  <para style="s1">Ato Ya Basiko Ni Ɔyɔ Ɔkyɛ Lɛlɛɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 15:1" />Di lɛlɛɛ kuɛnsinle biala kayɛntɛkɔ yi, dikpeni biɛyɔ ato biala basiko ye ni biɛkyɛ. <verse eid="DEU 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 15:2" />Nnya mmle kanya baabla ni: Otii biala niɛfɛnsa koto ɛɛta owo nɔɔ Israel otii yi, atantufu owo nɔɔ Israel otii ee obilɛma koto nwu, diekye batooyie lɛkya di obe wɔ di SAATE nwu lɛtɛ alɛ bayɔ ato nwu bakyɛ ni suoto. <verse eid="DEU 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 15:3" />Faafuo ɔfɔɔ koto otufu, kafɔɔ dikpeni fɛɛyɔ koto ko di obilee Israel otii nsiko fɔ ni fɛɛkyɛ nwɔ. <verse eid="DEU 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 15:4" />Kafɔɔ, diɛkaatɛ piitɛ kuonwii lɛwɛ di kamɛ lee, diekye SAATE Yaa lee kamata ye lɛtɔtrɔ nwaa di kasɔ ka ɔɔyɔ anta ye alɛ biyɔ ni fɛ atesaa lee, <verse eid="DEU 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 15:5" />nse nwaako feenu SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ ɔlaa, feelolaa afiofa ya mmle amuu kɔyɔ nta ye ni miɛ bietikanko. <verse eid="DEU 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 15:6" />Diekye SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kamata fɔ lɛtɔtrɔ fɛ mmle aabuɛ aatɛ ni kanya, fabafɛnsa ato fanta nnle kpinwu, kafɔɔ afɔ flɔbafɛnsa di kuonwii ɔkyɛ. Fabale sɛka di nnle kpinwu suoto, kafɔɔ afɔ kale kukanwii dilɔbale sɛka di suoto lɛfɔ.<verse eid="DEU 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 15:7" />Nse otii owo nle piitɛ di babilee kamɛ di sekpoo se di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kɔyɔ anta fɔ ni owo kamɛ yi, tamblɔɔ disiosie ee kɔnɛɛ koklo di obilee piitɛ nwu suoto. <verse eid="DEU 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 15:8" />Kafɔɔ fukuti kɔnɛɛ ku otu, faafɛnsa nwɔ lɛsaa lele oomiɛ. <verse eid="DEU 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 15:9" />Lolaa fanyu falɛ disibu kpile le mmle diesiɛ fɔ diisi alɛ: “Lɛlɛɛ kuɛnsinle, ninle ni lɛlɛɛ le man-yɔ ato mankyɛ ni ntɔɔtɛɛtɛɛ,” di mmle fanaanyu ni obilee nwu diefĩ ni nyakatãa alɛ faatɔɔ ni lɛsalɛsaa. Abafuo ɔfaa ɔlɛɛ SAATE nwu ankpee fɔ, nimale okpile ninta fɔ. <verse eid="DEU 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 15:10" />Fukuti kɔnɛɛ faatɔɔ, ninanle ni di ninukakatu kanya; ni ta nle mmle oso, SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kamata fɔ lɛtɔtrɔ di ɔkpɛ lɛfɔ omuu kamɛ ku lɛsaa lele di kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ lɛkpanko. <verse eid="DEU 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 15:11" />Bapiitɛ kamawɛ di kasɔ nwu obe lele. Nioso kɔtɔkɔ fɔ nlɛ fukuti kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ fata babilee ku bapiitɛ ku mba diefĩ ni di kasɔ lɛfɔ suoto.<verse eid="DEU 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmle Kanya Baaklee Ni Balanle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 15:12" />Nse owo lɛfɔ Hebri otii, osuɔtɔ ee ɔsanko lɛyɔ suoto nɔɔ eesunsũ, eesumu fɔ alɛɛ akuɔ yi, ni dikpeni fantɔɔ ansifi di lɛlɛɛ kuɛsinle kamɛ ku atoko ɔkyɛ ole. <verse eid="DEU 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 15:13" />Ni nse feediki nwɔ osuku yi, tantɔɔ aasifi nnɛɛ fukuti. <verse eid="DEU 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 15:14" />Fukuti kafutu, faatɔɔ babɔkɛɛ sele, atitabi ku nta lɛfɔ nwu. Tɔɔ asaa fɛ mmle kanya di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ lɛta fɔ ni lɛtɔtrɔ. <verse eid="DEU 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 15:15" />Nyuma falɛ afɔɔ ɔlanle faale di Egipte kasɔ, ni di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ ladiki fɔ nɛ. Nkpo oso kokpee fɔ kufiofa ko mmle miɛ nɛ.<verse eid="DEU 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 15:16" />Kafɔɔ nse kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ nwu lebuɛ alɛ, “Noomiɛ nlɛ nsifi ndiɛ fɔ,” ta ambɔmbɔ ni afɔ ku leyo lɛfɔ kamɛ batii oso, di ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ nlɛ ditɔɔ yi, <verse eid="DEU 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 15:17" />ni yɔ ofutuwɛ faadufu nwɔ kotoko dibi di kokloo lɛfɔ suoto, ni abakple kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ ninaase di dikpiyi nɔɔ. Bla di akpanwu fata ɔsanko kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ.<verse eid="DEU 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 15:18" />Tanta diawɛ fɔ osie alɛ faadiki kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ osuku ansifi, diekye ɔkpɛ nɔɔ ɔbla ɔta fɔ alɛɛ akuɔ ya mmle ntɔɔbla fɛ paa-letɛ kablakɔ sɛnyɔ nɔɔ. Ni SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kamata fɔ lɛtɔtrɔ di ɔsaabla lɛfɔ biala kamɛ.<verse eid="DEU 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Banankyue Ku Bafoso Abi Kasale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 15:19" />Di banankyue ku bafoso lɛfɔ abi-suɔtɔbi beelofo ni kasale biala kamɛ yi, diki ma fase lete fata SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ. Tanta nankyue-suɔtɔ lɛfɔ kasale beelofo ni labla ɔkpɛ, tan-nwinwɛ kafɔɔ foso lɛfɔ kasale beelofo ni sinwini. <verse eid="DEU 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 15:20" />Di lɛlɛɛ biala kamɛ afɔ ku leyo lɛfɔ batii biwee ma di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ anu di lɛba le abadiki antɛ ni. <verse eid="DEU 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 15:21" />Nse bɔkɛɛ owo nkpe kɔbɔ, ookpintĩ ee anu lɛbiɛ nwɔ ee lɛsaa lɛblɔɔ osie kanya yi, ni diɛkaatɛ fan-yɔ nwɔ fanta oleɔta fanta SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ. <verse eid="DEU 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 15:22" />Wee sĩ di afɔ omu sekpoo kamɛ. Batii ba niɛbla ni klekle ku mba ninambla ni klekle kafuo ma owee, fɛ nse kakpini ee kafɛ kale. <verse eid="DEU 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 15:23" />Kafɔɔ diɛkaatɛ biele ntɔ nwu; binyɛɛnɛ mi biwii kaasɔ fɛle ntu.<verse eid="DEU 15:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="DEU 16" />
  <para style="s1">Okpi Diisi Ofe Ole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 16:1" />Nyuma kɔwɛntɛ ko manlɛɛ ni Abib<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nkũ ninle kɔwɛntɛ kasale di Israel batii awɛntɛ kamɛ nɛ</char></note>, faale SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ Okpi Diisi Ofe Dii nwu, diekye Abib kɔwɛntɛ nwu kamɛ di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ lakpaa fɔ aadieko di Egipte kasɔ ku kakyɛ nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 16:2" />Nioso ta nankyue ee foso fɛ Okpi Diisi Ofe oleɔta fata SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ di lɛba le di SAATE nwu kamadiki anta alɛ Leyooto nɔɔ dite ni. <verse eid="DEU 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 16:3" />Tanwee sĩ ku bloblo wɔ beekpee ni lɛnyankasaa, kafɔɔ le bloblo wɔ ninantaka ni ayi akuɛnsĩ, dibuo ɔnya bloblo nwu, diekye nkyenkye biadie di Egipte kasɔ- di mmle di obe lele faanyuma ni obe wɔ faadie ni di Egipte kasɔ di nkpa lɛfɔ ayi amuu kamɛ. <verse eid="DEU 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 16:4" />Tanta baanya lɛnyankasaa di suoto lɛfɔ di kasɔ lɛfɔ kamuu suoto di ayi akuɛnsĩ nwu kamɛ. Tanta sina se fɛɛyɔ fɛɛta ni ɔleɔta di dii kasale kɔtɔɔfɔ nwu kusinwii labu kale lasɛ.<verse eid="DEU 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 16:5" />Tanta Okpi Diisi Ofe oleɔta nwu di sekpoo se di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ lɛta fɔ ni kuonwii kamɛ, <verse eid="DEU 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 16:6" />diediki di lɛba le di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kamadiki anta alɛ Leyooto nɔɔ dite nii. Lɛba nwu dikpeni fɛɛta Okpi Diisi Ofe bɔkɛɛ nwu ku kɔtɔɔfɔ nɛ, nse kufĩ ntɔɔmɛɛ, di odie lɛfɔ dii di Egipte kasɔ suoto. <verse eid="DEU 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 16:7" />Bifiɛ sĩ biwee di lɛba le di SAATE Yaa lee kamadiki anta ni. Ni kaleesɛ oyita faakple fasifi lɛkpaayo lɛfɔ kamɛ. <verse eid="DEU 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 16:8" />Le bloblo wɔ ninantaka ni ayi akuɔ, dii kuɛnsinle bisi dikudi biesumu SAATE Yaa lee, nioso bitambla ɔkpɛ kuonwii.<verse eid="DEU 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ofiɛlɛbee Dii Ole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 16:9" />Ka banawɔkyi bakuɛnsĩ, diɛyɔ di obe wɔ feekye ni kamɔɔ ofiɛlɛ kasɔ. <verse eid="DEU 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 16:10" />Ni faale Banawɔkyi Dii nwu fata SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ, faata asaaɔta ku otu-fãa di mmle kanya di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ lɛta fɔ ni lɛtɔtrɔ fɛɛwɛ ni. <verse eid="DEU 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 16:11" />Ni faanya suoto lɛyɔɔ, afɔ, babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi lɛfɔ, bakpɛmblatɛ basuɔtɔ ku bakpɛmblatɛ basanko lɛfɔ, Lewi batii ba di sekpoo lɛfɔ ku bafɔɔ, bakuɛbi ku bakpisɔfɔ ba ninsi ni di kamɛ lee- di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ anu di lɛba le abadiki anta ni alɛ Leyooto nɔɔ dite ni. <verse eid="DEU 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 16:12" />Nyuma falɛ balanle biale di Egipte, nioso bilolaa afiofa ya mmle bitikanko nwaa.<verse eid="DEU 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akpanta Klekle Dii Ole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 16:13" />Nse fatoosiisa kɔfe lɛfɔ asaa ku nta lɛfɔ feeloo yi, ni faale Akpanta Klekle Dii nwu ayi akuɛnsĩ. <verse eid="DEU 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 16:14" />Nya suoto lɛyɔɔ di Dii nwu ole kamɛ- afɔ, babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi lɛfɔ, bakpɛmblatɛ-suɔtɔ ku bakpɛmblatɛ-sanko, Lewi batii ku bafɔɔ, bakuɛbi ku bakpisɔfɔ ba ninsi ni di sekpoo lɛfɔ kamɛ. <verse eid="DEU 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 16:15" />Ayi akuɛnsĩ faale Dii nwu nkpo fata SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ di lɛba le di SAATE nwu kamadiki antɛ ni. Diekye SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kamata fɔ lɛtɔtrɔ di alesaa lɛfɔ ku nnɛɛ lɛfɔ ɔkpɛ omuu, ni suoto lɛyɔɔ lɛfɔ kamawo niimu.<verse eid="DEU 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 16:16" />Dikpeni basuɔtɔ lɛfɔ bamuu lɛwa SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ anu sitiɛ di lɛlɛɛ kamɛ di lɛba le di Yaa lɛfɔ kamadiki antɛ nii: nnya ninle Bloblo wɔ Ninantaka ni Dii, Banawɔkyi Dii ku Akpanta Dii nɛ. Otii kuonwii atanwa SAATE nwu anu nnɛɛ fukuti: <verse eid="DEU 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 16:17" />Dikpeni obiala lee lɛwako lɛkyɛsaa di mmle kanya di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ lɛta fɔ ni lɛtɔtrɔ.<verse eid="DEU 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Afiofa Ɛɛta ni Bakantɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 16:18" />Diki bakantɛ ku banɔɔfotii fata di kɔna lee biala kamɛ di okpoo biala di SAATE Yaa lee kɔta fɔ ni, mma kafɔɔ nimakanko batii nwu di osuku kanya nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 16:19" />Baka lɛka onukwale kanya ee batannyu kuonwii di anu. Batanfũ ditunu kamɛ lɛsaa, diekye ditunu kamɛ lɛsaa mmbiɛsa numbentɛ anu, ninfintinsa batii tinini sɛlaa. <verse eid="DEU 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 16:20" />Tikanko onukwale, onukwale lete, di mmle faasiɛ ni nkpa fanaayɔ ni kasɔ ka di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kɔta fɔ ni.<verse eid="DEU 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bayaa Bamba Kasumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 16:21" />Tanse Asera owoso kuonwii di oleɔta akyikye ya fɛɛpɛ fɛɛta ni SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ ɔlɔɔkɔ, <verse eid="DEU 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 16:22" />tantɛ difiɔtii kuninwii kafɔɔ, diekye SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ lekyidisaa dile.<verse eid="DEU 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="DEU 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 17:1" />Tan-yɔ nankyue ee foso wɔ ninkpe ni kɔbɔ ee ɛɛkyɛlɛ ni faata oleɔta faata SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ, diekye diyududusaa dibale nintɔɔ.<verse eid="DEU 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 17:2" />Nse fɛɛnya osuɔtɔ ee ɔsanko owo ninsi ni di kamɛ lee di sekpoo se di SAATE nwu lɛta fɔ ni onwii kamɛ, kɔbla sikpile di SAATE Yaa lefɔ anu, ɛɛwaalɛ kanya ninii nɔɔ nwu yi, <verse eid="DEU 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 17:3" />eesĩ kufiofa nii nwu ɛɛlaasumu bayaa bamba, ɛɛwakasɔ ɛɛta ma, kufĩ ee kɔwɛntɛ ee awɛntrɛbi di kolo, <verse eid="DEU 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 17:4" />bɛɛta fɔ letofo, ni dikpeni feewolaa nwu kamɛ nwaa. Nse nwaako dile di kamɛ lɛkpa alɛ bɛɛbla diyududusaa le mmle di Israel kasɔ yi, <verse eid="DEU 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 17:5" />ni kpaa osuɔtɔ ee ɔsanko nwu niɛbla ni dikpilesaa le mmle fasifiko okpoo kplɛ lɛfɔ nwu lɛkpaka biɛsafɔ otii nwu afuɔ bilo. <verse eid="DEU 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 17:6" />Di kamaabayilatɛ banyɔ ee batiɛ kanya ɔlaa suoto fiɛ bielo otii nwu, kafɔɔ bitan-yɔ kamaayilatɛ onwii lete kanya ɔlaa bialo otii. <verse eid="DEU 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 17:7" />Kamaabayilatɛ nwu nnɛɛ ninkasa nwɔ afuɔ ɔsafɔ, fiɛ di batii bamuu nnɛɛ basafɔ nwɔ afuɔ aakpi. Dikpeni biediki dikpilesaa nwu di kamɛ lee.<verse eid="DEU 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kufiofa Nkankɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 17:8" />Nse bɛɛwako sɛlaa se niesii ni osie di nkankɔ lɛfɔ alɛ ka- fɛle ntɔ owii, ɔlaa ɔsama ee kakpɛ ɔlaa yi- kpaa ma fasifiko lɛba le di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kamadiki antɛ ni. <verse eid="DEU 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 17:9" />Yɔ ɔlaa nwu fatɛ di olebatatɛ ba ninle ni Lewi batii ku kantɛ wɔ nin-yɛ ni kaanya di obe nwu nkpo kamɛ anu. Bababuɛ ɔlaa nwu mambudi nwu disi. <verse eid="DEU 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 17:10" />Dikpeni feediki kɔkpaa di mmle kanya bɛɛtɔkɔ fɔ ni di lɛba le di SAATE nwu kamadiki nii. Lolaa fanyu, faabla di lɛsaa biala bɛɛtɔkɔ fɔ alɛ bla ni kanya. <verse eid="DEU 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 17:11" />Tankyi faafe oletanɛɛkyɛ ee ɔmɛntukyɛ di ɔlaa wɔ bɛɛtɔkɔ fɔ nii. Diki kɔkpaa di kufiofa ko beetuo fɔ ni ku mmle beebudisa ni ɔlaa nwu nkpo kanya. <verse eid="DEU 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 17:12" />Dikpeni beelo otii wɔ ninambu ni kantɛ nwu ɔlaa ee oletatɛ wɔ nin-yɛ ɔɔka ni lɛka ninfa anta ni SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ ɔlaa. Dikpeni feediki dikpilesaa nwu di Israel. <verse eid="DEU 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 17:13" />Batii bamuu kamanu ɔlaa nwu man-yɛkɛ kafɔɔ, mandiɛ lɛsaa-tambu nwu okle.<verse eid="DEU 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asaa Otuo Di Ɔka Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 17:14" />Nse feebuo kasɔ ka di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kɔta fɔ ni, fatɔɔyɔ ka nfɛ fasi ninka suoto, feebuɛ falɛ, “Ta buse ɔka buta suoto fɛle nnle be niɛmana wo diekyi ni yi,” <verse eid="DEU 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 17:15" />ni nyu falɛ feese ɔka wɔ di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kamadiki ni. Dikpeni ankye babilee-suɔtɔbi bamu kamɛ. Tanse ɔfɔɔ ɔka faata suoto, nnwɔ ninanle ni obilee-suɔtɔbi Israel otii omu. <verse eid="DEU 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 17:16" />Kafɔɔ diɛkaatɛ ɔka nwu n-wɛ bapɔnkɔ kpinwu ɛɛta suoto nɔɔ ee ata batii nwu lakple baasifi Egipte balaamiɛ ma bakyakaa, diekye SAATE nwu latɔkɔ ye alɛ, “Bitasinkple biasifi di osuku nwu suoto.” <verse eid="DEU 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 17:17" />Diɛkaatɛ ɔka nwu n-yɔ basɔfɔ kpinwu, nse diele nkpo, otu nɔɔ kamayu osuku. Diɛkaatɛ an-wɛ koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle kpinwu.<verse eid="DEU 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 17:18" />Nse ɛɛbasiɛ di sɛka kalekɔ nɔɔ lɛkakpomii suoto yi, aase kufiofa ko mmle eefũ eekyeko ni Lewi batii ba ninle ni olebatatɛ ɔkyɛ lɛ̀kpana di kukũ suoto ata suoto nɔɔ. <verse eid="DEU 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 17:19" />Kukũ nwu kuwɛ di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ, aaka kũ di nkpa nɔɔ ayi amuu kamɛ, di mmle abatekete ni mmle aayɔ dibu anta ni SAATE Yaa nɔɔ, anlolaa afiofa nɔɔ ya mmle sɛlaa ku sisuku se mmle simuu antikanko ni nwaa. <verse eid="DEU 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 17:20" />Atannyu suoto nɔɔ alɛ ɛɛtaka katoo alenke babilɛma-suɔtɔbi, diata aakyi di kufiofa nwu suoto afe oletanɛɛkyɛ ee ɔmɛntukyɛ. Ni nnwɔɔ ku banantii nɔɔ kamale sɛka ninklɛ di sɛka kalekɔ nɔɔ nwu di Israel kasɔ suoto.<verse eid="DEU 17:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="DEU 18" />
  <para style="s1">Olebatatɛ Ku Lewi Batii Kalekɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 18:1" />Olebatatɛ ba ninle ni Lewi batii- nwaako Lewi kɔna kumuu- banaa kalekɔ ee atesaa ku Israel batii. Asaaɔta ya bɛɛta ni SAATE nwu ku ɔtɔ suoto babasiɛ nkpa, diekye nnya ninle atesaa lɛma nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 18:2" />Blɔbawɛ atesaa kuanwii di babilɛma kamɛ; SAATE nwu ninle atesaa lɛma, fɛ mmle aabuɛ aatɛ aata ma nii.<verse eid="DEU 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 18:3" />Nnya kalekɔ ka di olebatatɛ mafũ mankyeko ni batii ba niɛta ni nankyue-suɔtɔ ku foso oleɔta nfũ: kɔnɛɛ, kayɛɛ ku ayɔɔsaa. <verse eid="DEU 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 18:4" />Yɔ kofe lɛfɔ alesaa kasale, sɛlɔɔtu, nnɔnyi fɔle ku foso lɛfɔ kukũ kasale beediki ni fata ma, <verse eid="DEU 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 18:5" />diekye SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ niediki ma ku banantii lɛma di ana lee nwu amuu kamɛ alɛ bayila baasumu di SAATE nwu leyooto kamɛ obe lele.<verse eid="DEU 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 18:6" />Nse Lewi otii ledie di sekpoo lee onwii kamɛ di kakɔ lele di Israel di nfũ asi nii, ɛɛwa ku otu nɔɔ omuu di lɛba le di SAATE nwu kamadiki nii yi, <verse eid="DEU 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 18:7" />ni aafuo osumu di SAATE Yaa nɔɔ leyooto kamɛ fɛle mmle di Lewi batii wo nɔɔ bamuu kosumu ni ninfa di SAATE nwu anu. <verse eid="DEU 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 18:8" />Nnwɔɔ kafɔɔ batɔɔ asaa nwu bɛɛwɛ ni kyɛkyɛ, kuntɛ atoofũ koto eekyeko leyo lɛma kamɛ asaa osunsũ kamɛ.<verse eid="DEU 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kufiofa Di Ayududusaa Sɛsaabla Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 18:9" />Nse feebuo kasɔ ka di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kɔyɔ anta fɔ nii yi, tannyunko nnle nwu nkpo ninfa ayududusaa ya bɔɔbla nii. <verse eid="DEU 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 18:10" />Bitanta baanya alɛ onwii di kamɛ lee lɛyɔ obisuɔtɔbi ee obisankobi nɔɔ ɛɛta oleɔta di ɔtɔ kamɛ, mankaalɛ ni asaa, sɛbɔ-ɔpɛ ee asaa ɔnya kasɔ odiki, sɛsɛɛ, <verse eid="DEU 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 18:11" />ee afasaa ee kabia ee fablatɛ ee nnwɔ ninkpa ni bakpi. <verse eid="DEU 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 18:12" />Olele nimbla asaa ya mmle okle, lɛbla diyududusaa ɛɛta SAATE nwu, ta ayududusaa ya mmle ɔbla kafɔɔ oso di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kamatososa nnle nwu nkpo di anu lɛfɔ nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 18:13" />Tanta olè kuonwii lawɛ fɔ di suoto di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ anu.<verse eid="DEU 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Okyesee Obuɛ Ɔtɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 18:14" />Nnle be foofe ni otososa lefũ sɛbɔ ɔpɛ ku asaa ɔkaalɛ beenu. Kafɔɔ afɔ SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ diɛta fɔ osuku alɛ bla nkpo. <verse eid="DEU 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 18:15" />SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kamadiki Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ di babilee suɔtɔbi kamɛ fɛle ami Mose okle anta ye. Nioso binu nwɔ ɔlaa. <verse eid="DEU 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 18:16" />Diekye nle mmle biakaalɛ SAATE Yaa lee di Horeb Kobokote nɛ, di dii le biasi ni dikudi biabuɛ ni bilɛ, “Tansinta wo buanu SAATE Yaa loo sɛlɔ ee buakple buanya ɔtɔ kplɛ wɔ mmle diidii, nse diele nkpo bubakpi.”<verse eid="DEU 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 18:17" />Ni di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ mi alɛ: “Ɔlaa wɔ beebuɛ ni nlɛ. <verse eid="DEU 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 18:18" />Kamadiki Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ fɛle afɔ okle di babilɛma-suɔtɔbi kamɛ nta ma; kamayɔ sɛlaa nii nkpee nwɔ kaanya, nnwɔɔ kafɔɔ abatɔkɔ ma lɛsaa biala lɛtɔkɔ nwɔ nii. <verse eid="DEU 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 18:19" />Nse otii lele ninankyɔɔ atoko di sɛlaa nii se di Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ nwu kobuɛ ni di leyooto nii kamɛ yi, ni ami omu kamananfi nwɔ kootoko. <verse eid="DEU 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 18:20" />Kafɔɔ Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ wɔ niekũ ɛɛkakatɛ ni di leyooto nii kamɛ, eebuɛ ɔlaa lele ninantɔkɔ nwɔ nlɛ abuɛ nii, ee Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ wɔ niɛkakatɛ ni di bayaa bamba leyooto kamɛ yi, dikpeni beelo nwɔ.”<verse eid="DEU 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 18:21" />Biafuo obuɛ di situ lee kamɛ bilɛ, “Lɛ bubafuo otofo bulɛ diele SAATE nwu niɛbuɛ ɔlaa nwu?” <verse eid="DEU 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 18:22" />Nse ɔlaa wɔ di Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ kobuɛ ni di SAATE nwu leyooto kamɛ diɛwa kaanya ee diele nwaako yi, ni nnwu ninle ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu diebuɛ ni nɛ. Ni Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ nwu niakũ aabuɛ nwu nɛ. Nioso bitanyɛkɛ nwɔ.<verse eid="DEU 18:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="DEU 19" />
  <para style="s1">Katanikokɔ Sekpoo Kplɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 19:1" />Nse SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ ntɔɔwɔɔsa nnle be kasɔ ka ɔɔyɔ anta fɔ nii, nse fatootososa ma kafɔɔ feediki, nfɛ fasi di sekpoo ku ayo lɛma kamɛ yi, <verse eid="DEU 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 19:2" />faadiki eekpoo kplɛ etiɛ di kasɔ ka di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kɔyɔ anta fɔ alɛ yɔ ni. <verse eid="DEU 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 19:3" />Diki sisuku fata sĩ, faasɛ kasɔ nwu di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kɔyɔ anta fɔ ni fɛ atesaa, di akyuu atiɛ, alɛ nse otii owo lelo otii katoso ansifi ni nfa.<verse eid="DEU 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 19:4" />Nle mmle ninle kufiofa di otii wɔ nielo ni owo nɔɔ katoso ansifi anaafũ ni nkpa nɔɔ nɛ- otii wɔ nielo ni owo nɔɔ ninaanle ɔtɛ ɛɛtɛ nii, ninanle alɛ osi asi nwɔ ni oso. <verse eid="DEU 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 19:5" />Yɔ falɛ, otii lɛkyɛ lepoo ku owo nɔɔ alɛ ɔɔlaabudi kowoso, ni ɔɔnwanyi ni kafɛ nɔɔ alɛ oobudi ni kowoso nwu, kafɛ lɛbɔkɔtɛ kɛɛlaapɛ owo nɔɔ nwu eekpi. Ni otii lotɛ nwu kafuo otoso osifi sekpoo se mmle nkpo onwii kamɛ anaafũ nkpa nɔɔ. <verse eid="DEU 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 19:6" />Nse diele nkpo, di lɛkɔ lɛtɛ diekyo, di otii-saate leti nwɔ ɛɛlaawɛ nwɔ yi, abalo nwɔ, nu ninankaatɛ alɛ eelo nwɔ ni fiɛ, diekye diele osi di otii wɔ beelo ni nsi nwɔ ni oso diɛwa ninkpo. <verse eid="DEU 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 19:7" />Nle mmle oso lɛtɔkɔ fɔ nlɛ diki ekpoo etiɛ fatɛ fata suoto lɛfɔ nɛ.<verse eid="DEU 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 19:8" />Nse SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ lɛta kasɔ nwu lɛblɛfɛ kɛɛkyakaa, fɛ mmle aaka ntam aata ni bawa lɛfɔ, ɛɛta fɔ kasɔ nwu kamuu aabuɛ aatɛ aata ma nii, <verse eid="DEU 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 19:9" />ta feelolaa afiofa ya mmle amuu lɛtɔkɔ fɔ ni miɛ feetikanko ni- fɛɛbɔmbɔ ni SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ, fɛɛkyɛ ni di sisuku nɔɔ obe lele oso yi- ni dikpeni feediki ekpoo kplɛ etiɛ bamba fɛɛkyakaa di etiɛ kasale nwu suoto. <verse eid="DEU 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 19:10" />Bibla nkpo, di mmle manamawii ni ntɔ be ninambla ni okpile di kasɔ lɛfɔ ka di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kɔyɔ anta fɔ ni fɛ atesaa lɛfɔ suoto, di mmle fanamakpi ni lɛpɔɔ di ntɔ owii suoto.<verse eid="DEU 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 19:11" />Kafɔɔ nse otii lekyidi owo nɔɔ ɛɛtɛ nwɔ kala, ɛɛpɛ nwɔ eelo, eetoso eesifi sekpoo kplɛ se mmle onwii yi, <verse eid="DEU 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 19:12" />ni okpoo nɔɔ nwu banɔɔfo bakpee batii baalaakpaa otii lotɛ nwu nkpo di okpoo kplɛ nwu baakpleko bawako, baayɔ nwɔ bakpee di otii wɔ eelo ni otii-saate nnɛɛ, aalo nwɔ. <verse eid="DEU 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 19:13" />Bitan-nyɔɔ nyaami saa. Dikpeni biediki otii kpile wɔ niewii ni ntɔ be ninambla ni okpile di Israel batii kamɛ, di mmle dibalɛ ninta ye nii.<verse eid="DEU 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amɛ Kofole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 19:14" />Tankpa owo lɛfɔ lɛmɛke le di bawa lɛfɔ lase ni di atesaa ya feefũ ni di kasɔ nwu di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kɔyɔ anta fɔ alɛ siɛ nii.<verse eid="DEU 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kamaabayilatɛ Suoto Ɔlaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 19:15" />Kamaayilatɛ onwii diɛpɔ ata alɛ baalo ni otii lɛpɔɔ di nnwɔ boonyu alɛ ɛɛbla ni okpile ee ɛɛlalaasaa ni lɛsaa. Dikaatɛ alɛ beenu kamaabayilatɛ banyɔ ee batiɛ kanya ɔlaa fiɛ beefũ nwu beekpee.<verse eid="DEU 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 19:16" />Nse laatɛ ku funutɛ leyila alɛ ɔɔyɔ ɔlaa antika di otii suoto yi, <verse eid="DEU 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 19:17" />ni batii nwu banyɔ nikɔnaanfi ni ɔlaa bayila di SAATE nwu anu di olebatatɛ ku bakantɛ ba nin-yɛ ni kaanya di obe nwu nkpo kamɛ katũ. <verse eid="DEU 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 19:18" />Dikpeni bakantɛ nwu lewolaa ɔlaa nwu kamɛ nwaa, ni nse bɛɛnya alɛ kamaayilatɛ nwu laatɛ ale, ɛɛbalaa sɛlaa eetika di owo nɔɔ suoto yi, <verse eid="DEU 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 19:19" />ni biyɔ lɛsaa le ɛɛtɛ alɛ ababla ni owo nɔɔ nwu bibla nwɔ. Dikpeni biediki dikpile nwu kaamɛ lee. <verse eid="DEU 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 19:20" />Batii bule kamanu ɔlaa wɔ mmle manyɛkɛ, ni diidii blɔbasinkple babla lɛsaa kpile le mmle nwu okle di kamɛ lee. <verse eid="DEU 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 19:21" />Bitannya kuonwii nyaami: nkpa di nkpa disi, ninu di ninu disi, lɛnyɛɛ di lɛnyɛɛ disi, kɔnɛɛ di kɔnɛɛ disi, kɔkpaa di kɔkpaa disi.<verse eid="DEU 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="DEU 20" />
  <para style="s1">Kakpɛ Ɔkyɛ Sɛlaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 20:1" />Nse biɛtaka kakpɛ di balo lee suoto, biɛnya bapɔnkɔ ku bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni ku bakpɛtɛ ba nimpɔ balenke ni bale ye yi, bitanyɛkɛ ma, diekye SAATE Yaa lee wɔ niakpaa ye aadieko ni di Egipte kamasiɛko ye. <verse eid="DEU 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 20:2" />Nse nfɛ bibasifi kakpɛ yi, oletatɛ adie awa sitũ aabakakatɛ ata bakpɛtɛ nwu. <verse eid="DEU 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 20:3" />Aabuɛ alɛ, “Oo Israel, binu, miɛ nfɛ biofe kakpɛ di balo lee suoto. Bitanta difu lapɛ ye ee biayɛkɛ; bitanta ditũkũ lapɛ ye ee ɔfɔɔ lasifi ye di anu lɛma. <verse eid="DEU 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 20:4" />Diekye SAATE Yaa lee ninle nnwɔ nikɔkpaa ye anaakpɛko ni balo lee, anta ye ni lelenkee nɛ.”<verse eid="DEU 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 20:5" />Ni kakpɛ banɔɔfotii kamakaalɛ bakpɛtɛ nwu alɛ: “Otii owo nsi di kamɛ lee eetofo ni leyo fɔle anadidiki nini kayi? Bitɔɔ atɔɔkyɛ leyo, nse diele nkpo abafuo okpi di kakpɛ kamɛ, ni otii bamba nimadiki leyo nwu kayi. <verse eid="DEU 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 20:6" />Otii owo lɛkpɛ awosobi kofe fɔle anadikyako nya ni ole? Bitɔɔ atɔɔkyɛ leyo, nse diele nkpo abafuo okpi di kakpɛ kamɛ, ni otii bamba nimale nya. <verse eid="DEU 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 20:7" />Bɛɛkaalɛ ɔsanko bɛɛta otii owo, anadiyɔ nwɔ ni? Bitɔɔ atɔɔkyɛ leyo, nse diele nkpo abafuo okpi di kakpɛ kamɛ, ni otii bamba nimayɔ ɔsanko nwu.” <verse eid="DEU 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 20:8" />Ni kakpɛ banɔɔfotii nwu makple mankaalɛ alɛ, “Osuɔtɔ owo kɔyɛkɛ ee difu kɔpɛ nwɔ? Bitɔɔ atɔɔkyɛ leyo ta mmle di otu dilɔbakpa ni babilɛma kafɔɔ.” <verse eid="DEU 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 20:9" />Nse kakpɛ banɔɔfotii nwu ntooloo ɔkakatɛ ɔta bakpɛtɛ nwu yi, baadiki kanyabayilatɛ bata ma.<verse eid="DEU 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 20:10" />Nse biɛkata biɛkyɛ bilɛ biɔlaadieko okpoo kplɛ yi, biɛta batii nwu osuku baata disi. <verse eid="DEU 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 20:11" />Nse beenu kasɔ bɛɛsɛkɛtɛ n-yoko lɛma bɛɛta ye yi, ni binyinka batii nwu bamuu di okpoo nwu baatɔɔbla sɛkpɛ siene batɔɔta ye. <verse eid="DEU 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 20:12" />Nse beesĩ disi ɔta, beedieko ye kakpɛ yi, ni bimana okpoo kplɛ nwu bikyi. <verse eid="DEU 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 20:13" />Nse SAATE Yaa lee lɛyɔ nwu eekpee ye ninnɛɛ yi, bilo basuɔtɔ bamuu di okpoo nwu ku kapamii. <verse eid="DEU 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 20:14" />Kafɔɔ basanko, babisɔ, babɔkɛɛ sele ku lɛsaa biala di okpoo nwu kamɛ nnya yi, biyɔ nya fɛ kakpɛ kamɛ asaa bita suoto lee. Nioso bibafuo kakpɛ kamɛ asaa nwu di SAATE Yaa lee lɛta ye ni, eekye ni balo lee nfũ ɔkpɛ ɔblako. <verse eid="DEU 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 20:15" />Nle mmle biɛbla sekpoo kplɛ se simuu niekyo ye ni, sinanle ni nnle be ninkaakɔ ye ni sele nɛ.<verse eid="DEU 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 20:16" />Kafɔɔ, di sekpoo kplɛ se kamɛ di nnle be di SAATE Yaa lee kɔyɔ anta ye ni fɛ atesaa yi, bitandiɛ lɛsalɛsaa nikonwuna ni lasiɛ nkpa. <verse eid="DEU 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 20:17" />Biwɔɔsa bamuu klekle- Hiti batii, Amori batii, Kanaan batii, Perisi batii, Hiwi batii ku Yebusi batii- fɛ mmle di SAATE Yaa lee lɛtɔkɔ ye nii. <verse eid="DEU 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 20:18" />Nse diele nkpo, babatuo ye mmle biatikanko ni ayududusaa lɛma nwu amuu mambla ni di bayaa lɛma kasumu kamɛ, mimabla okpile di SAATE Yaa lee suoto.<verse eid="DEU 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 20:19" />Nse biedieko okpoo kplɛ owo, biɔkpɛko nwu bilɛ biofũ nwu ditɔɔklɛ yi, bitan-yɔ kafɛ biabudi alewoso biawɔɔsa nya, diekye biafuo awosobi nwu ɔtɛsɛ ole. Bitambudi nya biatɛ kaasɔ. Awoso nwu di afe, batii bale, fiɛ biodieko nya kakpɛ? <verse eid="DEU 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 20:20" />Kafɔɔ, biafuo awoso ya biye bilɛ aale ni alewoso obudi, min-yɔ nya mintofo oyoyiɛ minkyisa okpoo kplɛ nwu biɔkpɛko ni ninaase di obe wɔ biefũ nwu nii.<verse eid="DEU 20:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="DEU 21" />
  <para style="s1">Kpi Wɔ Manantofo Ni Lɛsaa Le Nielo Nwɔ Ni Ɔlaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 21:1" />Nse bɛɛnya otii lekpi ate di lepoo kamɛ di kasɔ ka di SAATE Yaa lee kɔyɔ anta ye ni alɛ biyɔ nii, manan-ye otii wɔ nielo nwɔ nii, <verse eid="DEU 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 21:2" />ni banɔɔfo ku bakantɛ lee bakyɛ baalaaklapoosa obo wɔ ninte ni di sekpoo se ninkaako ni ku kpi nwu ntɛɛ. <verse eid="DEU 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 21:3" />Ni okpoo wɔ niɛtɛɛtɛɛ ni kpi nwu nkpo kulenke ni banɔɔfo bayɔ nankyue-sanko dibi le manadiyɔ bablako ni ɔkpɛ ee bakpee ni simu owoso diidii <verse eid="DEU 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 21:4" />di banɔɔfo nwu basooko nankyue nwu basifiko ɔtaata wɔ manadikpɛ ni ee bakpee ni alesaa, di kaklenyii ka nikobiɛ kanfe ni. Baafee nankyue nwu simu di ɔtaata nwu ninfa. <verse eid="DEU 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 21:5" />Olebatatɛ, Lewi babisuɔtɔbi nwu bayilakaanya ninfa, diekye SAATE Yaa lee niediki ma alɛ basumu, baata lɛtɔtrɔ di SAATE nwu leyooto kamɛ, baabuɛ nlɔ ku nkpɛ sɛlaa simuu. <verse eid="DEU 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 21:6" />Di okpoo wɔ niɛtɛɛtɛɛ ni kpi nwu banɔɔfo bamuu bafoto nnɛɛ lɛma bakpete nankyue-sanko nwu beefee ni simu di ɔtaata nwu, <verse eid="DEU 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 21:7" />baabuɛ alɛ: “Diele awo niewii ntɔ be mmle, ee anu loo lɛnya mmle bɔɔbla nii. <verse eid="DEU 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 21:8" />Oo SAATE, fũ ɔyɔ ɔkyɛ asaa ya mmle fata batii lɛfɔ Israel ba feediki ni, tanlo batii lɛfɔ lɛpɔɔ di otii wɔ ninambla ni okpile ntɔ suoto.” Ni ɔyɔ ɔkyɛ mawɛ di ntɔ nwu owii suoto. <verse eid="DEU 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 21:9" />Nioso bibadiki ntɔ be ninambla ni okpile di suoto lee, diekye bitɔɔbla lɛsaa le niesiɛko ni di SAATE nwu anu.<verse eid="DEU 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔsanko Wɔ Beemufũ Ni Di Kakpɛ Kamɛ Ɔyɔ Ɔlaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 21:10" />Nse fɛɛtaka kakpɛ di balo lɛfɔ suoto di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ lɛyɔ ma eekpee fɔ ninnɛɛ, feemufũ ma yi, <verse eid="DEU 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 21:11" />fɛɛnya ɔsanko owo di mba feemufũ ni kamɛ, alɛ sekpeele ɔɔlɛ fɔ onyu yi, faafuo nwɔ ɔyɔ fɛ ɔsɔfɔ lɛfɔ. <verse eid="DEU 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 21:12" />Kpaa nwɔ fawako leyo lɛfɔ faata ɔsanko nwu aakpaasu disi nɔɔ, aatekete sɛnɛɛfɔɔ nɔɔ <verse eid="DEU 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 21:13" />aadiki akleesaa ya aaklee ni di obe wɔ baamufũ nwɔ ni atɛ. Nse atoosiɛ di leyo lɛfɔ, atoowi ote ku ɔya di kɔwɛntɛ kunwii kamɛ eeloo yi, nfɛ faafuo ɔkyɛ nɔɔ ɔkyɛ fanle nwɔ ɔsa nnwɔɔ kafɔɔ anle fɔ ɔsɔfɔ. <verse eid="DEU 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 21:14" />Nse aabuo fɔ anu, faatɔɔ asifi lɛba lele ninlɛ nwɔ ni. Diɛkaatɛ fansunsũ nwɔ ee fanklee nwɔ fɛ ɔlanle, ta fatootenko nwɔ ni oso.<verse eid="DEU 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Osuɔtɔbi Kasale Atesaa Kalekɔ Ɔlaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 21:15" />Nse osuɔtɔ owo nkpe basɔfɔ banyɔ, ambɔmbɔ onwii anlenkee, di banyɔ nwu lelofo basuɔtɔbi bɛɛtɔɔ, kafɔɔ ɔsɔfɔ nɔɔ wɔ anambɔmbɔ ni lelofo kasale nle osuɔtɔbi yi, <verse eid="DEU 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 21:16" />ni nse ɔɔsɛ asaa nɔɔ anta babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ yi, atan-yɔ dibite kalekɔ aata ɔsɔfɔ wɔ ambɔmbɔ ni obisuɔtɔbi, ayɔ ata dibite nɔɔ kasale nimu, ɔsɔfɔ wɔ anambɔmbɔ ni obisuɔtɔbi. <verse eid="DEU 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 21:17" />Dikpeni ɛɛyɔ dibu ɛɛta ɔsɔfɔ wɔ anambɔmbɔ ni obisuɔtɔbi fɛ dibite nɔɔ kasale, antɔɔ nlekɔ akyuu anyɔ di atesaa nɔɔ ya amuu ninkpe nwɔ ni kamɛ. Obisuɔtɔbi nwu nkpo ninle ote nwu sisuɔtɔ osie lɛblasaa kasale nɛ. Nioso dibite kalekɔ nle nwɔ kale.<verse eid="DEU 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obisuɔtɔbi Tokopĩtɛ Ɔlaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 21:18" />Nse otii owo nkpe obisuɔtɔbi tokopĩtɛ ku nunsientɛ wɔ ninoobu ni ote ku ɔya, nse bɛɛfaa nwɔ anaanu ma ni ɔlaa yi, <verse eid="DEU 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 21:19" />ni ote ku ɔya bakpaa nwɔ bakyɛnko banɔɔfo nfũ di okpoo nwu bawo kalɛɛkɔ. <verse eid="DEU 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 21:20" />Baatɔkɔ banɔɔfo nwu alɛ, “Obisuɔtɔbi loo wɔ mmle nkpe otokopĩ ku onunsie. Oloonu wo ɔlaa. Ditiipɛ ku tanyintɛ ale.” <verse eid="DEU 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 21:21" />Ni basuɔtɔ bamuu di okpoo nɔɔ nwu basafɔ nwɔ afuɔ balo. Dikpeni biediki dikpile nwu kamɛ lee. Ni Israel omuu kamanu ɔlaa nwu man-yɛkɛ.<verse eid="DEU 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Afiofa Ateate Ɔlaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 21:22" />Nse otii owo lekpi kukpi lɛpɔɔ beelo nwɔ, di kpi nɔɔ nwu nsaka di kowoso suoto yi, <verse eid="DEU 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 21:23" />tandiɛ kpi nɔɔ nwu lasaka di kowoso suoto kale kasɛ. Nyu falɛ feekookaa nwɔ di dii nkpo kale, diekye Yaa lɛkpaani ntika di otii lele bɛɛsaka di kowoso suoto. Tanlalaasa kasɔ ka di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kɔyɔ anta fɔ ni fɛ atesaa.<verse eid="DEU 21:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="DEU 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 22:1" />Nse obilee nankyue-suɔtɔ ee foso leyu osuku fɛɛnyɔɔ yi, tan-waalɛ nwɔ faafɛ, kafɔɔ nyu falɛ fɛɛkplesa nwɔ fɛɛkyɛnko nwɔ. <verse eid="DEU 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 22:2" />Nse obilee nwu diesi akaako fɔ ee faaye owe ole ale yi, ni kpaa nwɔ fasifiko leyo lɛfɔ falaase dilaase di obe wɔ abawa amawolaa nwɔ ni. Ni faakplesa nwɔ fatɔɔ. <verse eid="DEU 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 22:3" />Bla di akpanwu, nse fɛɛwɛ obilee bɔkɛɛ wɔ nintuka ni atoo ee dibula nɔɔ ee lɛsaa lele nieyu nwɔ. Tan-waalɛ ni faafe.<verse eid="DEU 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 22:4" />Nse fɛɛnya obilee bɔkɛɛ wɔ nintuka ni atoo ee nankyue-suɔtɔ nɔɔ lɛnɔɔ di osuku yi, tan-waalɛ nwɔ faafe. Kyakaako obilee nwu aatakatɛsa nwɔ ase.<verse eid="DEU 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 22:5" />Ɔsanko antankpee basuɔtɔ akpeele ee osuɔtɔ atankpee basanko akpeele, diekye SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ lekyidi otii lele niɛbla lɛsaa le mmle okle.<verse eid="DEU 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 22:6" />Nse fɛɛnya kansiɛ leyo di osuku kotoko, kuntɛ kowoso suoto ee kasɔ, di ɔya nfuu di abi suoto ee afuɔ suoto yi, tan-yɔ ɔya ku abi nwu. <verse eid="DEU 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 22:7" />Afɔ faafuo abi nwu ɔyɔ, kafɔɔ nyu falɛ fɛɛta ɔya lɛma lesifi, ta mmle dibalɛ ninta fɔ, fansiɛ ni nkpa kaanale.<verse eid="DEU 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 22:8" />Nse feetofo leyo fɔle, kpee kɔba fakyisa lɛkya lɛfɔ, ta mmle di otii kuonwii dilɔbakpa ni ninfa, di mmle ninaawako ni ntɔ owii letokonanfi.<verse eid="DEU 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 22:9" />Tampɛ asaa ateate akyuu anyɔ faakpɔtɔɔsa di awosobi lɛfɔ kofe kamɛ. Nse fɛɛbla nkpo ni asaa nwu fɛɛpɛ ni ku awosobi kofe nwu awosobi amuu kamakpɔnɔfɔ.<verse eid="DEU 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 22:10" />Tan-nii nankyue-suɔtɔ ku bɔkɛɛ wɔ nintuka ni atoo di owoso onwii suoto baafuu kasɔ baata fɔ.<verse eid="DEU 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 22:11" />Tankpee akpeele ya bɛɛyɔ foso sinwini ku oleteku beeloso bɛɛkpɔtɔɔsa nii.<verse eid="DEU 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 22:12" />Bla sɛkpaalɛ fasakasa di akpeele ya feekpee ni atokosi nwu ana suoto.<verse eid="DEU 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Osuɔtɔ Ku Ɔsanko Kasiɛ Kufiofa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 22:13" />Nse osuɔtɔ lɛyɔ ɔsɔfɔ, eetenko nwɔ eeloo, eekyidi nwɔ, <verse eid="DEU 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 22:14" />ɛɛkpɔnɔfɔsɔɔ, ɛɛtɔɔ leyooto kpile eebuɛ alɛ, “Layɔ ɔsanko wɔ mmle, kafɔɔ lakyɛ ni ɔkyɛ nɔɔ lanya nlɛ nfɛ aye osuɔtɔ,” <verse eid="DEU 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 22:15" />ni ɔsankobi nwu ote ku ɔya kamakpasa kamɛ di okpoo banɔɔfo anu di lɛkpaka alɛ kabitɛ aale. <verse eid="DEU 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 22:16" />Ɔsankobi nwu ote kamatɔkɔ banɔɔfo nwu alɛ, “Layɔ obisankobi nii lata osuɔtɔ wɔ mmle nlɛ ayɔ, kafɔɔ alɛ aasinlɛ nwɔ. <verse eid="DEU 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 22:17" />Nunua atɔɔkpɔnɔfɔsɔɔ eebuɛ alɛ, ‘Lɛnya nlɛ obisankobi lɛfɔ nwu diele kabitɛ.’ Kafɔɔ nnya nle nikotuo alɛ obisankobi nii nwu kabitɛ ale ni.” N-se ɔsankobi nwu balofotɛ ntoofukuti dibula nwu bɛɛtɛ di okpoo banɔɔfo nwu anu, <verse eid="DEU 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 22:18" />ni banɔɔfo nwu kamakpaa osuɔtɔ nwu mannaanfi nwɔ kootoko. <verse eid="DEU 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 22:19" />Babafũ koto fututu aboo kɔlafa di osuɔtɔ nwu ɔkyɛ manta ɔsankobi ote, diekye osuɔtɔ nwu lɛta Israel batii kabitɛ leyooto kpile. Dikpeni, ankple anle osuɔtɔ nwu ɔsɔfɔ; dinaa alɛ ansĩ nwɔ, di obe wɔ di osuɔtɔ nwu lɛnya akpe ni nkpa.<verse eid="DEU 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 22:20" />Kafɔɔ, nse nwaako di ɔlaa nwu nle, di kamɛ lɛkpa alɛ ɔsankobi nwu diele kabitɛ yi, <verse eid="DEU 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 22:21" />ni bakpaa ɔsankobi nwu basifiko ote kayokontũ, di okpoo nwu basuɔtɔ basafɔ nwɔ afuɔ balo. Diekye ɛɛbla anunsɔsaa di Israel kasɔ suoto, aate di basuɔtɔ sɛkyɛ di obe wɔ aakple aawɛ ni di ote leyo. Dikpeni biediki dikpile nwu di kamɛ lee.<verse eid="DEU 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 22:22" />Nse bɛɛnya osuɔtɔ owo kotenko osuɔtɔ bamba ɔsɔfɔ yi, dikpeni beelo banyɔ lɛma nwu, osuɔtɔ wɔ niatenko nwɔ ni ku ɔsanko nwu. Dikpeni biediki lɛsaa kpile nwu di Israel kasɔ suoto.<verse eid="DEU 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 22:23" />Nse osuɔtɔ owo lɛkyakako kabitɛ ka disi batɔɔkaalɛ bɛɛtɛ ni di okpoo kamɛ, eetenko ɔsanko nwu yi, <verse eid="DEU 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 22:24" />bikpaa banyɔ lɛma nwu bisifiko okpoo nwu kasukunya biɛlaasafɔ ma afuɔ bilo. Ta okpoo kamɛ diale ni oso yi, ɔsankobi nwu ditayiisa kudu baafũ nwɔ nii, osuɔtɔ nwu kafɔɔ, ta ɛɛlalaasa ni osuɔtɔ bamba ɔsɔfɔ oso. Dikpeni biediki dikpile nwu di kamɛ lee.<verse eid="DEU 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 22:25" />Kafɔɔ nse diɛwa alɛ osuɔtɔ owo lakyakako ɔsankobi wɔ disi batɔɔkaalɛ bɛɛtɛ ni di lepoo kamɛ, ɛɛyɔ suoto osie eetenko ɔsanko nwu yi, ni osuɔtɔ wɔ niɛbla ni lɛsaa le mmle lete bielo. <verse eid="DEU 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 22:26" />Bitambla ɔsankobi nwu lɛsaalɛsaa; nnwɔɔ aabla okpile kuonwii dikaatɛ aakpi nii. Ɔlaa nɔɔ nwu nte fɛle mmle di otii owo ndieko ni owo nɔɔ anlo nwɔ nii. <verse eid="DEU 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 22:27" />Diekye lepoo kamɛ di osuɔtɔ nwu lanya ɔsankobi nwu, ni kuntɛ ɔsankobi wɔ disi baakaalɛ ni layiisa kudu yi, otii kuonwii ditawɛ ninfa aafũ nwɔ nii.<verse eid="DEU 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 22:28" />Nse osuɔtɔ owo lɛkyakako kabitɛ ka disi manadikaalɛ alɛ babayɔ ni, ɛɛyɔ suoto osie eetenko ɔsanko nwu, diedie ma kayi, <verse eid="DEU 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 22:29" />ni osuɔtɔ nwu kamata koto fututu aboo afosi anɔɔ anta ɔsankobi nwu ote. Dikpeni osuɔtɔ nwu kafɔɔ lɛyɔ ɔsankobi nwu, diekye atɔɔlalaasɔɔ. Ɔlɔbafuo ɔsanko nwu osĩ diidii, di obe wɔ di osuɔtɔ nwu lɛnya akpe ni nkpa.<verse eid="DEU 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 22:30" />Osuɔtɔ kuonwii antan-yɔ ote ɔsɔfɔ; diɛkaatɛ andiki anu an-nya ote ɔsɔfɔ lɛkyɔtɔ.<verse eid="DEU 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="DEU 23" />
  <para style="s1">Batii Ba Beesĩ Ni Di SAATE Nwu Batii Kamɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 23:1" />Otii lele ataabi beebiɛ ee sisiɔtɔ beebudi ni kakuu nnaa osuku ambuo SAATE nwu kasiisakɔ.<verse eid="DEU 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 23:2" />Otii lele beelofo ale ɔsɔnɔbi ee banantii nɔɔ kuonwii atambuo SAATE nwu kasiisakɔ, bia diɛlaase ni di kɔna fosile.<verse eid="DEU 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 23:3" />Amon otii ee Moab otii kuonwii ee banantii lɛma kuonwii atambuo SAATE nwu kasiisakɔ, bia diɛlaase ni di kɔna fosile. <verse eid="DEU 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 23:4" />Diekye batawa baabata ye alesaa ku ntu di osuku lee ɔkyɛ kamɛ di obe wɔ biadie ni di Egipte. Ni baayɔ Beor obisuɔtɔbi Bileam wɔ niakye ni Petor di Mesopotamia alɛ abakpaani ye nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 23:5" />Kafɔɔ SAATE Yaa lee ditanu Bileam ɔlaa, kafɔɔ aamunikĩisa lɛkpaani nwu aabla lɛtɔtrɔ aata ye. Diekye SAATE Yaa lee mbɔmbɔ ye. <verse eid="DEU 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 23:6" />Bitambla basiɛwo kanya ninii ku mma, di obe wɔ bisi ni nkpa.<verse eid="DEU 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 23:7" />Bitankyidi Edom otii kuonwii, diekye babilee bale. Bitankyidi Egipte otii kuonwii, diekye biasiɛ di kale nɔɔ fɛ ɔfɔɔ. <verse eid="DEU 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 23:8" />Edom batii ku Egipte batii kɔna tiɛfa lelofo babi ba beelofo bɛɛta ma ni kafuo SAATE nwu kasiisakɔ kamɛ obuo.<verse eid="DEU 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakpɛtɛ Kasiɛkɔ Nwu Kamɛ Lekleklesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 23:9" />Nse biesi di kasiɛkɔ lee, biɛtaka kakpɛ di balo lee suoto yi, biblasa suoto di lɛsaa biala ninambla ni klekle suoto. <verse eid="DEU 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 23:10" />Nse osuɔtɔ lee owo lɛsɛ kɔlaafɔ eesoosa alombi ku kakyɛ yi, ni suoto nɔɔ diɛbla klekle, nioso adie asifi kasiɛkɔ nwu sɛmaa aalaasiɛ ninfa. <verse eid="DEU 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 23:11" />Kafɔɔ nse kɔtɔɔfɔ nfɛ kowo aakpe ntu, aakple awa kasiɛkɔ nwu kamɛ nse kufĩ ntɔɔmɛɛ.<verse eid="DEU 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 23:12" />Bidiki lɛba di kasiɛkɔ nwu sɛmaa, di nfũ di otii kakyɛ ni okpo. <verse eid="DEU 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 23:13" />Biklee lɛsaa le biakutu ni kasɔ bikyakaa di akpɛsaa lee suoto, alɛ nse biɛkyɛ okpo bieloo, biayɔ minkutu kɔtɛ mintĩi mmbi lee nwu. <verse eid="DEU 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 23:14" />Diekye SAATE Yaa lee nkyɛ antookyi kasiɛkɔ lee nwu antoonyu ye, anta ye minlenkee balo lee. Nioso dikpeni kasiɛkɔ lee nwu mbla klekle, ta mmle anamanya ni diyududusaa kuninwii di kamɛ lee ditɔɔ akple asifi adiɛ ye nii.<verse eid="DEU 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Afiofa Ateate Bamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 23:15" />Nse ɔlanle letoso ɛɛbataniko ye yi, bitankplesa nwɔ biata saate nɔɔ. <verse eid="DEU 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 23:16" />Bitɔɔ asiɛ di kamɛ lee di kakɔ lele ninlɛ nwɔ di okpoo lele ninkaatɛko nwɔ ni. Bitambla nwɔ amumu.<verse eid="DEU 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 23:17" />Israel osuɔtɔ ee ɔsanko kuonwii antanle kafiofa sɔnɔkpeetɛ. <verse eid="DEU 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 23:18" />Bitan-yɔ ɔsanko sɔnɔkpeetɛ ee osuɔtɔ sɔnɔkpeetɛ koto ko ɛɛwɛ ni di lɛsɔnɔkpee kamɛ aawako SAATE Yaa lee leyo aabata koto lele eebuɛ ɛɛtɛ alɛ abata nii, diekye SAATE Yaa lee lekyidi akyuu nwu anyɔ.<verse eid="DEU 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 23:19" />Tantikasa lɛsaa faata obilee, kuntɛ koto ee alesaa ee lɛsaa lele fɛɛfɛnsa nwɔ dikaatɛ feetiksa lɛsaa fɛɛtɔɔ nii. <verse eid="DEU 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 23:20" />Faafuo lɛsaa otikasa ɔta ɔfɔɔ, kafɔɔ diele obilee Israel otii, di mmle di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kata fɔ ni lɛtɔtrɔ di lɛsaa biala di kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ lɛkpanko ni di kasɔ ka foobuo fanaayɔ ni suoto.<verse eid="DEU 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 23:21" />Nse feebuɛ fɛɛtɛ falɛ fabata SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ lɛsaa yi, tanku-nkpaa ku lɛsaa nwu ɔta, diekye nwaako SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kamatufu lɛsaa nwu aankyeko ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ, ni fabakpi lɛpɔɔ di okpile suoto. <verse eid="DEU 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 23:22" />Kafɔɔ nse fatabuɛ fatɛ falɛ fabata lɛsaa yi, ni flɔbakpi lɛpɔɔ di okpile suoto. <verse eid="DEU 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 23:23" />Lɛsaa lele di anyasibi lɛfɔ lɛbɛ eebuɛ yi, nyu falɛ dikpeni fɛɛbla, diekye kanya lɛfɔ fukuti feebuɛ fɛɛtɛ SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ.<verse eid="DEU 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 23:24" />Nse feebuo owo lɛfɔ awosobi kofe kamɛ, faafuo awosobi ya amuu foomiɛ ni ole, kafɔɔ tan-yɔ kuninwii faakpee di letoo lɛfɔ faasifiko. <verse eid="DEU 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 23:25" />Nse feebuo owo lɛfɔ atita kofe kamɛ yi, faafuo atita ofee ku nnɛɛ lɛfɔ owee, kafɔɔ tan-yɔ kɔpa faablɛ atitita nwu nin-yɛ nii.<verse eid="DEU 23:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="DEU 24" />
  <para style="s1">Kusĩ Ku Okple Ose Ɔyɔ Kufiofa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 24:1" />Nse osuɔtɔ owo n-yɔ ɔsanko ɛɛnya alɛ ɔsaabla nɔɔ dilosinkyɛkyɛ nwɔ diekye atɔɔnya kakyi kawo di suoto nɔɔ yi, ɛɛkpana kusinkũ ɛɛta ɔsanko nwu, ɛɛdiki nwɔ di leyo nɔɔ, <verse eid="DEU 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 24:2" />ni nse atoodie di osuɔtɔ nwu leyo eesifi, atɔɔlaabla osuɔtɔ bamba ɔsɔfɔ, <verse eid="DEU 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 24:3" />ni nse osuɔtɔ nyɔɔfa nwu ninsimbɔ nwɔ, ɛɛkpana kusinkũ ɛɛta ɔsanko nwu, eedie di leyo nɔɔ eesifi ee osuɔtɔ nwu lekpi yi, <verse eid="DEU 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 24:4" />ni ɔsa nɔɔ kasale wɔ niasĩ nwɔ ni nnaa osuku ankple an-yɔ ɔsanko nwu di obe wɔ di osuɔtɔ bamba ntootenko nwɔ nii. Lɛsaa nwu mabla diyududusaa di SAATE nwu anu. Tan-yɔ okpile faawako kasɔ ka di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kɔyɔ anta fɔ ni fɛ atesaa.<verse eid="DEU 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 24:5" />Nse osuɔtɔ owo lɛyɔ ɔsanko sɛfɔlefɔle yi, ni diɛkaatɛ mantɔɔ ankyɛ kakpɛ ee mankpee nwɔ ɔkpɛ bamba owo ninnɛɛ. Dikpeni eesiɛko suoto di leyo lɛlɛɛ ninwii anta suoto n-yɔɔ ɔsɔfɔ fɔle wɔ ɛɛyɔɔ nii.<verse eid="DEU 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 24:6" />Tanfũ kukuɔ- bia okuɔlɛ- fɛ kamaa-lesesaa dita koto ko basiko fɔ nii, diekye otii nkpa nfɛ diofũ fɛ kamaa-lesesaa nɛ.<verse eid="DEU 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 24:7" />Nse beemufũ otii owo komufũ owo nɔɔ Israel otii anwofasa anta koto ofũ, ɛɛblɔɔ fɛ ɔlanle ee eesunsũ nwɔ yi, dikpeni beelo otii mufũtɛ nwu nkpo. Dikpeni biediki kpiletɛ nwu di kamɛ lee.<verse eid="DEU 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 24:8" />Lolaa fanyu nwaa di ofiɛ sɛɛle suoto, faabla fɛ mmle kanya di olebatatɛ ba ninle ni Lewi batii kamatuo fɔ ni. Dikpeni feelolaa fanyu falɛ fɛɛbla di nle latɔkɔ ma ni kanya. <verse eid="DEU 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 24:9" />Nyuma lɛsaa le di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ labla ni Miriam di osuku, di obe wɔ biadie ni di Egipte.<verse eid="DEU 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 24:10" />Nse fɛɛfɛnsa lɛsaa lele fɛɛta owo lɛfɔ, tambuo leyo nɔɔ falaafũ lɛsaa le alɛ ɔɔyɔ anta anse ni kamaa. <verse eid="DEU 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 24:11" />Yila kaayi faata otii wɔ fɔɔfɛnsa ni lɛsaa nwu adieko kamaa-lesesaa nwu awako fɔ. <verse eid="DEU 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 24:12" />Nse dipii nkle otii nwu nkpo, ni tanta kamaa-lesesaa nwu late di ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ kale lasɛ ku nni. <verse eid="DEU 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 24:13" />Kplesa dibula nɔɔ faatɔɔ nse kufĩ ntɔɔmɛɛ di mmle abayɔ ni antĩi ni suoto ante ni. Ni abapɛ fɔ sɛfa, mambu ni fɛ ɔsaabla tinini di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ anu.<verse eid="DEU 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 24:14" />Tantafaa kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ wɔ ninle ni piitɛ ku otii wɔ diefĩ nii, kuntɛ obilee Israel otii ee ɔfɔɔ wɔ ninsi ni di sekpoo lee nwu onwii kamɛ. <verse eid="DEU 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 24:15" />Tɔɔ kɔkpɛnto nɔɔ dii biala fiɛ di kufĩ kumɛɛ, diekye dipii nkle nwɔ, koto nwu eetika disi kafɔɔ nɛ. Nse diele nkpo, abawi anlɛɛ SAATE nwu ankpee fɔ, nimabla lɛpɔɔ okpi di okpile suoto ninta fɔ.<verse eid="DEU 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 24:16" />Blɔbalo bate di babi lɛma disi, ee balo babi di bate lɛma disi; obiala makpi di okpile nɔɔ omu suoto.<verse eid="DEU 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 24:17" />Bitantafaa ɔfɔɔ ee kuɛbi di kakankɔ, ee biafũ kpisɔfɔ dibula fɛ kamaa-lesesaa. <verse eid="DEU 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 24:18" />Binyuma bilɛ balanle biale di Egipte kasɔ, ni di SAATE Yaa lee ladiki ye ninfa nɛ. Nkpo oso kokpee ye kufiofa ko mmle nɛ.<verse eid="DEU 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 24:19" />Nse biofiɛlɛ kamɔɔ di kofe lee bieyee ɔmɔɔbu owo ɔyɔ yi, bitankple bialaayɔ nwu. Bidiɛ nwu kute kuta bafɔɔ ku bakuɛbi ku bakpisɔfɔ, di SAATE Yaa lee ata ye lɛtɔtrɔ di nnɛɛ lee sɛkpɛ simuu kamɛ. <verse eid="DEU 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 24:20" />Nse fɛɛtɛsɛ kookoo di awoso lɛfɔ suoto di dibi lewo lebu yi, tansinkple faalaakyi sɛla nwu lɛnyɔɔfa faatɛsɛ ni. Diɛ n-ya niebu ni atika ata bafɔɔ, bakuɛbi ku bakpisɔfɔ, di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ aata fɔ lɛtɔtrɔ di nnɛɛ lɛfɔ ɔkpɛ omuu kamɛ. <verse eid="DEU 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 24:21" />Nse fɛɛtɛsɛ alewosobi di kofe lɛfɔ kamɛ yi, tansinkple faalaakyi kofe nwu kamɛ. Diɛ n-ya niebu ni atika ata bafɔɔ, bakuɛbi ku bakpisɔfɔ. <verse eid="DEU 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 24:22" />Nyuma falɛ ɔlanle faale di Egipte kasɔ. Nioso kokpee fɔ kufiofa ko mmle nlɛ le kũ nɛ.<verse eid="DEU 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="DEU 25" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 25:1" />Nse basuɔtɔ banyɔ kɔnanfi ɔlaa yi, bayɔ nwu bakyɛnko kakankɔ, di bakantɛ babuo di ɔlaa nwu kamɛ, baadiki lɛbɛ ku lɛpɔɔ. <verse eid="DEU 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 25:2" />Nse osuɔtɔ wɔ niɛkpi ni lɛpɔɔ lesiɛko lɛpɛ yi, ni kantɛ nwu atɔɔ ate kaasɔ di anu nɔɔ aata bapɛ nwɔ kowesee ko niesiɛko kuɔta ni okpile wɔ ɛɛbla ni kanya, <verse eid="DEU 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 25:3" />kafɔɔ diɛkaatɛ bɛɛpɛ nwɔ dielenkee kowesee afosi-ana. Nse bɛɛpɛ nwɔ kuolenkee nkpo, ni babawakosa obilee nwu kasɔ di anu lɛfɔ.<verse eid="DEU 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 25:4" />Tannii nankyue-suɔtɔ kanya di obe wɔ ayɛ oofiɛlɛ ni kamɔɔ.<verse eid="DEU 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obilɛma-suɔtɔbi Kablakɔ Ɔta Osuɔtɔ-bilɛma Wɔ Niekpi Ni Ɔsɔfɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 25:5" />Nse babilɛma-suɔtɔbi nsi di lɛba ninwii di onwii lɛma lekpi anaa osuɔtɔbi yi, ni kpisɔfɔ nɔɔ nwu atanaayɔ kɔsa di leyo bamba kamɛ. Ɔsa nɔɔ nwu osuɔtɔ-bilɛma ayɔ nwɔ ayɔ, aabla ɔsa obilɛma nwu nkpo lɛblasaa ata ɔsanko nwu. <verse eid="DEU 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 25:6" />Obisuɔtɔbi kasale wɔ abalofo ni ale obilɛma-suɔtɔbi nwu niakpi ni leyooto ta mmle di leyooto nɔɔ dilɔbayu ni di Israel kasɔ.<verse eid="DEU 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 25:7" />Kafɔɔ, nse osuɔtɔ owo diloomiɛ alɛ ayɔ obilɛma-suɔtɔbi nwu ɔsɔfɔ yi, ni ɔsanko nwu akyɛ banɔɔfo nfũ di okpoo nwu bawo kalɛɛkɔ alaatɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Ɔsa nii obilɛma-suɔtɔbi lesĩ alɛ ɔɔbabla obilɛma-suɔtɔbi lɛblasaa atɛɛ. Alɛ obilɛma-suɔtɔbi leyooto ditante di Israel kasɔ.” <verse eid="DEU 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 25:8" />Ni okpoo nɔɔ nwu banɔɔfo kamalɛɛ osuɔtɔ nwu mankakatɛ mantɔɔ. Nse eetika nwu difuɔ eebuɛ alɛ, “Noomiɛ nlɛ n-yɔ nwɔ,” <verse eid="DEU 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 25:9" />ni obilɛma-suɔtɔbi kpisɔfɔ nwu nkpo akyɛ osuɔtɔ nwu katũ di banɔɔfo nwu anu, aalaadiki osuɔtɔ nwu katokota kanwii di kɔkpaa nɔɔ, aatufa sita akpete nwɔ di anu aabuɛ alɛ, “Nnya lɛsaa le mambla ni osuɔtɔ wɔ ninoomiɛ alɛ obilɛma-suɔtɔbi awɛ ni banantii.” <verse eid="DEU 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 25:10" />Ni baalɛɛ osuɔtɔ nwu kɔna di Israel alɛ Osuɔtɔ wɔ katokota Beediki ni Kɔɔkpaa Leyo.<verse eid="DEU 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Afiofa Bamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 25:11" />Nse basuɔtɔ banyɔ kɔkpɛ, di onwii lɛma ɔsɔfɔ lɛwa alɛ oofũ ɔsa di owo nɔɔ nwu nnɛɛ, di ɔsanko nwu lemufũ osuɔtɔ nwu nyɔɔfa sisuɔtɔ yi, <verse eid="DEU 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 25:12" />bibudi ɔsanko nwu kɔnɛɛ biyu. Bitannyɔɔ nyaami.<verse eid="DEU 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 25:13" />Tankpee akadisaa anyɔ di kotofo lɛfɔ, ninutũle ku lɛfɛnflɛle. <verse eid="DEU 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 25:14" />Tanse aklapoosaa anyɔ di leyo lɛfɔ, lɛkplɛ ku dibiibii. <verse eid="DEU 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 25:15" />Dikpeni fɛɛwɛ akadisaa ku aklapoosaa ya niewo ni ɛɛkyɛkyɛ nii, di mmle faasiɛ nkpa fanklɛ ni di kasɔ ka di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kɔyɔ anta fɔ ni suoto. <verse eid="DEU 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 25:16" />Diekye SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ lekyidi otii lele nimbla ni asaa ya mmle, olele ninambla asaa di osuku kanya.<verse eid="DEU 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 25:17" />Nyuma lɛsaa le di Amalek batii labla fɔ ni di osuku, di obe wɔ biadie ni di Egipte biɔwa ni. <verse eid="DEU 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 25:18" />Di obe wɔ ditoobuo fɔ ni fatasinwɛ ni ɔnyɛɛ, baakyakako fɔ ni di osuku baalo ni batii ba niakpi ni sɛmaa bamuu; batayɛkɛ ni Yaa. <verse eid="DEU 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 25:19" />Nioso nse feebuo kasɔ ka di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kɔyɔ anta fɔ alɛ yɔ ni fɛ atesaa, ɛɛta fɔ ɔnyɛɛ ɔtɛ di balo ba bamuu niɛmana fɔ beekyi ni nnɛɛ yi, faawɔɔsa Amalek batii bamuu alɛ kuonwii dilaasinnyuma ma di kasɔ ka mmle suoto. Tan-yee!<verse eid="DEU 25:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="DEU 26" />
  <para style="s1">Alesaa Kasale Ku Akyuu Fosile Ɔta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 26:1" />Nse fatoobuo kasɔ ka di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kɔyɔ anta fɔ ni fɛle atesaa, fatɔɔyɔ ka nfɛ fasi yi, <verse eid="DEU 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 26:2" />yɔ kasɔ nwu di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kɔyɔ anta fɔ ni alesaa amuu kasale ya fɛɛyɔ ni di kofe lɛfɔ nwu fakpee di kakyikyɛ kamɛ. Faayɔ nya fasifiko lɛba le di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kamadiki anta alɛ Leyooto nɔɔ dite ni, <verse eid="DEU 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 26:3" />faatɔkɔ oletatɛ wɔ nfɛ ninsi ni di obe nwu kamɛ falɛ, “Kodiki ntuo SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ miɛ dii le mmle nlɛ ntɔɔwa kasɔ ka di SAATE Yaa loo laka ntam aata ni bawa loo alɛ abata wo nii.” <verse eid="DEU 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 26:4" />Oletatɛ nwu kamafũ kakyikyɛ nwu di nnɛɛ lɛfɔ an-yɔ anse di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ oleɔta akyikye anu. <verse eid="DEU 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 26:5" />Ni fababuɛ di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ anu falɛ: “Teemi lale Aram otii wɔ niatookyikyii nii, ni aadie aasifi Egipte kasɔ manko batii kafii baalaasiɛ ninfa, ni baabakple kale kplɛ, baawɛ osie, ni baapɔ̀ kafɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 26:6" />Kafɔɔ Egipte batii labla wo amumu, baata wo buabla sɛkpɛ ku osie, diabuo wo. <verse eid="DEU 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 26:7" />Ni buawi bualɛɛ SAATE nwu, bawa loo Yaa, ni di SAATE nwu lanu wo sɛlɔ aanya ninyinyi, dibuo ku nimiina loo nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 26:8" />Nioso SAATE nwu ladiki wo aakyeko Egipte ku kɔnɛɛ osie, kɔnɛɛ lɛnaanfi ku ayɛkɛsaa kplɛ ku atuosaa ku asaa ya niabla ni ɔkpɛ. <verse eid="DEU 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 26:9" />Ni aakpaa wo aawako lɛba le mmle, aabayɔ kasɔ ka mmle aata wo nɛ. Kasɔ ka di nnyɛɛtu ku bablɔ kobiɛ ninfe ni nɛ; <verse eid="DEU 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 26:10" />Oo SAATE, nioso nunua ntɔɔwako kasɔ nwu alesaa kasale ya fatɔɔtɛɛ nii.” Yɔ kakyikyɛ nwu fase di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ anu, faawakasɔ di anu nɔɔ. <verse eid="DEU 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 26:11" />Ni afɔ ku Lewi batii nwu ku bafɔɔ ba ninsi ni di kamɛ lee binya suoto lɛyɔɔ di asaa biene ya amuu di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ lɛta fɔ ni minko leyo lɛfɔ batii.<verse eid="DEU 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 26:12" />Nse fatoodiki dikyuu fosile di kofe lɛfɔ asaa ya amuu fɛɛwɛ ni di lɛlɛɛ tiɛfa kamɛ fɛɛtɛ lete feeloo, dikyuu fosile lɛlɛɛ nwu, faayɔ ni fata Lewi batii, bafɔɔ ku bakuɛbi ku bakpisɔfɔ, di mmle babale nya ni di sekpoo lee kamɛ mammiɛ ni. <verse eid="DEU 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 26:13" />Ni faatɔkɔ SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ falɛ: “Ntoodiki kakleklekɔ lɛba nwu di leyo nii, ni lɛyɔ ni lɛta Lewi batii ku bafɔɔ ku bakuɛbi ku bakpisɔfɔ, di asaa ya feebuɛ ni amuu kanya nɛ. Ninkyi di afiofa lɛfɔ suoto ee n-yee kukunwii nikũ. <verse eid="DEU 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 26:14" />Nin-le kakleklekɔ lɛba nwu alesaa kuanwii di obe wɔ lasiɛ ni kaku, ee ndiki kuanwii di obe wɔ ntabla ni klekle, ee n-yɔ kuanwii nta bakpi. Lɛkyɔɔ kotoko lenu SAATE Yaa nii ɔlaa; lɛbla lɛsaa biala faatɔkɔ mi nii. <verse eid="DEU 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 26:15" />Nyu fakyeko osi, kasiɛkɔ lɛfɔ Klekle nwu, faata Israel batii lɛfɔ lɛtɔtrɔ ku kasɔ ka faaka ntam faata ni bawa loo, kasɔ ka di nnyɛɛntu ku bablɔ kubiɛ ninfe ni.”<verse eid="DEU 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Omu Batii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 26:16" />SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kɔtɔkɔ fɔ miɛ dii le mmle alɛ tikanko afiofa ya mmle faakyɛ di sisuku nɔɔ; lolaa fanyu faale nya ku otu lɛfɔ omuu ku ɔkla lɛfɔ omuu. <verse eid="DEU 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 26:17" />Fatoodiki feebuɛ miɛ dii le mmle falɛ SAATE nwu ninle fɔ Yaa, ni fabakyɛ di sisuku nɔɔ, alɛ fabaklee sɛsaabla nɔɔ, ablasaa nɔɔ ku afiofa nɔɔ, ni fabanu nwɔ ɔlaa. <verse eid="DEU 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 26:18" />Ni di SAATE nwu ntoodiki eebuɛ miɛ dii le mmle alɛ batii nɔɔ bile, lɛsaawɛ nɔɔ asaa, fɛ mmle aabuɛ aatɛ nii, nioso dikpeni biele afiofa nɔɔ amuu. <verse eid="DEU 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 26:19" />Ni eebuɛ alɛ abata fansiɛ di katansa kamɛ, mannu fɔ leyooto ku dibu le niɛtaka katoo dilenke ni nnle be mmuu ɛɛbla nii, alɛ fabale kale Klekle fanta SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ nwu, fɛ mmle aabuɛ aatɛ nii.<verse eid="DEU 26:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="DEU 27" />
  <para style="s1">Yaa Afiofa Ya Bɛɛkpana Ni Di Afuɔ Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 27:1" />Mose ku Israel banɔɔfo latɔkɔ batii nwu alɛ: “Biklee afiofa ya mmle amuu lɛta ye ni miɛ. <verse eid="DEU 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 27:2" />Nse bitɔɔtaalɛ Yordan Okle nwu biebuo kasɔ ka di SAATE Yaa lee kɔyɔ anta ye ni, biɛyɔ afuɔ kplɛ awo bise, biekpiitaa nya ku akaaloo. <verse eid="DEU 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 27:3" />Nse fatɔɔtaalɛ feebuo kasɔ ka di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kɔyɔ anta fɔ nii, kpana kufiofa ko mmle kumuu sɛlaa fatika di afuɔ nwu suoto, kasɔ ka di nnyɛɛntu ku bablɔ kubiɛ ninfe ni, fɛle mmle di bawa lɛfɔ Yaa laka ntam aata fɔ nii. <verse eid="DEU 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 27:4" />Ni nse fɛɛtaalɛ Yordan Okle, faase afuɔ ya mmle di Ebal Kobokote osi, fɛ mmle kɔtɔkɔ fɔ ni miɛ, kpiitaa nya ku akaaloo. <verse eid="DEU 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 27:5" />Pɛ afuɔ oleɔta akyikye fata SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ ninfa. Tan-yɔ abɔɔsaa lɛkpɛnsaa kuninwii faablako ɔkpɛ ninya suoto. <verse eid="DEU 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 27:6" />Yɔ afuɔ amuamu ya manankyɛkyɛsɛ ni fapɛ oleɔta akyikye fata SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ, faata ofiɛ asaaɔta ninnya suoto fata SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ. <verse eid="DEU 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 27:7" />Ta atoko ɔkyɛ ole asaaɔta ninfa, le nya ku suoto lɛyɔɔ ɔnya di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ anu. <verse eid="DEU 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 27:8" />Kpana kufiofa ko mmle sɛlaa simuu klekle fatika di afuɔ ya mmle feese ni suoto.”<verse eid="DEU 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 27:9" />Ninfɛ di Mose ku olebatatɛ ba ninle ni Lewi batii latɔkɔ Israel batii bamuu alɛ, “Oo Israel, bilo bienu! Kanunua bitookple SAATE Yaa lee batii. <verse eid="DEU 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 27:10" />Nioso binu SAATE Yaa lee ɔlaa, bietikanko afiofa ku sɛsaabla nɔɔ se kɔyɔ nta ye ni miɛ.”<verse eid="DEU 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akpaani Di Otokopĩ Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 27:11" />Di dii nwu nkpo kale Mose latɔkɔ batii nwu alɛ:<verse eid="DEU 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 27:12" />Nse bitɔɔtaalɛ Yordan Okle yi, ana ya mmle ayila di Gerisim Kobokote osi baata batii nwu lɛtɔtrɔ: Simeon, Lewi, Yuda, Isaka, Yosef ku Benyamin. <verse eid="DEU 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 27:13" />Di ana ya mmle ayila di Ebal Kobokote osi baakpaani: Ruben, Gad, Aser, Sebulon, Dan ku Naftali.<verse eid="DEU 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 27:14" />Lewi batii babuɛ ku sɛlɔ siene batɔkɔ Israel batii bamuu alɛ:<verse eid="DEU 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 27:15" />“Bɛɛkpaani otii lele niewola ee ɛɛbla ni lɛbɔɔsaa afiɔ- lɛsaa le ninle ni diyududusaa diɛta ni SAATE nwu, kule ni asaawolatɛ nnɛɛ ɔkpɛ ɔbla- ɛɛyɔ ni eese ni di lewofa kamɛ.”</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:15">Di batii nwu bamuu batuna alɛ, “Diwa kaanya!”<verse eid="DEU 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 27:16" />“Bɛɛkpaani otii wɔ ninan-yɔ dibu ata ni ote ee ɔya.”</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:16">Di batii nwu bamuu batuna alɛ, “Diwa kaanya!”<verse eid="DEU 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 27:17" />“Bɛɛkpaani otii wɔ niɛkpa ni owo nɔɔ lɛmɛke.”</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:17">Di batii nwu bamuu batuna alɛ, “Diwa kaanya!”<verse eid="DEU 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 27:18" />“Bɛɛkpaani otii wɔ nieleko ni numbiɛtɛ katũ ɛɛtɔɔ eeyu ni osuku.”</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:18">Di batii nwu bamuu batuna alɛ, “Diwa kaanya!”<verse eid="DEU 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 27:19" />“Bɛɛkpaani otii wɔ ninambuɛ ni ɔlaa di osuku kanya ata ni ɔfɔɔ ee kuɛbi ee kpisɔfɔ di kakankɔ.”</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:19">Di batii nwu bamuu batuna alɛ, “Diwa kaanya!”<verse eid="DEU 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 27:20" />“Bɛɛkpaani otii wɔ nietenko ni ote ɔsɔfɔ, ta ɛɛkpɔnɔfɔsa ni ote atensaa oso.”</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:20">Di batii nwu bamuu batuna alɛ, “Diwa kaanya!”<verse eid="DEU 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 27:21" />“Bɛɛkpaani otii wɔ nietenko ni bɔkɛɛ lele.”</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:21">Di batii nwu bamuu batuna alɛ, “Diwa kaanya!”<verse eid="DEU 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 27:22" />“Bɛɛkpaani osuɔtɔ wɔ nietenko ni oblilɛma sankobi, ale ni ote obisankobi ee ɔya obisankobi.”</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:22">Di batii nwu bamuu batuna alɛ, “Diwa kaanya!”<verse eid="DEU 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 27:23" />“Bɛɛkpaani otii wɔ nietenko ni ɔmaato nɔɔ.”</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:23">Di batii nwu bamuu batuna alɛ, “Diwa kaanya!”<verse eid="DEU 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 27:24" />“Bɛɛkpaani otii wɔ nielo ni owo nɔɔ di lewofa kamɛ.”</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:24">Di batii nwu bamuu batuna alɛ, “Diwa kaanya!”<verse eid="DEU 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 27:25" />“Bɛɛkpaani otii wɔ niefũ ni ditunu kamɛ lɛsaa alɛ ablo ni otii wɔ ninaambla ni okpile.”</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:25">Di batii nwu bamuu batuna alɛ, “Diwa kaanya!”<verse eid="DEU 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 27:26" />“Bɛɛkpaani otii wɔ ninaamufũ kufiofa ko mmle sɛlaa ablako ni ɔkpɛ.”</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:26">Di batii nwu bamuu batuna alɛ, “Diwa kaanya!”<verse eid="DEU 27:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="DEU 28" />
  <para style="s1">Lɛtɔtrɔ Di Kotoko Ɔkyɔɔ Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 28:1" />Nse fɛɛkyɔɔ kotoko feenu SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ ɔlaa nwaa, feelolaa afiofa nɔɔ amuu lɛta fɔ ni miɛ feetikanko yi, ni SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kamatakatɛ fɔ katoo fanlenkee nnle mmuu di kasɔ ka mmle nwu suoto. <verse eid="DEU 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 28:2" />Lɛtɔtrɔ le mmle nimuu kamawa fɔ di suoto, nintikanko fɔ kafɔɔ, nse fɛɛkyɔɔ kotoko feenu SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ ɔlaa:<verse eid="DEU 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 28:3" />Babata fɔ lɛtɔtrɔ di okpoo ku kofe lefɔ.<verse eid="DEU 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 28:4" />Babata olofo-fɔtɔ lɛfɔ babi lɛtɔtrɔ ku kasɔ lɛfɔ alesaa ku babɔkɛɛ sele lɛfɔ abi- banankyue lɛfɔ abi ku bafoso lɛfɔ abi.<verse eid="DEU 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 28:5" />Babata lɛtɔtrɔ kakyikyɛ lɛfɔ ku nnaafũ ɔkɛkɛ lɛfɔ.<verse eid="DEU 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 28:6" />Babata fɔ lɛtɔtrɔ nse fakpe leeyo, babata fɔ lɛtɔtrɔ nse feedie kayi kafɔɔ.<verse eid="DEU 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 28:7" />SAATE nwu kamata alɛ fabalenkee balo lɛfɔ ba nimataka manyila fɔ ni di suoto di anu lɛfɔ. Babakye di osuku onwii suoto man-wa fɔ suoto, kafɔɔ babatoso mandiɛ fɔ di esuku ekuɛnsĩ suoto.<verse eid="DEU 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 28:8" />SAATE nwu kamata lɛtɔtrɔ di alesaa lɛfɔ ntɛkɔ ku lɛsaa biala di kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ lɛkpanko. SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kamata fɔ lɛtɔtrɔ di kasɔ ka ɔɔyɔ anta fɔ ni suoto.<verse eid="DEU 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 28:9" />Nse feele SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ afiofa nwu fɛɛkyɛ di sisuku nɔɔ suoto yi, ni SAATE nwu kamase fɔ fɛle batii nɔɔ klekle, fɛ mmle aaka ntam aatɛ aata fɔ nii. <verse eid="DEU 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 28:10" />Ni kayi ka mmle batii bamuu kamanya alɛ SAATE nwu leyooto bɔɔlɛɛ fɔ, ni babayɛkɛ fɔ. <verse eid="DEU 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 28:11" />SAATE nwu kamata lɛsaawɛ lɛfɔ mpɔ- di olofo-fɔtɔ lɛfɔ kamɛ babi, babɔkɛɛ sele lɛfɔ abi ku kasɔ lɛfɔ alesaa- di kasɔ ka suoto aaka ntam aata ni bawa lɛfɔ alɛ abayɔ anta fɔ nii.<verse eid="DEU 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 28:12" />SAATE nwu kamasɛkɛtɛ osi, lɛsaawɛ nɔɔ asaakatɛkɔ leyo, anta kanto nnɔɔ di kasɔ lɛfɔ suoto di obe kanya, anta lɛtɔtrɔ kafɔɔ di nnɛɛ lɛfɔ ɔkpɛ omuu kamɛ. Fabafɛnsa asaa fanta nnle kpinwu, kafɔɔ afɔ flɔbafɛnsa fakyeko kuonwii nfũ. <verse eid="DEU 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 28:13" />SAATE nwu kamayɔ fɔ ambla disi, diele ɔkà. Nse fɛɛkyɔɔ atoko feele SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ afiofa ya kɔta fɔ ni miɛ dii le mmle, feelolaa nya feetikanko nwaa kafɔɔ yi, ni obe lele fabatika di osi, diidii flɔbate kasɔ. <verse eid="DEU 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 28:14" />Tankyi di afiofa ya mmle kɔta fɔ ni miɛ kuanwii suoto, faafe koletanɛɛkyɛ ee kɔmɛntukyɛ, faalaatikanko bayaa bamba falaatoosumu ma kafɔɔ.<verse eid="DEU 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akpaani Di Otokopĩ Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 28:15" />Kafɔɔ, nse faakyɔɔ SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ ɔlaa atoko, fananlolaa afiofa ku sɛsaabla nɔɔ se simuu kɔta fɔ ni miɛ fale yi, ni akpaani ya mmle amuu kamawa fɔ di suoto nimalenkee fɔ nnɛɛ:<verse eid="DEU 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 28:16" />Babakpaani fɔ di okpoo, mankpaani fɔ di kofe.<verse eid="DEU 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 28:17" />Babakpaani kakyikyɛ ku nnaafũ ɔkɛkɛ lɛfɔ.<verse eid="DEU 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 28:18" />Babakpaani olofo-fɔtɔ lɛfɔ babi ku kasɔ lɛfɔ alesaa ku banankyue lɛfɔ abi ku bafoso lɛfɔ abi.<verse eid="DEU 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 28:19" />Babakpaani fɔ nse fakpe leeyo, babakpaani fɔ nse feedie kayi kafɔɔ.<verse eid="DEU 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 28:20" />SAATE nwu kamata lɛkpaani, kakpɔkpɔtɔ ku disi obu n-wa di suoto lɛfɔ di lɛsaa biala di kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ lɛkpanko, ninaase di obe wɔ fabawɔɔ, fanfua fampɛ ni kaasɔ, ta okpile wɔ fɛɛbla, feesĩ nwɔ ni oso. <verse eid="DEU 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 28:21" />SAATE nwu kamata sifiɛ kpile mpɛ fɔ ninaase di obe wɔ atɔɔwɔɔsa fɔ ni di kasɔ ka fababuo fannaayɔ ni suoto. <verse eid="DEU 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 28:22" />SAATE nwu kamata okoso-fiɛ, kɔbɔ̀ ku adiesaa ku difila kpankpa ku koleele n-wa di suoto lɛfɔ, anta asaa lɛfɔ nkpi ambuu ninta ninkpɛko fɔ ninaase di obe wɔ fabakpi nii. <verse eid="DEU 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 28:23" />Kolo ko di disi lɛfɔ osi kamaklee kumbla fɛle abɔɔsaa sɛɛle, kasɔ di nkpaa lɛfɔ kalɔ kamaklee kambla kekleke fɛle lɛbɔɔsaa. <verse eid="DEU 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 28:24" />SAATE nwu kamata kanto nkyi ambla kudu ku mpu di kasɔ lɛfɔ suoto; abakye kolo an-wa kasɔ ninaase di obe wɔ fɛɛwɔɔ nii. <verse eid="DEU 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 28:25" />SAATE nwu kamata manlenkee fɔ di balo lɛfɔ anu. Fabakye di osuku onwii suoto fankyɛ ɔkyɛ lɛma, kafɔɔ fabatoso di esuku ekuɛnsĩ suoto fandiɛ ma, n-se fatookple lɛyɛkɛsaa fɛɛta sɛka nlekɔ mmuu di kasɔ ka mmle suoto. <verse eid="DEU 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 28:26" />Kpi lɛfɔ kamale alesaa anta bakansiɛ bamuu di kɔfɛɛfɔ ku babɔkɛɛ ba di kasɔ suoto, kuonwii kafɔɔ dilɔbawɛ abayɛkɛsa ma mantoso nii. <verse eid="DEU 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 28:27" />SAATE nwu kamata Egipte adiesaa nwu okle ku adiesaa kplɛ ndie fɔ, akpaakuu ku oduɔfɔ ndie fɔ, manamafuo fɔ ni ofiɛ ɔkyà diidii. <verse eid="DEU 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 28:28" />SAATE nwu kamata fɔ difĩibuo, anu obiɛ ku disi kamɛ ɔkpɔkpɔtɔ. <verse eid="DEU 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 28:29" />Fabatɔɔpɛpɛɛ nnɛɛ fantoofenfe ku kakũ fɛle numbiɛtɛ di ditunu kamɛ. Lɛsaa biala fɛɛbla dilɔbalɛ dita fɔ; dii biala babanyinka fɔ, man-yu fɔ asaa, di kuonwii dilɔbawɛ abafũ fɔ nii.<verse eid="DEU 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 28:30" />Fabakaalɛ ɔsanko falɛ fɔɔyɔ, kafɔɔ osuɔtɔ bamba kamatenko nwɔ. Fabatofo leyo, kafɔɔ flɔbasiɛ nini kamɛ. Fabakpɛ awosobi kofe, kafɔɔ bia flɔbale nya abi. <verse eid="DEU 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 28:31" />Babalo nankyue lɛfɔ di anu lɛfɔ fan-nya, kafɔɔ flɔbawee sina nɔɔ kusinwii. Babayɔ osie manfũ bɔkɛɛ lɛfɔ wɔ nintuka ni atoo di nnɛɛ lɛfɔ, blɔbasinkplesa bawako fɔ kafɔɔ. Babayɔ bafoso lɛfɔ manta balo lɛfɔ, di kuonwii dilɔbafũ ma ata fɔ nii. <verse eid="DEU 28:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 28:32" />Babayɔ babisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ ku babisankobi lɛfɔ manta nnle bamba, dii biala fabayɔ anu fantɛ fantoonyu osuku nimbuo fɔ, kafɔɔ ɔnyɛɛ dilɔbawɛ fɔ fabadiki ni kɔkpaa. <verse eid="DEU 28:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 28:33" />Batii ba fanaan-ye ni nimale kasɔ ku dibuo lɛfɔ alesaa ya fɛɛkpɛ nii. Flɔbawɛ lɛsalɛsaa, kafɔɔ babanyinka fɔ mambla fɔ amumu di ayi lɛfɔ amuu kamɛ. <verse eid="DEU 28:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 28:34" />Asaa ya fɔnyanyaa ni kamata fɔ fambuo afĩi. <verse eid="DEU 28:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 28:35" />SAATE nwu kamata adiesaa ndie fɔ di akunkyi ku nkpaa ku dibuo manamafuo fɔ ni ɔkyà, dibakpɛ ninkye di nkpaasɔ lɛfɔ ninsifi disi lɛfɔ.<verse eid="DEU 28:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 28:36" />SAATE nwu kamakpaa afɔ ku ɔka wɔ feese fɛɛta ni suoto lɛfɔ ansifiko kale ka fanaaye ee bate lɛfɔ dieye nii. Nfa fabasumu bayaa bamba nɛ, bayaa ba ninle ni awosoku ku afuɔ. <verse eid="DEU 28:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 28:37" />Fabakple lɛyɛkɛsaa ku ɔfɔ̀ɔ-disifisaa ku lɛmansaa fanta nnle be mmuu di SAATE nwu kamakpaa fɔ ansifiko nii.<verse eid="DEU 28:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 28:38" />Fabapɛ asaa kpinwu di kofe, kafɔɔ kɛɛkɛɛ ko fabawɛ, diekye balososo kamawee nya. <verse eid="DEU 28:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 28:39" />Fabakpɛ awosobi kofe fannyu nya disi, kafɔɔ flɔbanyi nya nta ee fatɛsɛ nya, diekye akudikudi kamale nya. <verse eid="DEU 28:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 28:40" />Fabawɛ nnɔnyi awoso afe di kale lɛfɔ kamuu, kafɔɔ flɔbablako nnɔnyi nwu ɔkpɛ, diekye abi nwu kamakpakpaa an-wii. <verse eid="DEU 28:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 28:41" />Fabawɛ babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi kafɔɔ flɔbale ma, diekye babasifi sɛlanle kamɛ. <verse eid="DEU 28:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 28:42" />Balososo sɛlambu kamayɔ awoso lɛfɔ ku alesaa ya amuu fɛɛkpɛ ni di kasɔ lɛfɔ.<verse eid="DEU 28:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 28:43" />Ɔfɔɔ wɔ ninsi ni di ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ kamataka katoo fanfã anlenkee fɔ, kafɔɔ afɔ fabawakasɔ lɛkɛtɛɛ. <verse eid="DEU 28:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 28:44" />Abata fɔ asaa fanfɛnsa, kafɔɔ afɔ flɔbatɔɔ kɔfɛnsa. Abale disi, kafɔɔ afɔ fabale ɔkà.<verse eid="DEU 28:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 28:45" />Akpaani ya mmle amuu kamawa di suoto lɛfɔ. Abatikanko fɔ ankpɛko fɔ ninaase di obe wɔ abawɔɔsa fɔ nii. Diekye fatakyɔɔ SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ ɔlaa atoko, fale afiofa nɔɔ, fakyɛ di sisuku nɔɔ se ɛɛta fɔ ni suoto. <verse eid="DEU 28:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 28:46" />Abale dituosaa ku lɛsaa le niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ anta afɔ ku banantii lɛfɔ dinaa ni kaloo. <verse eid="DEU 28:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 28:47" />Diekye fatasumu SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ ku suoto lɛyɔɔ ku lɛpɔ̀ di obe wɔ kamɛ faale ni saawɛntɛ, <verse eid="DEU 28:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 28:48" />nioso fabasumu balo lɛfɔ ba di SAATE nwu lediki eekpee fɔ ni di kɔka ku otukɔnsɔ, lɛkyɔtɔ ku dipii nimu kamɛ. Abayɔ lɛbɔɔsaa ankpee fɔ siimu ninaase di obe wɔ abawɔɔsa fɔ nii.<verse eid="DEU 28:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 28:49" />SAATE nwu kamadiki kale fanfa batii ankpee fɔ, ankyeko kasɔ n-yɛntɛlekɔ, fɛle klikpo nikosoo an-wa ni kasɔ, kale ka sele fɔnɔbanu nii, <verse eid="DEU 28:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 28:50" />kale ka niɛbla ni yakayaka banaa ni dibu bɛɛta ni banɔɔfo ee banya ni babisɔ nyaami. <verse eid="DEU 28:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 28:51" />Bababɛbɛɛ babɔkɛɛ sele lɛfɔ abi ku kasɔ lɛfɔ alesaa ninaase di obe wɔ fabawɔɔ nii. Blɔbabu fɔ alesaa kuanwii, nta fɔle ee nnɔnyi ee banankyue abi kuanwii di banankyue lɛfɔ kamɛ ee afosobi di bafoso lɛfɔ kamɛ ninaase di obe wɔ fɛɛwɔɔ nii. <verse eid="DEU 28:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 28:52" />Babamana mankyi sekpoo kplɛ nwu simuu di kasɔ lɛfɔ nwu ninaase di obe wɔ di siyoyiɛ takale siene lɛfɔ nwu feetika ni disi kamabiɛ simpɛ ni kaasɔ. Babamana mankyi sekpoo kplɛ simuu di kasɔ ka di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kɔyɔ anta fɔ nii.<verse eid="DEU 28:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="DEU 28:53" />Ta dibuo le di balo lɛfɔ kamata fɔ ni di obe wɔ bɛɛmana fɔ beekyi ni oso yi, fabawee olofo-fɔtɔ lɛfɔ babi, babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi ba di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ lɛta fɔ ni suoto sina. <verse eid="DEU 28:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="DEU 28:54" />Bia osuɔtɔ wɔ niɛtɛ ate ni buɛɛ, ɛɛyɔ nwu ni olè di kamɛ lee dilɔbanya obilɛma omu ee ɔsɔfɔ nɔɔ wɔ ambɔmbɔ ni ee babi nɔɔ ba niebu basi ni nkpa nyaami, <verse eid="DEU 28:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="DEU 28:55" />ɔlɔbata kafɔɔ kuonwii lɛma babi nɔɔ sina se oowee ni sewo. Diekye sina nwu lete ninle nle eebu ni nɛ, ta dibuo le di balo lɛfɔ kamata fɔ ni di obe wɔ bɛɛmana sekpoo kplɛ lɛfɔ nwu simuu beekyi ni oso. <verse eid="DEU 28:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="DEU 28:56" />Ɔsanko wɔ niɛtɛ ate ni buɛɛ, ɛɛyɔ nwu ni olè di kamɛ lee- ta ɛɛyɔ nwu ni olè, ate ni buɛɛ oso yi, ɔlɔbatɔkɔ alɛ ɔɔyɔ kakpaasɔ nɔɔ ankaasa kaasɔ- abanya ɔblɔ ankpeeko ɔsa wɔ ambɔmbɔ ni ku obisuɔtɔbi ee obisankobi nɔɔ omu, <verse eid="DEU 28:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="DEU 28:57" />obi lekpomii di olofo-fɔtɔ nɔɔ kamɛ ku babi ba eelofo nii. Diekye ɛɛtɛ alɛ abawee ma di lewofa kamɛ di obe wɔ di ɔmana okyi nwu ku dibuo le di lo nwu kamata fɔ ni di sekpoo kplɛ lɛfɔ nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="DEU 28:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="DEU 28:58" />Nse faalolaa kufiofa ko mmle sɛlaa simuu bɛɛkpana ni di kukũ ko mmle kamɛ fatikanko, fanaayɛkɛ dibu ku leyooto yɛkɛle le mmle- ninle ni SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ yi- <verse eid="DEU 28:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="DEU 28:59" />ni SAATE nwu kamata sifiɛ yɛkɛle di kanya nisĩ nkpe ni osie ku sɛlaa otũ ninklɛ ni ku sifiɛ se ninan-yɔɔ ni wla mpɛ afɔ ku banantii lɛfɔ. <verse eid="DEU 28:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="DEU 28:60" />SAATE nwu kamayɔ sifiɛ se simuu faayɛkɛ ni di Egipte antika fɔ, sinka di suoto lɛfɔ. <verse eid="DEU 28:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="DEU 28:61" />SAATE nwu kafɔɔ kamakple an-yɔ ofiɛ biala lele ku kayi anyasaa ya manankpana bakpee ni di Kufiofa Kukũ ko mmle kamɛ antika fɔ di suoto, ninaase di obe wɔ babawɔɔsa fɔ nii. <verse eid="DEU 28:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="DEU 28:62" />Aye ba niapɔ ni fɛle awɛntrɛbi di kolo, kafui lee nfɛ nimabu di lɛpɔ̀ kanya, diekye bitakyɔɔ SAATE Yaa lee ɔlaa koto. <verse eid="DEU 28:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="DEU 28:63" />Fɛle mmle okle diɛsiɛko ni SAATE nwu alɛ aata ninlɛ ye, minkpɛ ni di lɛpɔ̀ kanya yi, nkpo kafɔɔ dibasiɛko nwɔ anta ye mimpɛ kaasɔ anwɔɔsa ye nɛ. Abasifi ye andiki di kasɔ nwu biofe ni ɔlaayɔ suoto.<verse eid="DEU 28:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="DEU 28:64" />N-se SAATE nwu ntɔɔsamisa ye eekpee di nnle mmuu kamɛ, diɛyɔ ni di kasɔ disi le diɛlaase ni di kasɔ disi le. Nfa biɔwa bayaa bamba- bale ni awosoku ku afuɔ osumu nɛ. Bayaa ba di aye ee bate lee ditatofo nii. <verse eid="DEU 28:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="DEU 28:65" />Bilɔbawɛ suoto lɛyɔɔ di nnle nwu nkpo kamɛ, ɔnyɛɛ katɛkɔ dilɔbawɛ dita nkpaasɔ lee. SAATE nwu kamata nfa lee osiɛ nta-ye disibu, anu ditikasaa kuninwii dilɔbasinwɛ, bilɔbasinwɛ otu lee dibiesaa. <verse eid="DEU 28:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="DEU 28:66" />Ɔ̀fɔɔ kamatosisifi ye, minsiɛ di difu kamɛ kakũ ku kakyɛ, nkpa lee disiɛbi dilɔbabudi ye kɔmɛ diidii. <verse eid="DEU 28:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="DEU 28:67" />Bibabuɛ ku olesɛ bilɛ, “Nse fɛle kɔtɔɔfɔ dile!” kɔtɔɔfɔ kafɔɔ mimbuɛ bilɛ, “Nse fɛle olesɛ dile!”- Ta lɛyɛkɛ le nimasiɛ ni di situ lee kamɛ ku anyasaa ya di anu lee kamanya ni oso. <verse eid="DEU 28:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="DEU 28:68" />SAATE nwu kamakplesa ye ansifiko Egipte di seklo kplɛ kamɛ, osuku wɔ labuɛ nlɛ bitansinkyɛ ni diidii. Nfa bibayɔ suoto lee minsunsũ minta balo lee fɛ basuɔtɔ ku basanko balanle nɛ, kafɔɔ kuonwii dilɔbaya ye.<verse eid="DEU 28:68" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="DEU 29" />
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Kanya Ninii Ku Israel Batii Di Moab Kasɔ Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 29:1" />Nnya kanya ninii sisuku se di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ ni Mose alɛ abla ni ku Israel batii di Moab, dikyakaa ni di kanya ninii le aabla ni ku mma di Horeb Kobokote.<verse eid="DEU 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 29:2" />Ninfɛ di Mose lalɛɛ Israel batii nwu bamuu aasiisa aatɔkɔ ma alɛ:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="DEU 29:2" />
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 29:2">Bitɔɔnya ku anu lee lɛsaa le di SAATE nwu labla ni Farao, banɔɔfotii nɔɔ bamuu ku kasɔ nɔɔ kamuu di Egipte. <verse eid="DEU 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 29:3" />Ku anu lee amu bianya ɔsɔ onyu kplɛ, atuosaa ya niabla ni ɔkpɛ ku sɛsaabla kplɛ se niabla ni ɔkpɛ nwu nkpo. <verse eid="DEU 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 29:4" />Kafɔɔ diɛbase ni di miɛ dii le mmle SAATE nwu diita ye disibu le ninnu ni kasɔ ee anu ya nin-nya nii ee atoko ya ninnu nii. <verse eid="DEU 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 29:5" />Di alɛɛ afosi-ana ya lakpaa ye lafenko ni di ɔfaafuu kamɛ, aklesaa lee ditabɛbɛɛ ye di suoto ee ntokota dibubudi di nkpaa lee. <verse eid="DEU 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 29:6" />Bitale bloblo, bianyi nta ee nta siene bamba kunwii. Labla nle mmle di mmle biatofo ni bilɛ ami ninle ni SAATE Yaa lee.<verse eid="DEU 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 29:7" />Di obe wɔ biadu ni lɛba le mmle, Hesbon ɔka Sihon ku Basan ɔka Og ladie baawa baabakpɛko wo, kafɔɔ bualenkee ma. <verse eid="DEU 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 29:8" />Buafũ kasɔ lɛma buata Ruben batii, Gad batii ku Manaase batii kɔna-kakyɛ fɛle atesaa lɛma.<verse eid="DEU 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 29:9" />Bilolaa kanya ninii le mmle bitikanko, di mmle di lɛsaa biala biɛbla kamalɛ ninta ye ni. <verse eid="DEU 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 29:10" />Bamuu lee biyɛ ninfũ miɛ di SAATEE Yaa lee anu- batunletɛ ku baka batii lee, okpoo banɔɔfo ku banɔɔfotii lee, ku Israel batii bule, <verse eid="DEU 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 29:11" />minko babi lee ku basɔfɔ lee ku bafɔɔ ba ninsi ni di kamɛ lee boobudi ntɔɔni manta ye ni, mantuka ni ntu kafɔɔ manta ye nii. <verse eid="DEU 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 29:12" />Biyɛ ninfũ di mmle bianii ni kanya ku SAATE Yaa lee, kanya ninii le di SAATE nwu kɔbla ni ku aye miɛ dii le mmle ku kanya otĩi ku ntam, <verse eid="DEU 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 29:13" />anfũ ye ankpee ni miɛ dii le mmle fɛ batii nɔɔ bile nii, alɛ aale ye ni Yaa fɛ mmle aabuɛ aatɛ ni di ntam be aaka aata ni bate lee Abraham, Isak ku Yakob. <verse eid="DEU 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 29:14" />Diele ku aye lete kɔbla kanya ninii ku ntam nimi be mmle, <verse eid="DEU 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 29:15" />aye ba nin-yɛ ni ninfũ ku awo miɛ, di SAATE Yaa loo anu, kafɔɔ ku mba kafɔɔ ninan-yɛ ni ninfũ miɛ.<verse eid="DEU 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 29:16" />Aye bamu biye mmle buasiɛ ni di Egipte ku mmle buabuo buafe ni di nnle be di osuku buabadu ni nfũ. <verse eid="DEU 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 29:17" />Bianya di kamɛ lɛma ayududusaa lɛma atembi nwu baabla ni ku awosoku, afuɔ ku koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle. <verse eid="DEU 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 29:18" />Bilolaa binyu nwaa bilɛ osuɔtɔ ee ɔsanko, kafaabi ee kɔna kukunwii ninsi ni kaamɛ lee miɛ diekyi di SAATE Yaa loo kamaa di otu kamɛ asifi alaasumu nnle nwu nkpo bayaa; bilolaa binyu bilɛ odu kuonwii diesi di kamɛ lee nimawako ni kɔfa-kpile lonle nwu okle.<verse eid="DEU 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 29:19" />Nse otii owo lenu ntam sɛlaa se mmle, ɛɛta lɛtɔtrɔ suoto nɔɔ, eenyu kafɔɔ alɛ, “Kamawɛ onwu nnwuna, kuntɛ lɛwɛ onunsie nlɛ kɔkyɛ di ami omu osuku kanya.” Ni nle mmle kamawako letoko nanfi di kasɔ ka di kanto nnɔɔ ni ku kasɔ kosole suoto. <verse eid="DEU 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 29:20" />SAATE nwu dilɔbatuna alɛ ɔɔyɔ ankyɛ nwɔ; ɔblɔ nɔɔ yakayaka ku osie kamasoo di otii nwu suoto. Ni akpaani ya amuu bɛɛkpana ni di kukũ ko mmle kamɛ kamawa nwɔ di suoto, SAATE nwu kafɔɔ kamayɛɛsa nwɔ leyooto di kasɔ ka mmle suoto. <verse eid="DEU 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 29:21" />SAATE nwu kamadiki lete nɔɔ di Israel ana nwu amuu kamɛ anta letoko nanfi, di mmle kanya di kanya ninii akpaani ya amuu bɛɛkpana ni di Kufiofa Kukũ ko mmle kamɛ nte nii.<verse eid="DEU 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 29:22" />Babi lee ba nimawa ni di alɛɛ ya nikɔwa ni sɛɛmaa, ku bafɔɔ ba nimakye ni nsɔ fanfa manwa ni kamanya letoko nanfi le niɛwa ni di kasɔ nwu suoto ku sifiɛ se di SAATE nwu lɛyɔ eekpete ka ni di suoto. <verse eid="DEU 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 29:23" />Kasɔ nwu kamuu kamale mmba kasɔ ka nikofiɛ ni ku amã- lɛsalɛsaa kuniwii dilɔbalɛ ɔpɛ ee dikɔntɔ, sɛfa kusinwii dilɔbayila di kasɔ nwu suoto. Kasɔ nwu kamate fɛle Sodom ku Gomora, Adma ku Seboim wɔ di SAATE nwu lawɔɔsa ni ku ɔblɔ yakayaka. <verse eid="DEU 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 29:24" />Nnle nwu mmuu batii matɔɔkaalɛ alɛ: “Obe oso di SAATE nwu lɛbla lɛsaa le mmle di kasɔ ka mmle suoto? Obe ɔblɔ yakayaka nɛ?”<verse eid="DEU 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 29:25" />Nioso kanya didiki nimale alɛ: “Diekye batii ba mmle lediɛ kanya ninii le di SAATE nwu, bate lɛma Yaa lanii ni ku mma, di obe wɔ aakpaa ma aadieko ni di Egipte kasɔ. <verse eid="DEU 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 29:26" />Beedie bɛɛkyɛ boosumu bayaa bamba, manwakasɔ manta ma, bayaa ba manan-ye ni, bayaa ba ananta ma nii. <verse eid="DEU 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 29:27" />Nioso di SAATE nwu ɔblɔ lesoo di kasɔ nwu suoto, ni ɛɛyɔ akpaani ya mmle amuu bɛɛkpana ni di kukũ ko mmle kamɛ ɛɛwako ka di suoto nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 29:28" />Ni di ɔblɔ yakayaka ku lɛblɔfiɛ osie kanya yi, SAATE nwu ladiki ma aakyeko kasɔ lɛma suoto aasifiko kasɔ bamba, fɛ mmle dite ni miɛ nɛ.”<verse eid="DEU 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 29:29" />Awofasaa yi, SAATE Yaa loo ále ale, kafɔɔ asaa ya beediki ni kayi nle awo ku babi loo ale dinaa ni kaloo, alɛ buatikanko kufiofa ko mmle sɛlaa simuu.<verse eid="DEU 29:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="DEU 30" />
  <para style="s1">Sisuku Se Ninkple Sinse Ni Otii Ololaa Ku Lɛtɔtrɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 30:1" />Nse lɛtɔtrɔ ku lɛkpaani le nimuu lɛyɔ lɛtɛ fɔ ni di anu lɛwa fɔ di suoto, feemufũ nya feekpee di otu, di lɛba lele di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ lɛtɛ fɔ di nnle nwu kamɛ yi, <verse eid="DEU 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 30:2" />di afɔ ku babi lɛfɔ biekple biɛwa SAATE Yaa lee ɔkyɛ, biɛkyɔɔ nwɔ ɔlaa atoko ku situ lee simuu ku sɛkla lee simuu di lɛsaa biala lɛtɔkɔ ye ni miɛ yi, <verse eid="DEU 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 30:3" />ni SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kamanya fɔ nyaami ankplesa lɛlɛ lɛfɔ anta fɔ, ankple ansiisa ye ankyeko nnle be mmuu kamɛ ɛɛsamiisa ye eekpee nii. <verse eid="DEU 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 30:4" />Nse bia kasɔ fanfa suoto di kolo kalɔ bɛɛkpaa ye beesifiko yi, SAATE Yaa lee kamasiisa ye ankplesa ye anwako. <verse eid="DEU 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 30:5" />SAATE nwu kamakpaa ye anwako kasɔ ka ninle ni bate lee kale, minaayɔ ka. Abata ninlɛ ye ninkyakaa, mimpɔ̀ minlenkee bate lee. <verse eid="DEU 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 30:6" />SAATE Yaa lee nwu kamakyisa aye ku banantii lee situ, di mmle biabɔmbɔ nwɔ ni ku situ lee simuu ku sɛkla lee simuu minsiɛ ni nkpa. <verse eid="DEU 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 30:7" />SAATE Yaa lee nwu kamayɔ akpaani nwu amuu antika di balo lee ba niekyidi ye bɔɔkpɛko ye ni suoto. <verse eid="DEU 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 30:8" />Bibakple minkyɔɔ SAATE nwu ɔlaa atoko, mintikanko afiofa nɔɔ nwu amuu kɔyɔ nta ye ni miɛ. <verse eid="DEU 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 30:9" />Ni SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ nwu kamata lɛlɛ ntɛ ninlɛ fɔ di nnɛɛ lɛfɔ ɔkpɛ omuu kamɛ ku olofo-fɔtɔ lɛfɔ babi, babɔkɛɛ sele lɛfɔ abi ku kasɔ lɛfɔ alesaa. Suoto kamakple sinyɔɔ SAATE nwu di suoto lɛfɔ anta ninlɛ fɔ, fɛ mmle okle di suoto layɔɔ nwɔ ni di bate lɛfɔ suoto, <verse eid="DEU 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 30:10" />nse fɛɛkyɔɔ SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ ɔlaa atoko, feeklee afiofa nɔɔ, fɛɛkyɛ di sisuku nɔɔ se bɛɛkpani ni di Kufiofa Kukũ ko mmle kamɛ, feemunikĩi fɛɛwa SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ ɔkyɛ ku otu lɛfɔ omuu ku ɔkla lɛfɔ omuu.<verse eid="DEU 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Diki Nkpa Ee Kukpi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 30:11" />Kanunua kufiofa ko kokpee fɔ ni miɛ diesii fɔ osie ee kukyo di ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ. <verse eid="DEU 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 30:12" />Diele osi kaatoo kukpe alɛ faakaalɛ falɛ, “Owe nimakata ankyɛ osi nwu anaayɔ amayie kũ lɛkya anta wo alɛ buakyɔɔ kũ atoko?” <verse eid="DEU 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 30:13" />Ee kukpe di lekpo sɛmaa, alɛ faakaalɛ falɛ, “Owe nimataalɛ lekpo nwu anaayɔ kũ amayie lɛkya anta wo alɛ buakyɔɔ kũ atoko?” <verse eid="DEU 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 30:14" />Oowo, ɔlaa nwu ntɔɔtɛɛtɛɛ fɔ nwaa; nfɛ kusi fɔ kaanya ku otu lɛfɔ kamɛ nioso faafuo nwu atoko ɔkyɔɔ.<verse eid="DEU 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 30:15" />Nyu, lɛyɔ nkpa ku lɛlɛ, kukpi ku kawɔɔ lɛtɛ fɔ di anu miɛ. <verse eid="DEU 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 30:16" />Diekye kɔtɔkɔ fɔ miɛ nlɛ bɔmbɔ SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ, faakyɛ di sisuku nɔɔ, faaklee asaa otuo nɔɔ, ablasaa ku afiofa nɔɔ; ni fabasiɛ nkpa fanlofo fanse fansaa fanse, ni SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ kamata fɔ lɛtɔtrɔ di kasɔ ka foobuo fanaayɔ ni suoto.<verse eid="DEU 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 30:17" />Kafɔɔ nse otu lɛfɔ lemunukĩi, fanankyɔɔ kotoko, ni nse feesifi fɛɛlaawakasɔ fɛɛta bayaa bamba feesumu ma yi, <verse eid="DEU 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 30:18" />ni kɔtɔkɔ fɔ miɛ nlɛ, nwaako babawɔɔsa fɔ. Flɔbasiɛ nkpa faklɛ di kasɔ ka fɔɔtaalɛ Yordan Okle fambuo fanaayɔ ni suoto.<verse eid="DEU 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 30:19" />Miɛ dii le mmle lɛlɛɛ osi ku kasɔ fɛ kamaabayilatɛ di suoto lɛfɔ nlɛ, lɛyɔ nkpa ku kukpi, lɛtɔtrɔ ku lɛkpaani lɛtɛ fɔ di anu. Nioso nunua diki nkpa, di mmle di afɔ ku babi lɛfɔ kasiɛ ni nkpa, <verse eid="DEU 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 30:20" />alɛ faabɔmbɔ ni SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ, fan-nu ni ɔlaa nɔɔ, famufũ nwɔ fanklee ni kpinkpĩ. Diekye SAATE nwu ninle fɔ nkpa, nnwɔɔ nimata fɔ alɛɛ kpinwu di kasɔ ka suoto aaka ntam aata ni bate lɛfɔ Abraham, Isak ku Yakob nɛ.<verse eid="DEU 30:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="DEU 31" />
  <para style="s1">Yosua Labakple Mose Asaa Letɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 31:1" />Ninfɛ di Mose ladie aalaakakatɛ sɛlaa se mmle aata Israel batii bamuu alɛ: <verse eid="DEU 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 31:2" />“Kanunua ntoobe lefũ alɛɛ kɔlafa-afosi-anyɔ, namasinfuo ye katũ oleko. SAATE nwu lɛtɔkɔ mi alɛ, ‘Flɔbawaalɛ Yordan Okle nwu.’ <verse eid="DEU 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 31:3" />SAATE Yaa lee omu kamale ye katũ anwaalɛ. Abawɔɔsa nnle be mmle di anu lee, minaayɔ kasɔ lɛma. Yosua kafɔɔ kamale ye katũ anwaalɛ, fɛ mmle di SAATE nwu labuɛ nii. <verse eid="DEU 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 31:4" />SAATE nwu kafɔɔ kamabla ma lɛsaa le okle aabla ni Amori batii baka Sihon ku Og ba aawɔɔsa ni ku kasɔ lɛma. <verse eid="DEU 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 31:5" />SAATE nwu kamayɔ ma ankpee ye ninnɛɛ, dikpeni biɛbla ma nle nimuu lɛtɔkɔ ye nii. <verse eid="DEU 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 31:6" />Biwɛ osie, biɛwɛ sɛkambi kafɔɔ. Bitanyɛka ee difu lapɛ ye ta mma oso, diekye SAATE Yaa lee nkyɛ ku aye; ɔlɔbadiɛ ye ee asĩ ye diidii.”<verse eid="DEU 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 31:7" />Ninfɛ di Mose lalɛɛ Yosua di Israel batii bamuu anu aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Wɛ osie faawɛ sɛkambi kafɔɔ, diekye dikpeni fɛɛkyɛ ku batii ba mmle biebuo kasɔ ka di SAATE nwu laka ntam aata ni bawa lɛma alɛ abayɔ anta ma nii, dikpeni fɛɛyɔ ka fɛɛsɛ fɛɛta ma fɛ atesaa lɛma. <verse eid="DEU 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 31:8" />SAATE nwu omu kamale fɔ katũ, abasiɛ ko fɔ kafɔɔ; ɔlɔbadiɛ fɔ ee asĩ fɔ diidii. Tan-yɛkɛ; tanta nnɛɛ lafee fɔ.”<verse eid="DEU 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kufiofa Nwu Ɔka Di Alɛɛ Akuɛnsĩ Biala Kamɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 31:9" />Nioso Mose lakpana kufiofa ko mmle, ni aayɔ kũ aata Lewi babisuɔtɔbi, olebatatɛ ba nintuka ni SAATE nwu kanya ninii lɛkaa nwu ku Israel banɔɔfo nwu bamuu nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 31:10" />Ninfɛ di Mose latɔkɔ ma alɛ: “Di lɛlɛɛ kuɛsinle biala kayɛntɛkɔ, dile ni ato ɔyɔ ɔkyɛ lɛlɛɛ kamɛ, di Akpanta Dii olebee kamɛ, <verse eid="DEU 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 31:11" />di Israel batii bamuu lɛbasi di SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ anu di lɛba le abadiki anta nii yi, ka kufiofa ko mmle di anu lɛma fata ma baanu. <verse eid="DEU 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 31:12" />Siisa batii nwu- basuɔtɔ, basanko, babisɔ ku bafɔɔ ba ninsi ni di sekpoo lɛfɔ- di mmle baanu mantekete ni mmle baayɛkɛ ni SAATE Yaa lɛfɔ, manlolaa kufiofa ko mmle kumuu sɛlaa mantikanko ni. <verse eid="DEU 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 31:13" />Dikpeni babi lɛma ba ninan-ye ni kufiofa ko mmle nnu kũ, mantekete mmle baayɛkɛ ni SAATE Yaa lee, di obe wɔ bisi ni di kasɔ ka biɔwaalɛ Yordan Okle minaayɔ nii.”<verse eid="DEU 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">SAATE Nwu Lakakatɛ Aata Mose Lɛyɛntɛle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 31:14" />SAATE nwu latɔkɔ Mose alɛ, “Kanunua kukpi lɛfɔ dii ntɔɔtɛɛtɛɛ. Lɛɛ Yosua biɛbayila di Lɛkpaayo le Mansi ni, di nfũ kamayɔ ɔkpɛ nkpee nwɔ ni ninnɛɛ.” Nioso Mose ku Yosua labayila di Lɛkpaayo le Mansi ni.<verse eid="DEU 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 31:15" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu labakyɔɔ di Lɛkpaayo nwu di lelokonkyɛ takale letembi nɛ. Ni di lelokonkyɛ nwu layila di Lɛkpaayo nwu kayoko nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 31:16" />Ni di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ Mose alɛ: “Nfɛ foofe ɔnyɛɛ ɔtɛ ku bate lɛfɔ, n-se batii ba mmle ntɔɔyɔ suoto lɛma bɛɛta bafɔɔ bayaa ba di kasɔ ka boobuo nii. Babasĩ mi, manlalaasa kanya ninii le labla ni ku mma. <verse eid="DEU 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 31:17" />Di dii nwu nkpo kale ɔblɔ kamafiɛ mi, nsĩ ma; kamawofasa anu nii di suoto lɛma, nta manwɔɔsa ma. Di dii nwu nkpo, anyanyaasaa ku dibuo kpinwu kamawa ma di suoto mankaalɛ alɛ, ‘Diele Yaa loo wɔ ninasinsiko wo ni oso di anyanyaasaa ya mmle kɔwa wo di suoto nɛ?’ <verse eid="DEU 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 31:18" />Ni nwaako di dii nwu nkpo, kamawofasa anu nii di suoto lɛma ta akpilesaa lɛma amuu oso, bɛɛkyɛ boosumu ni bayaa bamba.<verse eid="DEU 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 31:19" />“Kanuna bikpana onu wɔ mmle bitɛ, bietuo nwu Israel batii, biɛta ma basa nwu alɛ kuale kamaadiyilasaa nintɛɛ di suoto lɛma. <verse eid="DEU 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 31:20" />Nse ntɔɔkpaa ma lɛwako kasɔ ka di nnyɛɛntu ku bablɔ kobiɛ ninfe nii, kasɔ ka laka ntam lata ni bawa lɛma, beele beemiɛ di asaa kɔlɛ ma ɔkyɛ yi, babakyi manaasumu bayaa bamba, manlalaasa kanya ninii nii, mansĩ mi kafɔɔ. <verse eid="DEU 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 31:21" />Ni nse anyanyaasaa ku dibuo nwu kɔwa ma di suoto yi, onu wɔ mmle kamale kamaadiyilasaa di suoto lɛma, diekye banantii lɛma dilɔbayee nwu. Bia fiɛ kamakpaa ma nwako ni kasɔ ka laka ntam latɛ lata ma ni yi, latofo lɛsaa le baatɛ ni ɔbla.” <verse eid="DEU 31:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 31:22" />Nioso dii nwu nkpo Mose lakpana onu wɔ mmle aatɛ, ni aatuo nwu Israel batii nɛ.<verse eid="DEU 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 31:23" />Ni di SAATE nwu layɔ kufiofa ko mmle aata Nun obisuɔtɔbi Yosua alɛ: “Wɛ osie, faawɛ sɛkambi, diekye afɔ nimakpaa Israel batii fanwako kasɔ ka laka ntam latɛ lata ma ni nɛ, ni ami omu kamasiɛko fɔ.”<verse eid="DEU 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 31:24" />Di Mose laloo ni kufiofa ko mmle sɛlaa ɔkpana di kukũ ko mmle kamɛ, diayɔ ni di kasɔ kakyekɔ dialaase ni di kayɛntɛkɔ yi, <verse eid="DEU 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 31:25" />ni aata Lewi batii ba niatuka ni SAATE nwu kanya ninii lɛlakaa kufiofa ko mmle alɛ, <verse eid="DEU 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 31:26" />“Yɔ Kufiofa Kukũ ko mmle fatɛ di SAATE Yaa lee kanya ninii lɛlakaa ɔlɔɔkɔ. Nfa kuɔwa ɔbate kunle kamaayilatɛ di suoto lee nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 31:27" />Diekye n-ye mmle bikpe ni otokopĩ ku onunsie. Nse biataka biayila di SAATE nwu suoto di obe wɔ nsi ni kaamɛ lee nkpe ni nkpa, ni lɛ nfɛ di ɔtaka oyila lee kamate di kakpimaa nii! <verse eid="DEU 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 31:28" />Bisiisa ana lee nwu banɔɔfo bamuu ku banɔɔfotii bamuu, di mmle kakakatɛ sɛlaa se mmle nta ma man-nu ni, ninlɛɛ osi ku kasɔ babale kamaabayilatɛ di suoto lɛma. <verse eid="DEU 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 31:29" />Diekye n-ye nlɛ di kakpimaa nii bibalalaa, minkyi kafɔɔ di sisuku se suoto latɔkɔ ye nlɛ bikyɛ nii. Di ayi ya nikɔwa ni kamɛ yi, anyanyaasaa kamawa di suoto lee, diekye bibabla okpile di SAATE nwu anu, minta aanya ɔblɔ ta asaa ya di nnɛɛ lee lɛbla ni oso.”<verse eid="DEU 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 31:30" />Ni di Mose labuɛ onu wɔ mmle sɛlaa, diayɔ ni di kasɔkakyekɔ dialaase ni di kayɛntɛkɔ aata Israel batii dikudi nimuu lanu nɛ.<verse eid="DEU 31:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="DEU 32" />
  <para style="s1">Mose Onu Nwu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 32:1" />Oo osi, bikyɔɔ atoko, kamakakatɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:1">Oo kasɔ, nu kanya nii sɛlaa.<verse eid="DEU 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 32:2" />Ta asaa nii otuo anɔɔ fɛle kanto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:2">sɛlaa nii kafɔɔ sisoo fɛle oblokyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:2">fɛle kanto wɛɛwɛɛ di sɛfa fɔle suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:2">fɛle kanto kplɛ di asaa ya bɛɛpɛ ni suoto.<verse eid="DEU 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 32:3" />Kamayie lɛkya di SAATE nwu leyooto suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:3">Oo, tansa Yaa loo osie kplɛ nwu!<verse eid="DEU 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 32:4" />Nnwɔɔ ninle Difuɔnkpaa nwu nɛ, sɛkpɛ nɔɔ lewo niimu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:4">sisuku nɔɔ simuu nte tinini.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:4">Onukwale Yaa wɔ ninambla ni lɛsaa lalaale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:4">ate tinini, ambla ni kafɔɔ asaa di osuku kanya.<verse eid="DEU 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 32:5" />Beediki kalalaa kɔkpaa di suoto nɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:5">sinunsɔ oso baasinle nwɔ batii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:5">kɔna kpile ku balaatɛ bale.<verse eid="DEU 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 32:6" />Oo batii ba ninankpa ni manan-ye ni lɛsaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:6">nkpo dikaatɛ biabla SAATE nwu nɛ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:6">Diele nnwɔɔ ninle fɔ Kote, Blatɛ lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:6">nnwɔ niɛbla fɔ, ɛɛdiki fɔ ni kafɔɔ nɛ?<verse eid="DEU 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 32:7" />Nyuma saa obe nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:7">faabu diisi fanyu di saa bakofo suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:7">Kaalɛ teefɔ, abatɔkɔ fɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:7">banɔɔfo lɛfɔ, babadiki kamɛ manta fɔ.<verse eid="DEU 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 32:8" />Obe wɔ di Nnwɔ Niɛtaka Katoo alenke ni lata ni nnle nwu atesaa lɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:8">obe wɔ aasɛ ni batii-nyu bamuu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:8">aatika amɛ aata ni batii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:8">di mmle di Israel babisuɔtɔbi lɛpɔ nte ni kanya.<verse eid="DEU 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 32:9" />Diekye SAATE nwu bale ninle batii nɔɔ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:9">Yakob ninle atesaa nɔɔ amu.<verse eid="DEU 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 32:10" />Ɔfaafuu kasɔ aanyɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:10">di kasɔ ka niakpi kaate ni, kate ni kafukuti kafɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:10">Aatĩtĩi nwɔ, aakɔkɔɔ nwɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:10">aatuo nwɔ osuku fɛle ninu nɔɔ naatĩ,<verse eid="DEU 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 32:11" />fɛle mmle di klikpo n-nyu ni leyo nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:11">anflɛlɛtɛ ankyi ni abi nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:11">anfukuti ni afoko nɔɔ kafɔɔ ammufũ nya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:11">anklee ni di mmle anaakpa nii.<verse eid="DEU 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 32:12" />SAATE nwu lete nialeko nwɔ katũ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:12">bafɔɔ yaa kuonwii ditakyakaa di suoto nɔɔ.<verse eid="DEU 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 32:13" />Aatɔɔ aafe di nsɔ takale suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:13">aatɔɔ afe nwu awosobi aale.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:13">Aatɔɔ bablɔ ba niakye ni difuɔnkpaa kamɛ aanyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:13">ku nnɔnyi be niakye ni afuɔ siene sɛkyɛɛfɛ,<verse eid="DEU 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 32:14" />ku nnyɛɛtu kpɛnkpɛ ku banankyue ku bafoso nnyɛɛntu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:14">ku bafoso ku batie ba ninsi ni lɛla,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:14">ku Basan akunumuu kplɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:14">ku atitabi abi nwaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:14">Faanyi nta be baaka baakyeko ni awosobi suoto.<verse eid="DEU 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 32:15" />Yesurun<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Israel mankple manlɛɛ leyooto le mmle nɛ, lɛsɔdiki ninle otii wɔ ninte tinini</char></note> labawɛ suoto kafɔɔ aawɛ otokopĩ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:15">aasiɛ lɛla, aabawɛ onutũ, aawɛ suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:15">Nioso aadiɛ Yaa wɔ niabla nwɔ ni aatɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:15">aasĩ Difuɔnkpaa le ninle nwɔ ni Dikitɛ.<verse eid="DEU 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 32:16" />Baata Yaa lakpɛ sɛsɔfɔwo ku bafɔɔ bayaa lɛma nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:16">ni baakpee nwɔ ɔblɔ ku ayududusaa lɛma nwu nɛ.<verse eid="DEU 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 32:17" />Baata ole baata afiɔ ya ninanle ni Yaa-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:17">bayaa ba batatofo nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:17">bayaa ba niadie ni sɛfɔle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:17">bayaa ba di bate lee ditayɛkɛ nii.<verse eid="DEU 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 32:18" />Difuɔnkpaa le niale ye ni kote, biasĩ nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:18">ni biayee Yaa wɔ nialofo ye ni nɛ.<verse eid="DEU 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 32:19" />Ni di SAATE nwu lanya nle mmle ni aasĩ ma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:19">diekye babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi nɔɔ lakpee nwɔ ɔblɔ.<verse eid="DEU 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 32:20" />Ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Kamawofasa anu nii di suoto lɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:20">nin-nya mmle di kayɛntɛkɔ lɛma kamate nii;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:20">diekye kɔna lalaale kule,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:20">babi ba ninaa ni onukwale.<verse eid="DEU 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 32:21" />Baatɛɛ lakpɛ sɛsɔfɔwo di asaa ya ninanle ni yaa suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:21">ni baakpee mi ɔblɔ ku afiɔ lɛma ya ninandie ni lɛsalɛsaa nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:21">Nioso kamata mankpɛ sɛsɔfɔwo di mba ninanle ni batii suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:21">Kamata ɔblɔ nfiɛ ma di kale ka ninaa ni lɛsɔnu suoto.<verse eid="DEU 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 32:22" />Diekye kafutu nii nfɛ n-yɛ ɔtɔ kuɔkɛsɛɛ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:22">nnwɔ nikofiɛ kunkyɛ ni ɔkya kamɛ kaalɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:22">Ɔtɔ nwu kamawɔɔsa kasɔ ku asaa ya nin-yɛ ka ni di suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:22">kunfiɛ abokote nwu asɔse.<verse eid="DEU 32:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 32:23" />“Kamasiisa sɛlaa kpile ntika ma di suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:23">nintaa kɔtaa nii nkpee ma.<verse eid="DEU 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 32:24" />Kamata kɔka siene nkpɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:24">kɔ̀bɔ ofiɛ ku ofiɛ kpile mapɛ ma;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:24">Kamadiki lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ yakayaka nkpee ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:24">kɔsaanwu kpile ko ninwududu ni di kudu kamɛ mmanu ma.<verse eid="DEU 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 32:25" />Kapamii kamalo babi lɛma di lɛkpaka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:25">difu kamapɛ ma di ayo lɛma kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:25">Bakosopo ku bakpeele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:25">babifɔɔle ku banɔɔfo asifututu kamakpi.<verse eid="DEU 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 32:26" />Labuɛ nlɛ kamasamiisa ma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:26">n-yɛɛsa ma ayooto alɛ batii dilɔbasinyuma ma,<verse eid="DEU 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 32:27" />kafɔɔ noomiɛ nlɛ balo lɛma bakpee mi ɔblɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:27">nse diele nkpo bakyiditɛ lɛma kamatakatɛ suoto katoo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:27">mambuɛ alɛ, ‘Kɔnɛɛ loo nielenkee ma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:27">ni diele SAATE nwu niɛbla nle mmle nimuu.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 32:28" />Kale ka ninan-ye ni lɛsaa bale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:28">di lɛsɔnu nnaa ni kaamɛ lɛma.<verse eid="DEU 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 32:29" />Nse loo beebe anu babawɛ lɛsɔnu le mmle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:29">mambu disi di mmle di kayɛntɛkɔ lɛma kamate nii!<verse eid="DEU 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 32:30" />Lɛ di otii onwii kafuo batii kakpe oyilako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:30">ee batii banyɔ kakpɛko batii nkpe lefosi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:30">Difuɔnkpaa lɛma nwu ntoosunsũ ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:30">sɛɛ SAATE nwu ntoodiki ma ɛɛta?<verse eid="DEU 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 32:31" />Diekye difuɔnkpaa lɛma nwu diete fɛle Difuɔnkpaa loo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:31">fɛ mmle bia di balo loo lefũ beekpee nii.<verse eid="DEU 32:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 32:32" />Nta lɛma nkye Sodom nta kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:32">ninkye ni kafɔɔ Gomora afe kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:32">Awosobi lɛma leyii ku kɔfa kpile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:32">di ntu ninya nkpe ni olo.<verse eid="DEU 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 32:33" />Nta lɛma nle asaanwu adii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:33">kɔwɛɛfɛɛko adii kpile.<verse eid="DEU 32:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 32:34" />“Diele ɔyɔ lɛyɔ nle mmle lɛtɛ lɛta dii kaamaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:34">ni lɛsɛɛ ni lekpee di asaa nii katɛkɔ?<verse eid="DEU 32:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 32:35" />Ɔbla okyisa nwu ole mi kule; kamata letota.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:35">Kɔkpaa lɛma kamafɛntɛ di obe kakuu kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:35">sɛlaa kpile otũ lɛma dii ntɔɔtɛɛtɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:35">di kawɔɔ lɛma kafɔɔ mafua ma nii.”<verse eid="DEU 32:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 32:36" />SAATE nwu kamakanko batii nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:36">annya bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ nyaami</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:36">di obe wɔ ɛɛnya alɛ basinnaa ni osie</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:36">di ɔlanle ee otii wɔ nisiko ni suoto kuonwii diesimbu nii.<verse eid="DEU 32:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 32:37" />Ni ababuɛ alɛ: “Kanunua ɔfɛ nfɛ di bayaa lɛma nwu nkpe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:37">difuɔnkpaa nwu baataniko ni,<verse eid="DEU 32:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 32:38" />bayaa nwu niawee ni oleɔta lɛma sina</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:38">baanyi ni asaaɔta lɛma nta?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:38">Bita ma bataka bayila baakyakaako ye!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:38">Bita ma bata ye kasiɛkɔ!<verse eid="DEU 32:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 32:39" />“Binyu kanuna bilɛ ami omu ninle Nnwɔ nɛ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">Kuonwii nsinaa ale ni yaa akyakaa ni di ami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:39">Nlo otii, nkple nsɛnkɛsa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">Ntika kakɔ́, kamakple nta kankpi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">kuonwii kafɔɔ nnaa abafuo ni otii odiki di nnɛɛ nii.<verse eid="DEU 32:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 32:40" />Lekplesa kɔnɛɛ nii katoo lɛkyɔɔ osi lebuɛ nlɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:40">Lɛnya nsi ni osi nkpa dinaa ni kaloo,<verse eid="DEU 32:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 32:41" />nse lɛlɔɔfɔ kapamii nii ka nikosesee nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:41">di kɔnɛɛ nii lɛkpanko ka di lɛkanko kamɛ yi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:41">kamabla nkyisa di balo nii suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:41">ninnanfi mba niekyidi mi ni kootoko.<verse eid="DEU 32:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 32:42" />Kamata akplɔ nii nnyi ntɔ ansiɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:42">di obe wɔ di kapamii nii kowee ni sina:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:42">mba niɛnɔɔ ni kakpɛ ku balanle nwu ntɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:42">ku balo nwu batunletɛ asi.”<verse eid="DEU 32:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 32:43" />Oo nnle, ku batii nɔɔ, binya suoto lɛyɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:43">diekye ababla ankyisa di bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ ntɔ suoto;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:43">ababla ɔbla okyisa nwu di balo nɔɔ suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:43">anta koto di kasɔ ku batii nɔɔ disi.<verse eid="DEU 32:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 32:44" />Mose lawa ku Nun obisuɔtɔbi Yosua baabaka onu wɔ mmle sɛlaa simuu baata batii nwu lanu.<verse eid="DEU 32:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mose Lɛkakatɛ Yɛntɛle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 32:45" />Obe wɔ di Mose laloo ni sɛlaa se mmle simuu obuɛ ɔtɔkɔ ni Israel batii nwu bamuu yi, <verse eid="DEU 32:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 32:46" />ni aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Biyɔ sɛlaa nwu simuu ntɔɔtɛ lediki lɛtɔkɔ ye ni miɛ dii le mmle bikpee di situ lee, di mmle di ayee biatɔkɔ ni babi lee manlolaa ni kufiofa ko mmle sɛlaa simuu manklee ni nwaa. <verse eid="DEU 32:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 32:47" />Diele sɛlaa fukuti lete sile sita ye- nkpa lee sile. Nsĩ nimata ye minsiɛ nkpa minklɛ di kasɔ ka biɔwaalɛ Yordan Okle minaayɔ ni nɛ.”<verse eid="DEU 32:47" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mose Okpi Di Nebo Kobokote Osi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 32:48" />Di dii nwu nkpo kale SAATE nwu latɔkɔ Mose alɛ, <verse eid="DEU 32:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 32:49" />“Kata fakyɛ Abarim Kobokote fasifi Nebo Kobokote nwu di Moab kasɔ, di Yeriko sɛmaa, faanyu Kanaan, kasɔ ka kɔyɔ nta ni Israel batii fɛ atesaa lɛma amu. <verse eid="DEU 32:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 32:50" />Nfa di kobokote nwu fɛɛkata ni fabakpi fansifi batii lɛfɔ ɔkyɛ nɛ, fɛ mmle di obilee Aron lakpi ni di Hor Kobokote osi aasifi ni batii nɔɔ ɔkyɛ. <verse eid="DEU 32:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 32:51" />Diekye banyɔ lee bitale onukwale biatɛɛ di Israel batii anu di Meriba Kades ntu katũ di Sin Ɔfaafuu, diekye bitayɔ dibu biata leklekle nii di Israel batii kamɛ. <verse eid="DEU 32:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 32:52" />Nkpo oso fabanya kasɔ nwu di kakyonkɔ lete; kafɔɔ flɔbabuo kasɔ nwu kɔyɔ nta ni Israel batii.”<verse eid="DEU 32:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="DEU 33" />
  <para style="s1">Mose Lata Israel Ana Nwu Lɛtɔtrɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 33:1" />Nnya lɛtɔtrɔ sɛlaa se di Mose, Yaa otii nwu labuɛ ni di Israel batii suoto fiɛ aakpi ni. <verse eid="DEU 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 33:2" />Aabuɛ alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:2">“SAATE nwu lakye Sinai Kobokote aawa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">ni aatũ fɛle kufĩ aakye Seir<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">lɛba nwu mankple manlɛɛ Edom nɛ</char></note> aakpete ma di suoto nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">aatũ aakye Paran Kobokote.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:2">Manko baklekletɛ nkpe, nkpe niawa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">Baakye kalakasɔ, di kobokote nɔɔ lɛyɔnsa.<verse eid="DEU 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 33:3" />Nwaako afɔ nimbɔmbɔ batii nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:3">baklekletɛ nwu bamuu nsi fɔ ninnɛɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:3">Nkpaatũ lɛfɔ di bamuu nwakasɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:3">ni munfũ asaa otuo di ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ nɛ,<verse eid="DEU 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 33:4" />kufiofa ko di Mose lata wo ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:4">kule ni Yakob banantii asaa finle.<verse eid="DEU 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 33:5" />Aale ɔka di Yesurun batii suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:5">di obe wɔ di batii nwu batunlatɛ lesi ni dikudi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:5">manko Israel batii ana nwu.<verse eid="DEU 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 33:6" />“Ta Ruben asiɛ nkpa alɛ ɔlabakpi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:6">ee batii nɔɔ babla kafui.”<verse eid="DEU 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 33:7" />Nnya mmle aabuɛ ni di Yuda suoto:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:7">“Oo SAATE, nu Yuda kaku;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:7">kpaa nwɔ fawako batii nɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:7">Nnɛɛ nɔɔ mmu an-yɔ ankpɛ anta suoto.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:7">Oo, le lɛkyakaako nɔɔ di balo nɔɔ suoto!”<verse eid="DEU 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 33:8" />Di Lewi suoto aabuɛ alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:8">“Tumim ku Urim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Asaa anyɔ ya di oletatɛ n-yɔ anwolaa ni Yaa dibiesaa kamɛ</char></note> lɛfɔ nle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:8">otii wɔ feele ni sibualɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:8">Faasɔ nwɔ faanyu di Masa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:8">minko nwɔ biasisikitiko bawo di Meriba ntu katũ.<verse eid="DEU 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 33:9" />Aabuɛ di ote ku ɔya suoto alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">‘Nnaa dibu kuninwii lɛta ma.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:9">Atayɔ dibu aata babilɛma-suɔtɔbi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">ee amufũ babi nɔɔ bamu aaklee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:9">kafɔɔ aanu fɔ ɔlaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">aakyɛ di kanya ninii lɛfɔ osuku suoto.<verse eid="DEU 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 33:10" />Antuo Yakob sisuku lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:10">ni antuo Israel batii kufiofa lɛfɔ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:10">Anfiɛ olufui di anu lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:10">anta ofiɛ asaaɔta omuu di oleɔta akyikye lɛfɔ suoto.<verse eid="DEU 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 33:11" />Oo SAATE, tɔɔ lɛtɔtrɔ di nnɛɛ nɔɔ kamɛ sɛkpɛ simuu suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:11">di nnɛɛ nɔɔ ɔkpɛ kubuo fɔ anu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:11">Fefee mba niɛtaka bayɛ nwɔ ni di suoto ntaduu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:11">sasafɔ balo nɔɔ dilaase di obe wɔ manamasinfuo ni ɔtaka.”<verse eid="DEU 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 33:12" />Aabuɛ di Benyamin suoto alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:12">“Ta SAATE nwu bɔmbɔtɛ atɛ ɔnyɛɛ buɛɛ di SAATE nwu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:12">diekye ntĩtĩi nwɔ di ayi amuu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:12">ni otii wɔ di SAATE nwu mbɔmbɔ ni nsiɛ di amuusi nɔɔ suoto.”<verse eid="DEU 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 33:13" />Aabuɛ di Yosef suoto alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:13">“SAATE nwu ata kasɔ nɔɔ lɛtɔtrɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:13">ku osi kaatoo oblokyi wɔ niefũ ni kɔya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:13">ku ntu kyofole be ninte ni kaalɔ;<verse eid="DEU 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 33:14" />ku asaa nwaa ya di kufĩ nwako ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:14">ku abiene ya di kɔwɛntɛ nta ni;<verse eid="DEU 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 33:15" />ku saa abokote akyɛsaa finle nwaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:15">ku akpenkpe alɛsaa nwu ninaa ni kaloo;<verse eid="DEU 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 33:16" />ku kasɔ nwu akyɛsaa nwaa ku lɛpɔ ninya kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:16">di nnwɔ ninsiɛ ni di owuufa nikofiɛ ni sibualɛ kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:16">Ta n-ya mmle amuu atika di Yosef disi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:16">ale ni tunletɛ wɔ ninsi ni di babilɛma-suɔtɔbi kamɛ.<verse eid="DEU 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 33:17" />Di dibu kanya ate fɛle nankyue dibi-suɔtɔ le ninle ni lelofo kasale;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">akya nɔɔ ninle ɔtrɔmu akya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:17">Akya nwu abayɔ antutukusa nnle an-yu nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">bia mba ninsi ni di kasɔ kayɛntɛkɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:17">Fɛle Efraim batii nkpe lefosi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">fɛle Manase batii nkpe, nkpe.”<verse eid="DEU 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 33:18" />Aabuɛ di Sebulon suoto alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:18">“Sebulon, nya suoto lɛyɔɔ di odie lɛfɔ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:18">afɔ Isakar kafɔɔ, nya suoto lɛyɔɔ di akpanta lɛfɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="DEU 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 33:19" />Babalɛɛ batii manwako kobokote nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:19">ni nfa babata ɔsaabla tinini oleɔta nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:19">babawɛ lɛkpo kamɛ lɛsaawɛ kpinwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:19">di asaa nwaa ya beewofasa ni di ɔtɛnsia kamɛ.”<verse eid="DEU 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 33:20" />Aabuɛ di Gad suoto alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:20">“Bɛɛta lɛtɔtrɔ otii wɔ niɛkpɛnsa ni Gad kasɔ ɛɛkyakaa nii!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:20">Gad nsiɛ ninfa fɛle kyata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:20">ambɛbɛɛ ni kɔnɛɛ ee disi.<verse eid="DEU 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 33:21" />Eediki kasɔ nwaa ɛɛta suoto nɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:21">baayɔ batunletɛ kalekɔ baatɛ nwɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:21">Nse batii nwu asiasi lesi yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:21">ambla di SAATE nwu dibiesaa tinini nwu kanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:21">ku lɛkanko nɔɔ le niɛyɔ nwu ni ole di Israel suoto.”<verse eid="DEU 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 33:22" />Aabuɛ di Dan suoto alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:22">“Kyata dibi di Dan nle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:22">ooyefe andie di Basan.”<verse eid="DEU 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 33:23" />Abuɛ di Naftali suoto alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:23">“Naftali asaa mapɔ diefe ni di SAATE nwu sibualɛ suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:23">lɛtɔtrɔ nɔɔ kafɔɔ leyii nwɔ kamɛ pɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:23">atesaa nɔɔ ninle kalakasɔ diesifi ni lɛpanta.”<verse eid="DEU 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 33:24" />Aabuɛ di Aser suoto alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:24">“Aser ninle nnwɔ bɛɛta ni lɛtɔtrɔ balenke ni di babisuɔtɔbi kamɛ nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:24">ta abuo babilɛma-suɔtɔbi anu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:24">baatɔɔ afoto nkpaa nɔɔ di nnɔnyi kamɛ.<verse eid="DEU 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 33:25" />Kayoko lɛfɔ sibuɛ kamale abɔɔsaa wɛɛfɛɛ ku abɔɔsaa sɛɛle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:25">fabawɛ osie di nkpa lɛfɔ ayi amuu osiɛ kamɛ.<verse eid="DEU 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 33:26" />“Otii kuonwii nnaa fɛle Yesurun Yaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:26">an-fe ni di osi ankyakaako fɔ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:26">ankyɛ di sɛka kanya di alokonkyɛ kamɛ.<verse eid="DEU 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 33:27" />Katanikokɔ lɛfɔ ninle Yaa wɔ ninaa ni kaloo nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:27">kalɔ kafɔɔ nle nnɛɛ be ninaa ni kaloo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:27">Abatososa balo lɛfɔ andiki di anu lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:27">ambuɛ alɛ, ‘Wɔɔsa nwɔ!’<verse eid="DEU 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 33:28" />Nioso Israel batii kamasiɛ lete lɛma di difu dilɔbawɛ nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:28">Yakob ditubiɔ nte di ole kuonwii nnaa nii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:28">di atitabi ku nta fɔle kasɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:28">di nfũ di osi nsoosa ni oblokyi.<verse eid="DEU 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 33:29" />Oo Israel, bɛɛta fɔ lɛtɔtrɔ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">Owe ninte fɛle afɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">batii ba di SAATE nwu lefũ ni nkpa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:29">Nnwɔɔ ninle fɔ kubidifunsaa ku kyakaakotɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">ku lelenkee lɛfɔ kapamii nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:29">Balo lɛfɔ kamawa mamase akunkyi di katũ lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">ni afɔ fabananafu ntakalekɔ lɛma nwu fantɛ kaasɔ.”<verse eid="DEU 33:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="DEU 34" />
  <para style="s1">Mose Kukpi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 34:1" />Ninfɛ di Mose lafe di Moab ɔtaata aakata Nebo Kobokote aasifi Pisga kobokote osi diɛkyɔɔ ni Yeriko anu nɛ. Nfa di SAATE nwu latuo nwɔ kasɔ nwu kamuu nɛ- diayɔ ni di Gilead kaalaase ni di Dan, <verse eid="DEU 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 34:2" />Naftali kasɔ kamuu ku kasɔ ka ninle ni Efraim ku Manase kale ku Yuda kasɔ kamuu kaalaadu ni kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ lekpo, <verse eid="DEU 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 34:3" />Nkpaalɔ kasɔ nwu ku kasɔ nwu kamuu, diayɔ ni di Yeriko Ɔtaata, Awɔsɔ Okpoo Kplɛ nwu dialaadu Soar. <verse eid="DEU 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 34:4" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Nnya kasɔ ka laka ntam labuɛ latɛ lata ni Abraham, Isak ku Yakob di obe wɔ labuɛ ni nlɛ, ‘Kamayɔ ka nta ni banantii lee nɛ.’ Ntɔɔta fɔ fɛɛnya ka ku anu lɛfɔ, kafɔɔ flɔbawaalɛ falaabuo ka.”<verse eid="DEU 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 34:5" />Ni di Mose, SAATE nwu kpɛmblatɛ lakpi di Moab ninfa, fɛle mmle di SAATE nwu labuɛ aatɛ ni nɛ. <verse eid="DEU 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 34:6" />SAATE nwu lakookaa nwɔ di Moab diɛkyɔɔ ni Bet Peor ɔtaata anu, kafɔɔ diɛbase bia miɛ kuonwii dieye nfũ di ɔkya nɔɔ nte nii. <verse eid="DEU 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 34:7" />Mose lafũ kɔlafa alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ fiɛ aakpi, kafɔɔ anu nɔɔ ditabiɛ ee osie nɔɔ kuwakasɔ. <verse eid="DEU 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 34:8" />Israel batii lawi Mose ayi afosi-atiɛ di Moab ɔtaata, dialaase di obe wɔ baaloo ni kaku osiɛ, baayɛntɛ ni kaku.<verse eid="DEU 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 34:9" />Ninfɛ di lɛsaatofo ninwuna layii Nun obisuɔtɔbi Yosua kamɛ nɛ, diekye Mose latika nwɔ nnɛɛ nɔɔ di suoto. Nioso Israel batii lakyɔɔ nwɔ atoko baabla kafɔɔ nle di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ ni Mose.<verse eid="DEU 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 34:10" />Diayɔ ni di obe nwu kamaa, Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ kuonwii diisintaka di Israel batii kamɛ fɛle Mose okle, nnwɔ di SAATE nwu latofo ni anu ku anu, <verse eid="DEU 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 34:11" />nnwɔ niabla ni atuosaa ya niabla ni ɔkpɛ ku asaa ya niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ amuu di SAATE nwu lakpee nwɔ alɛ alaabla ni di Egipte kasɔ- di Farao ku banɔɔfotii nɔɔ bamuu ku kasɔ nɔɔ kamuu suoto. <verse eid="DEU 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 34:12" />Diekye diidii kuonwii diituo osie kplɛ ee sɛsaabla yɛkɛle se mmle okle di Mose labla ni di Israel batii bamuu anu.<verse eid="DEU 34:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 34" />
</usx>